window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3201,"title":"Chapter 3201 Feng Xun’s Injured Stomach","paragraphs":["3201 Feng Xun’s Injured Stomach","“You know the financial situation of the Junwu Empire. Swords with inscriptions are so rare. Even all the elders don’t have one such sword; how can the colonels? We’re on our own.”","Feng Wu had found Feng Xun a sword in the tombs, but that was a while ago, and it wasn’t good enough for Feng Xun now.","He was no longer using it.","Feng Wu said, “Why didn’t you tell me you want such a sword?”","Feng Xun said, “What can I say? You’ve had your Fallen Star Sword for a long time. I wanted to give you a sword; I didn’t even give you a proper gift on your birthday.”","Feng Xun’s voice trailed off. “But, we’re going to lose...”","He was so frustrated.","The girls a few steps away felt sorry when they saw how defeated he was.","He was such a handsome and noble man. Why was he in a bad mood?","Feng Wu gave Feng Xun a complicated look. She really wanted to maintain her image.","If she could, she wanted to look like a lady.","Just then, someone in the arena couldn’t hold it anymore. He ran to the side of the platform and started vomiting into a wooden bucket.","The people of the Junwu Empire were all disappointed.","“We lost again. That’s the third one.”","“We only have two people left, and they still have five giants!”","“How could we agree to this competition? We’re definitely going to lose!”","“Who could have known how cunning the Dongsang assassins are? Those shorties somehow became giants!”","Meanwhile, Babu, the first Dongsang contestant, sneered at the Junwu Empire’s people and taunted them. “Bring it on. Don’t you have anyone useful? They’re all so weak!”","Feng Wu took a deep breath and told herself to think about her image.","Feng Xun rose to his feet and headed for the platform.","“We’re all so weak? I’ll challenge you!” Feng Xun clutched his stomach as he walked.","Before Feng Wu could do anything, Feng Xun was already on the platform.","Feng Wu was astonished!","What was he doing? His injury was so severe! His energy channels had been twisted into a ball! Why did he want to do this?!","As soon as Feng Xun rushed into the arena, everybody cheered for him.","“That’s Young Lord Feng!”","“He’s the best! He’ll win this game!”","“Young Lord Feng won’t lose!”","...","These people had no idea how badly injured Feng Xun was.","“Feng Xun, get down from there!” Feng Wu frowned.","“I won’t!” Feng Xun told Feng Wu, before he stared at Babu. “You can eat a lot, can’t you? Come on! I’ll fight you! Show me what you’ve got!”","Feng Xun sat down on the bench and put a foot on it, looking extremely arrogant.","Babu laughed when he saw Feng Xun. “Young Lord Feng, is it? You’re Jun Linyuan’s buddy. I’ll show everyone how useless you are!”","Feng Wu frowned again. What a presumptuous man!","Feng Xun smirked. “Do you think I’ll lose? I’ll crush you!”","Feng Wu knew that Feng Xun’s stomach was injured."]},{"number":3202,"title":"Chapter 3202 What a Pretty Girl","paragraphs":["3202 What a Pretty Girl","Feng Xun’s stomach was injured. What could he possibly eat? He would probably throw up right away.","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun. “Listen to me, Feng Xun. Get down from there.”","Feng Xun shouted, “No!”","He then challenged Babu. “Bring it on!”","Babu said, “Do you think I’m afraid of you? You’re such a weakling!”","He then sat down on the chair and waved his hand. “Bring me the Golden Blood Cow!”","On both sides of the platform, people were busy roasting food.","At Babu’s command, his people brought him a roast Golden Blood Cow.","Feng Xun’s men were a little slower, but four people soon carried a cow onto the stage as well.","A Golden Blood Cow was 3m long, 2m tall and weighed over 250kg.","Its meat was tender and juicy, but Feng Xun felt his stomach lurch when he looked at the cow.","That was a lot.","Meanwhile, Babu had ripped off a leg and stuffed it into his mouth. After a few bites, there was only a bone left.","Babu had defeated three opponents, and Feng Xun was the fourth.","Babu chewed the meat as he sneered at Feng Xun. He even took the time to make a comment. “What a wuss!”","D*mn it!","Feng Xun was furious.","He would never surrender to his enemy!","“Jun Linyuan’s best friend. Ha!” Babu smirked and ate another leg.","Feng Xun was speechless.","He wondered how the giant could eat so much.","Feng Xun picked up a piece of meat and put it into his mouth, but before he could swallow, he wanted to throw up.","His stomach was injured, and the smell of meat made him want to puke.","He couldn’t swallow a piece of meat, let alone defeat Babu.","Feng Xun was filled with guilt and despair.","So many people were watching. Feng Xun wasn’t worried about being humiliated, but that annoying Babu kept bringing up Jun Linyuan. Feng Xun felt he had let his friend down.","He could lose, but he couldn’t give up.","He forced the meat down his throat.","Ouch...","He wanted to throw up.","No, he couldn’t let that happen!","He had to keep eating!","He didn’t feel well, but he had to keep eating!","The competition had started. Unless one of them gave up, the competition would continue until the incense stick burnt out.","The people of the Junwu Empire held high hopes for Feng Xun because he was the crown prince’s friend. That title gave them a lot of confidence.","However, the reality was a little hard to swallow.","Young Lord Feng ate so slowly.","They didn’t dare complain loudly, but deep down, they weren’t pleased.","Feng Wu was worried when she saw the sweat on Feng Wu’s forehead, and all the whispered gossip made her furious.","Her brother might be a little silly, but he was a lovely person.","Although she scolded him all the time, she wouldn’t let anyone bully him.","Feng Wu glared at Babu and wanted to kill him.","Babu sensed her intense gaze and looked at the crowd.","Wow!","With one look, his eyes lit up.","What a pretty girl!","She was dainty and exquisite.","She seemed to be no more than 14 years old and stood there with her chin raised.","She was from the Junwu Empire.","Babu couldn’t look away from her. He wondered if he crushed the Junwu Empire’s team, could he ask for this girl instead?"]},{"number":3203,"title":"Chapter 3203 Xiao Wu...","paragraphs":["3203 Xiao Wu...","Babu stared at Feng Wu with twinkling eyes. He was so lost in her beauty that he forgot to eat the roast beef.","With the gravy around his mouth, he looked rather gross.","Feng Xun seemed to be in a lot of pain, and sweat trickled down his face.","He noticed that Babu had suddenly stopped, so he followed the latter’s gaze.","!!","He was infuriated by what he saw.","That giant was drooling at Feng Wu, his dearest sister. How dare he!","Feng Xun smashed the bone over Babu’s head. “What are you looking at? Wipe your mouth!”","Although Feng Xun was going to lose, he still shouted in an intimidating way, as if he wanted to kill Babu.","The cow bone hit Babu in the forehead with a thump, and he finally woke up from his trance-like state.","Brushing the bone aside, Babu stared at Feng Xun. “I don’t want the five swords. I want her!”","Babu openly made that request, and Feng Xun was so furious that he laughed.","Holding his stomach, he struggled to his feet and walked toward Babu with the chair in his hand.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple and didn’t know what to do with her silly brother.","With a wave of her hand, she extinguished the incense stick with her blade.","By then, Feng Wu had reached the stage.","Thump!","Feng Wu took the chair from Feng Xun and smashed it over Babu’s head.","Babu was a very capable man.","In the Dayless Woods, he was able to withstand Feng Xun’s attack, and after his giant bloodline woke up, he was even stronger than Feng Xun.","However, he had been fascinated by Feng Wu and didn’t realize that Feng Wu had taken Feng Xun’s chair.","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, don’t stop me.”","Thump!","The chair smashed onto Babu’s head, making him dizzy. He didn’t know what had happened.","The chair had turned into pieces and was scattered all over the ground.","Everyone was speechless.","They looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","A petite girl like her had just hit Babu, a two-meter-tall man, and made him bleed.","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu...”","Feng Wu glared at him. “You can’t even walk. Why do you want to use that chair? Do you have a death wish?”","Feng Xun pouted.","Feng Wu went on. “Are you a kid? Don’t you know your stomach is badly injured? The food can kill you!”","Feng Xun said, “Well...”","“That’s right. Young Lord Feng has a bandage on his face, and he’s been holding his stomach. I didn’t know he was so severely injured...”","“He joined the competition because he wanted to save the Junwu Empire’s dignity.”","“He knew he would lose, but he still stepped forward for our empire. I admire Young Lord Feng so much.”","Those people who had criticized Feng Xun all felt rather guilty.","Meanwhile, Babu finally realized the girl had hit him on the head.","Everybody was watching when that happened, and he couldn’t pretend something so humiliating never happened.","His four giant brothers all stepped forward.","They were quintuplets with similar heights and almost identical faces. One could hardly tell them apart.","Babu glared at Feng Wu. “You!”"]},{"number":3204,"title":"Chapter 3204 No One Can Disrespect His Royal Highness","paragraphs":["3204 No One Can Disrespect His Royal Highness","Feng Wu was mad at Feng Xun for not taking care of his health, when Babu cut into their argument.","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at him.","Babu shuddered, intimidated by her murderous look.","He couldn’t understand it. He was a huge, powerful man. Why did he feel so flustered when the petite girl glared at him?","Babu said, “Why are you so mean?”","Feng Wu was so angry that she wanted to laugh. This man was actually asking that question after insulting her brother.","She cut to the chase. “I’m the fifth member of my team. Let’s begin.”","She then glanced at Wang Zhaole.","Wang Zhaole was a little dumbfounded. “What?”","“Chair! Give her a chair!” Mu Nan reacted before Wang Zhaole could.","“Right!”","Wang Zhaole immediately carried a soft-padded chair onto the stage. It was the one Feng Xun had been sitting on.","The previous chair had been smashed into pieces. Feng Wu couldn’t eat while standing up, could she?","Feng Wu felt frustrated because she wanted to maintain her image as a graceful lady, but this world kept upsetting things and stopping her from doing so.","Thinking of that, she glared at Babu again.","Babu felt so innocent.","They sat down and started eating.","“But...”","No one had any faith in Feng Wu.","That woman?","A petite girl?","She couldn’t have a stomach bigger than a bird’s.","How much could she eat?","A competition?","That was such a joke!","Zuo Qingluan stood in the crowd and narrowed her eyes.","Ever since she arrived at Peace Grassland, she had been overwhelmed with frustration, and Feng Wu was the source of that emotion.","It was as if Zuo Qingluan thought she was the heroine of the story at first, but she then realized she had taken the wrong script and discovered that she was only in a supporting role.","Before she could do anything, Feng Wu started making progress.","By now, Zuo Qingluan couldn’t tell what Feng Wu’s cultivation level was.","Just by watching the way that Feng Wu smashed the chair over Babu’s head, Zuo Qingluan knew she was very capable.","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath, telling herself that she was still the heroine and Feng Wu was the supporting role. “Her advantage must be temporary. Yes!” Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu, her eyes flickering maliciously.","Babu stared at Feng Wu. “What did you say?”","Feng Wu said solemnly, “I’ll compete with you.”","Babu said, “No! I won’t!”","Feng Wu said, “So, you’re too afraid to fight me.”","Babu blushed. “Of course not! I just don’t want to see you cry after you lose.”","Feng Wu grinned. “I won’t be the one who’s crying.”","Feng Xun tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve. “Don’t do this. We’ll admit our defeat. Leave the stage.”","He thought he knew how much Feng Wu could eat.","The girl could eat more than a bird but not by too much. Usually, a bowl of rice would suffice.","Feng Wu didn’t like the sound of that.","She was ready to abandon her image. Why wouldn’t these people believe her?","She could eat a tiger, but they all thought she was as delicate as a bird.","It wasn’t just their opponents. Even her own side thought that way.","Feng Wu said, “The Junwu Empire must win today! I don’t mind destroying other people’s reputation, but it can’t happen to Jun Linyuan!”","She turned to Babu. “If you lose, kneel here and kowtow ten times in the direction where Jun Linyuan is. I’m not asking. I’m telling you.”"]},{"number":3205,"title":"Chapter 3205 Second Round","paragraphs":["3205 Second Round","Babu wanted to say something to Feng Wu, but before he could, the girl had already walked to her table.","Babu was speechless and wondered if he was seeing things.","The girl gave him the feeling that he was a servant and she was a princess.","He was supposed to be a terrifying fighter!","Babu rubbed his swollen forehead and felt dizzy. He wondered if there was something wrong with his senses.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu took a knife and a fork out of nowhere.","Everybody was shocked when they saw this.","“You’ve got to be kidding me!","“A knife and a fork?","“How long will that take?!”","Babu felt sorry for defeating the girl like this.","The competition started while everybody watched in bewilderment.","As Babu chewed on a bone, he wondered, “Should I slow down and wait for her?","“If I finish too soon and she only eats a little, she’ll look ridiculous.”","Babu didn’t know why he was so considerate when Feng Wu had scolded him. He stole a glance at Feng Wu.","One look and Babu was shocked.","Half of the cow was gone!","He looked at the crowd and saw that everybody was watching Feng Wu in amazement.","Their eyes had widened, and their mouths were agape.","The girl ate gracefully, but she wasn’t slow.","Another leg was gone.","Whoosh —","Another leg was gone.","Babu was speechless.","The process only took a few seconds, and he couldn’t believe his eyes.","He rubbed his eyes and kept watching Feng Wu.","The meat on the cow’s shoulder, back, and chest disappeared one part after another.","Before Babu knew what was going on, Feng Wu had eaten all the meat.","When Babu looked at the table again, what was left of the cow was only its skeleton.","Babu was speechless.","At that moment —","“Time’s up! The incense stick is finished!”","The people of the Junwu Empire had been keeping their eye on the incense stick.","They won!","Feng Wu had won!","Feng Xun couldn’t believe it.","His petite sister had just eaten an entire cow.","An entire cow!","Feng Xun wasn’t the only one who was astonished.","Xuan Yi’s face was twisted.","Other people reacted even more strongly.","Feng Wu had eaten an entire cow and defeated Babu.","“We won a round!”","“That’s a miracle!”","“Feng Wu is a miracle-maker!”","...","Everybody was thrilled.","“I’m so glad to have Feng Wu. This way, we won’t lose all five rounds.” Wang Zhaole wiped away his cold sweat. “If that were the case, we would be so humiliated.”","Feng Xun nodded to himself, still recovering from the shock.","His sister could indeed make miracles happen. She had actually won the round.","Babu went off the stage, still feeling dizzy.","He was the fifth member of his team. The fourth was Babei.","Babei patted Babu on the shoulder. “You lost because you ate too much in the first round. Don’t worry about it. I’ll take it from here!”","Babu nodded.","...","Babei walked onto the stage and sneered at Feng Wu in a provoking way."]},{"number":3206,"title":"Chapter 3206 Swallow a Tiger","paragraphs":["3206 Swallow a Tiger","Babei walked onto the stage and sneered at Feng Wu in a provoking way.","“Babu let you win, but I won’t!”","“Let me win?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I won’t let you win, either.”","Babei almost laughed.","The girl actually thought she could defeat him. What a joke!","Babei wasn’t alone. His brothers and the Dongsang assassins all laughed and made mocking sounds.","The people of the Junwu Empire were displeased.","They wanted to refute but didn’t feel confident enough.","Feng Wu had a big appetite, but the other side had three more giants after Babei.","The thought filled them with despair.","Wang Zhaole was nervous.","He had seen how much Feng Wu could eat, but he wasn’t sure how much longer she could last.","Feng Wu looked around. “What are we eating next?”","Just then, a three-eyed tiger was carried onto the stage.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","That tiger was three meters tall, over three meters long, and weighed at least a ton.","It would still weigh over 750kg after the skin and bones were removed.","Feng Wu only has a very small stomach.","While everybody watched in bewilderment, Feng Wu started eating.","Her movements were as graceful as a court lady’s. When she started cutting, her moving hands reminded the others of flying butterflies.","She happened to be wearing a dress with long, wide sleeves today, and when her hands moved, her sleeves created folds that looked like layers of clouds.","With Feng Wu’s good looks, the whole scene became a beautiful painting.","Her appetite was as stunning as her beauty.","What kind of combination was that?","Babei decided it was foolish of Babu to show the girl mercy.","He decided to defeat the girl and step on her back.","“So what if she’s pretty? Does she think that’ll stop me? No! I’ll make her miserable because she’s so pretty!”","Babei ate the meat with great pleasure.","But soon, all that was left of Feng Wu’s tiger was a skeleton, while Babei still had a third of his meat left.","He was dumbfounded.","This shouldn’t be happening.","He wasn’t alone. No one could believe their eyes.","How could this be?","Feng Wu finished the tiger under everybody’s gaze. She couldn’t have cheated.","With so many people’s eyes on her, she couldn’t have hidden the meat in her storage space even if she wanted to.","The only option was to eat the whole thing.","Feng Xun rose to his feet.","Since when did his sister have such a big appetite?","Despite eating so much, she still looked so graceful!","After finishing the tiger, she rested her chin on her hands and smiled at Babei. “Didn’t you say you wouldn’t let me win? I don’t think you tried hard enough. I really want to see how you’ll do that.”","Every word felt like a slap to Babei’s face.","His face turned scarlet red.","Unable to stand the humiliation anymore, he glared at Feng Wu, put down the meat, and ran off the stage.","Only then did the others realize what had happened.","“Xiao Wu won this round!”","“She defeated two people in a row!”","“Victory!”","Feng Xun felt both thrilled and conflicted.","Was this girl who had eaten a whole tiger really his sister?"]},{"number":3207,"title":"Chapter 3207 Wife","paragraphs":["3207 Wife","How much longer could she keep doing this?","Nobody knew the answer.","The people of the Junwu Empire were cheering for Feng Wu, but deep down, they all felt uneasy.","It was soon Basi’s turn.","The giant lost his round before long.","Basi was speechless, and so was everybody in the crowd.","After Basi was Banan.","Everybody thought that after winning three rounds, it was time for Feng Wu to lose.","As a matter of fact —","“What?!”","“OMG!”","“She can still eat!”","“She’s eaten three elephants, two tigers, and two cows! How can she still eat more?!”","“Where does all that meat go?”","Everybody was shocked by Feng Wu’s appetite.","She couldn’t have spit the food out because she never left her chair.","“There’s only one round left!”","“Both sides only have one contestant left. Who will be the final winner?”","At first, the people of the Junwu Empire thought they would definitely lose, but they grew hopeful after seeing Feng Wu’s performance.","“Maybe we can do this.”","However, their jaws dropped when Badong stepped forward.","He had the most successful mutation. He was three meters tall and his shoulders were a meter wide.","When he sat down, he looked like a small mountain.","If the chair weren’t made from a special material, it would have collapsed under his weight.","Feng Wu looked like a dwarf compared with Badong.","He smiled maliciously. “You’re good.”","Feng Wu glanced at him without saying a word.","Badong said, “How about a bet?”","Feng Wu just stared at him.","Badong said, “If I win, you’ll return to the Dongsang Kingdom with me and become the wife of the five of us. How’s that?”","Holy crap!","What a humiliation!","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom all laughed.","Those of the Junwu Empire wanted to kill them.","Feng Xun looked like a furious lion, and Xuan Yi was drawing his sword.","Feng Wu’s eyes glinted coldly as she stared at Badong. “Talking too much will only get you killed.”","She was already looking at Badong as if he was a corpse.","Badong laughed. “Are you saying I’m going to die?","“Think about my offer. If you win, the five of us will be your most loyal servants. Deal?”","He even winked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Badong said, “We’re very capable. All five of us are Level 8 Spiritual Kings. What do you think?”","Feng Wu said, “That sounds acceptable.”","Badong asked, “Is that a yes?”","Feng Wu smirked. “Why not?”","Feng Xun was furious.","“Feng Wu, what are you thinking?!” he bellowed while pointing at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled and waved him off. “I won’t lose.”","Feng Xun didn’t believe her.","“You’ve defeated four giants and must have reached your limit! How much more can you eat? What if you lose?”","If they made a deal with the Dongsang Kingdom, it couldn’t be revoked.","Feng Wu ignored Feng Xun and turned to look at Badong.","She sensed some unusual energy from the five brothers.","Why did they suddenly mutate? What was their secret?","..."]},{"number":3208,"title":"Chapter 3208 Defeated","paragraphs":["3208 Defeated","Feng Wu hadn’t figured out how their bloodline worked. Since they were already here, why not take advantage of this opportunity?","She immediately said yes.","Badong sneered at Feng Wu.","The feast began.","!!","This time, they each had a Golden Lion.","Each lion weighed at least five tons.","Badong buried his face in the food, and Feng Wu also focused on her lion.","The battle had gone beyond the five swords or the dignity of the empire and the kingdom. The most important things were Feng Wu and the five brothers.","The winner could take the loser away.","Badong was very confident in his appetite.","Everybody was watching them nervously.","All eyes were on Badong because he was eating so fast.","Dozens of kilograms of meat soon disappeared into his mouth.","When they looked at Feng Wu, their eyes widened in astonishment.","Feng Wu was eating as fast as Badong, if not faster.","She had wolved down at least 20% of the lion.","Badong was exasperated.","His four brothers shouted from behind him, “Faster! Eat faster! Come on!”","When the four of them shouted in unison, the sound was deafening.","Badong panicked. He kept stuffing more meat into his mouth with both hands.","He didn’t even need to chew before swallowing.","However, he was still slower than Feng Wu.","The others couldn’t believe their eyes.","She was so fast!","How could a lovely girl eat so much?","Was her stomach a bottomless pit?","She only had a third of her Golden Lion left, but Badong had only eaten a third of his.","“Badong, come on!”","“Badong, your freedom is at stake!”","“Badong, eat faster!”","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom cheered for Badong at the top of their lungs.","Mu Yan was among them.","She was only alive because she had activated the five people’s bloodlines with her potion and convinced Mr. Sakiya that she was still useful. What were these five people doing? They were such idiots!","Mu Yan couldn’t understand why Feng Wu had to make trouble for her every single time.","“Badong, you must defeat Feng Wu!” Mu Yan thought.","In the end, Feng Wu finished the lion first while Badong still had a third to go.","The incense stick was still burning.","“Retch —”","He ate too fast to breathe normally and suddenly started vomiting.","The contents of his stomach splattered all over the floor.","Yuck!","Feng Wu quickly stepped away before the vomit got on her.","Everybody stared at Badong. That was so gross!","Even Badong himself was astonished.","What should he do now?","He looked up at the incense stick.","There was only the last 10% left.","Even if he could finish what was left of the lion, he still had to put everything on the ground back into his stomach. Even so, he would take longer than Feng Wu had. He had lost the game.","Feng Wu grinned.","She didn’t say anything and waited for her opponent to give up.","She was 100% sure she was going to win.","The five brothers didn’t stand a chance.","Feng Xun was still dumbfounded.","Was this real?","...","What did Xiao Wu have in her stomach?","She had defeated five giants!"]},{"number":3209,"title":"Chapter 3209 Special Blood","paragraphs":["3209 Special Blood","“We won!”","“We won the game? Really?”","“That’s not possible! We won the game?”","...","!!","The people of the Junwu Empire were silent for a moment before they burst into cheers.","The assassins of the Dongsang Kingdom all stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","They couldn’t understand how this had happened.","Badong wished the ground would open up so that he could jump in.","How humiliating...","All five giants had lost.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “What was our bet again? Remind me. My memory isn’t that good.”","Badong wanted to scream.","His face turned purple.","The people of the Junwu Empire suffered so much humiliation until Feng Wu won the competition for them. They were in high spirits, especially Feng Xun.","Holding his stomach, he ran up the stage and bellowed at Badong, “Screw you! How dare you trick me! Don’t you know how awesome my sister is? She can defeat you by eating alone! She doesn’t even need to fight you!”","Badong’s face flushed, and he stared at Feng Xun. “Do you think you can defeat me in a battle?”","“D*mn you!” Feng Xun was furious.","“So what if you’re a Level 8 Spiritual King? I can still kick your ass!”","Badong said, “Alright. Let’s do it. If...”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “What will happen if you win? What if you lose?”","Badong said, “If we win, we won’t be your servants. If you win...”","“Then what?” Feng Wu smiled at him, not feeling intimidated at all.","“If you win...” Badong said, “Not only will we become your servants, we’ll also tell you who activated our giant bloodline.”","Feng Wu shook her head. Finding that person would be very easy; she just needed to feed the brothers the truth serum. Therefore, the proposal wasn’t appealing to her at all.","She wanted the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, but it was obvious that the five giants wouldn’t have access to the second one.","She thought about it and suddenly asked, “What’re your jobs in the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Yang Zhihu was a Level 9 Spiritual King, and he was the head of the colonels’ quarters. The giants were Level 8 Spiritual Kings, so they had to hold some sort of position.","“We’re team leaders of the special bloodline unit,” said Badong.","Special bloodline unit...","That was interesting.","Feng Wu gave it a thought. “If you lose, you’ll give me a bottle of blood from each member of your unit. How’s that?”","Mu Yan frowned.","“No!” She stepped out and frowned. “Definitely not!”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll take these five people, then.”","Mu Yan went red in the face. “Feng Wu, do you have to give me a hard time like this?”","The five giants would be the foundation of Sakiya’s newly trained Five Elements Formation, which could only succeed with all five of them.","Sakiya would be furious if he knew what had happened.","Feng Wu almost laughed. “Who are you? Why would I deliberately make trouble for you?”","Mu Yan ground her teeth. “Fine. You want a battle? I’ll appoint our contestant. If you win, I’ll give you a tube of blood from each of the members of the special bloodline unit.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really? You want to appoint your own contestant?”"]},{"number":3210,"title":"Chapter 3210 Amazing Sister","paragraphs":["3210 Amazing Sister","“Of course!” Mu Yan pointed around. “Feng Xun, Xuan Yi and Feng Wu, you must all participate.”","She then pointed at two random people: Mu Nan and Wang Zhaole.","Feng Wu chuckled. “What about your side?”","“Badong and his four brothers.” Mu Yan smirked.","!!","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Feng Xun frowned and pulled Feng Wu to the side. “Xiao Wu, you should know...”","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","Feng Xun said, “After taking the potion, they’re all Level 8 Spiritual Kings now, but we’re...”","Feng Wu cut him off and said seriously, “We’ll become Level 9 Spiritual Kings, then.”","What?","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu as if she were an idiot.","Level 9 Spiritual Kings?","She made it sound so easy.","He was only a Level 7 Spiritual King!","Feng Wu looked at Mu Yan. “Gather all the special blood, and we’ll meet again in two hours.”","Mu Yan asked, “Why two hours?”","Feng Wu said, “We need to make breakthroughs. Feng Xun needs to become a Level 9 Spiritual King.”","Mu Yan laughed.","She didn’t want to, but what Feng Wu said was too funny.","She wasn’t alone.","Both the Dongsang assassins and the people of the Junwu Empire looked at Feng Wu as if she were an idiot.","Yes, Feng Wu had amazed them from time to time, such as when she first appeared in the junior arena and when she defeated all her opponents just then.","However, she had just claimed she could raise Feng Xun’s cultivation by two levels in two hours.","That wasn’t possible!","Feng Wu led Feng Xun and Xuan Yi in a different direction.","“Where are we going?”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were both confused.","Feng Wu said succinctly, “You’re taking a bath.”","Feng Xun said, “A bath?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Feng Xun said, “What are you thinking? The competition is about to begin. Why are you taking us to a bath?”","Before Feng Wu could answer, Feng Xun said in a hurry, “Xiao Wu, you’re a clever girl. Why are you doing such a silly thing?”","A silly thing? Feng Wu looked at him in confusion.","Feng Xun was exasperated. “The five brothers are as strong as bears. They all have the giant bloodline and are all Level 8 Spiritual Kings, but I...”","Feng Xun felt abashed but had to tell Feng Wu the truth. “I’m only a Level 7 Spiritual King.”","Feng Wu said, “That low? Even Wang Zhaole is at Level 8 now.”","Feng Xun asked, “What?!”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. You’re my brother. I won’t leave you behind.”","Feng Xun said, “What do you mean?”","Instead of answering the question, Feng Wu said, “Open the door.”","Feng Xun was still hesitating, when Feng Wu took out her Phoenix Pen and wrote “open” on the door.","To Feng Xun’s surprise, the door that was supposed to be opened by his medicine refiner alone suddenly opened.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened, and he gaped.","What did he just witness?","Feng Wu had opened that door with a pen!","He looked at the key in his hand. According to Yang Zhihu, this room was protected by a formation, and only this key could open the door. Anyone cultivating in this room wouldn’t be disturbed."]},{"number":3211,"title":"Chapter 3211 You’re Kidding Me","paragraphs":["3211 You’re Kidding Me","“Come in.” Feng Wu opened the door.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","Why did it feel like Feng Wu owned the place?","Feng Wu went in first.","All the rooms in this area were identical.","Feng Wu’s room had a 3 meter by 5 meter pool for her to bathe in.","As expected, she entered Feng Xun’s room to find the same pool.","Before Feng Wu and Xuan Yi could react, Feng Wu took out her storage bag and started filling that pool.","The liquid she used wasn’t water, but the all-purpose transformation liquid, but Feng Xun and Xuan Yi didn’t know that.","Feng Xun kept staring at Feng Wu. “What’s that?”","Feng Wu explained as she poured, “It’s all-purpose transformation liquid.”","All-purpose transformation liquid? Feng Xun actually knew what that was!","“The all-purpose transformation liquid? Is that the liquid that gives you three lucky draws?” Feng Xun asked.","He had read about it when flipping through some old books in Jun Linyuan’s study.","He had been sitting on the floor while holding the book. He had told Jun Linyuan expectantly, “Boss Jun, I want the all-purpose transformation liquid.”","Boss Jun kicked him, making him spin like a whipping top.","“In your dreams!” Jun Linyuan shattered his dream.","“But why?” Feng Xun felt dizzy from the spinning. He struggled to his feet and complained to Jun Linyuan, “Why? Why?”","Jun Linyuan snorted. “You need to find an essence crystal mine first before you can find the all-purpose transformation liquid, but the chance of finding the latter is less than 0.1%. Do you think you’re that lucky?”","Feng Xun became disappointed and never brought up that request again.","However, he had just heard that name again.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Did you find an essence crystal mine?”","Feng Wu said, “I did.”","She had poured out 40% of the all-purpose transformation liquid that was in her storage bag, and felt that should be enough.","She then put the bag back into her chest pocket.","She needed to keep some for her family and friends in the imperial capital, especially for Chaoge, who needed to pick up her pace before she fell too far behind.","Feng Xun flicked Feng Wu’s forehead with his finger. “Don’t make fun of me! That’s not funny!”","Feng Wu blinked innocently.","Feng Xun asked, “Did you say that was the all-purpose transformation liquid?”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. “Yes.”","Feng Xun said, “Yes? Do you think I don’t know what that is? Do you know how precious...”","Feng Wu kicked him into the pool before he could finish.","Feng Xun fell into the pool and nearly choked.","Xuan Yi was astonished.","He had been greatly impressed when Feng Wu had eaten all those beasts earlier. And now...","“You should go in, too.” Feng Wu glanced at him.","She had no intention of leaving.","She sat down with her legs crossed three meters away from the pool; she was going to guard them while they had the bath.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi exchanged looks, and both seemed abashed.","“Is my sister going to watch while we bathe? That’s so awkward!","“And she said this is the all-purpose transformation liquid. Come on. Does she think I’m a fool? That liquid can give each person three great opportunities.”","But right at that moment..."]},{"number":3212,"title":"Chapter 3212 What Did You Get?","paragraphs":["3212 What Did You Get?","Feng Xun felt a humming in his head.","He then turned around and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","It was so strange!","Xuan Yi, who had entered the pool, turned to look at Feng Xun.","The two of them began to exchange looks of surprise.","“Is this the all-purpose transformation liquid?” Feng Xun asked hesitantly.","Xuan Yi nodded solemnly.","Feng Xun said, “D*mn it. It’s true?”","He was completely dumbfounded.","According to Boss Jun, the all-purpose transformation liquid was very hard to come by. Where did Xiao Wu get it?","Apparently, Feng Wu wasn’t ready to answer him because she was cultivating herself.","The all-purpose transformation liquid didn’t work for her, probably because she had been so lucky recently.","However, it had significantly helped the others.","For instance, Wang Zhaole had risen by two levels.","He had made the fastest progress among everyone else.","Feng Wu didn’t know what would become of Feng Xun, and felt rather nervous about it.","The water turned into an ordinary green shade when Feng Xun came out. Leaving a trail of wet footprints behind him, he sat down in front of Feng Wu and rubbed her head.","Feng Wu didn’t like being touched by his wet hand.","She said impatiently, “What are you doing?”","Feng Xun said seriously, “I just want to check if my sister is a fairy. I see you have a shadow behind you, and I can touch you.”","Feng Wu snorted and smacked Feng Xun’s hand away. “I think you’re talking about a ghost, not a fairy.”","Feng Xun kept his gaze on her. “How can you...”","He didn’t know how to describe his sister.","What did he do to deserve such a wonderful sister?","“Becoming your brother was the best thing that ever happened to me.” Feng Xun sighed.","Feng Wu asked, “Why do you look so serious? What did you get?”","Feng Xun asked, “I gained experience in all three lucky draws.”","Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised. “How many years?”","Feng Xun said, “Enough to make me a Level 9 Spiritual King.”","That was why he was so astonished that he wanted to see if his sister was real.","What had happened was so...","He would give her anything she wanted. She deserved the best!","Feng Wu said, “Make your breakthroughs, then.”","Feng Xun rubbed his nose. “I just find it so out of the ordinary. I can’t believe it. It doesn’t feel real. Is it real?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Do you think you’re alone? Everybody has become stronger.”","Hence, she told him how she had tricked the Military Academy out of mine No. 3 and discovered the all-purpose transformation liquid, how greedy the Military Academy was, and how she had shut them up.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","All the information made him dizzy.","“Don’t you believe me?” Feng Wu poked Feng Xun’s cheek, seeing that he seemed to be dazed.","Feng Xun said, “I do.”","That was why he felt the world had changed when he had only been in the Dayless Woods for a couple of days."]},{"number":3213,"title":"Chapter 3213 You’re Not God’s Daughter","paragraphs":["3213 You’re Not God’s Daughter","Feng Xun believed it, which was why it felt so unreal.","Feng Wu smiled. “Since you’ve obtained so much experience, use it now. We only have less than an hour before the competition starts.”","Feng Xun nodded.","Xuan Yi opened his eyes at that moment.","Feng Xun ran to his side and asked excitedly, “What did you get? Tell me!”","Xuan Yi’s handsome face remained expressionless.","Feng Xun grew even more curious. “What did you gain?”","Xuan Yi didn’t answer. Instead, he closed his eyes and started cultivating.","Feng Xun snorted. “All my three lucky draws gave me cultivation experience. I’ll definitely become stronger than you. I’ll be the second best of the three of us!”","Feng Xun sat down and started cultivating after that.","He and Xuan Yi were both the talented type. They immediately switched to cultivation mode and were no longer affected by the outside world.","Feng Wu guarded them as they cultivated.","Just then, she heard some noise outside.","She frowned a little and went up to the door.","She quietly opened the door and found Yang Zhihu outside, so she left the room and closed the door behind her.","While she was at it, she put an inscription on the door.","She didn’t want someone to disturb Feng Xun and Xuan Yi’s breakthroughs while she was away. She would be utterly frustrated if the two promising young men were affected.","Seeing Yang Zhihu, Feng Wu said, “I see you’ve come out of your seclusion.”","Yang Zhihu had been busy with his cultivation until now.","Feng Wu remembered something.","Elder Helian mentioned before that an elder was to take over the colonels’ quarters because as a Level 9 Spiritual King, Yang Zhihu wasn’t capable enough for his current position anymore.","Before Feng Wu could ask anything, Yang Zhihu patted her head, looking pleased. “You’re a girl of wonder!”","Feng Wu asked, “Did you make a breakthrough?”","Yang Zhihu controlled his excitement and kept a straight face. “Yes!”","Feng Wu walked around him. “You were a Level 9 Spiritual King before. Have you risen to the Spiritual Overlord Stage?”","Yang Zhihu was amazed. “You sure know how to guess!”","Feng Wu asked, “What level are you?”","Yang Zhihu asked, “What do you think? Of course, I’m Level 1. Making breakthroughs isn’t as easy as eating and drinking. You don’t become two levels higher overnight. That only happens in dreams!”","Yang Zhihu found the current situation a little abnormal.","The girl shouldn’t find making breakthroughs so easy because that mentality would harm her progress in the future.","Hence, Yang Zhihu gave her a little speech. “Feng Wu, you have to remember something: Making breakthroughs is a difficult thing. You can’t think it’s easy because of the all-purpose transformation liquid...”","He kept stressing how tough it was to cultivate, fearing that Feng Wu would go down the wrong track.","Feng Wu knew he was right, so she listened carefully.","“It’s very hard to rise two levels at once. Wang Zhaole is the only colonel who has done that.","“Moreover, the breakthrough this time involves collecting your future potential in advance.","“Cultivating is the most difficult task in the world. You can’t be this lucky all the time. It’s not like God is your father.”"]},{"number":3214,"title":"Chapter 3214 My Dear Sister","paragraphs":["3214 My Dear Sister","Just then, there was a noise in the room, and Feng Wu immediately pushed the door open.","As expected, she entered the room to find Feng Xun finishing his breakthrough.","Xuan Yi had also opened his eyes.","They had always been very close in terms of capability, and they even finished their cultivation at about the same time.","!!","Feng Wu wasn’t as capable as they were, so she couldn’t tell how many levels they had risen by observing their spiritual essence.","But Yang Zhihu knew.","Being a Spiritual Overlord, he was more powerful than any of them.","Therefore, he could sense their levels.","The moment he sensed them, he almost forgot to breathe.","“Am I a Level 9 Spiritual King now?” Feng Xun checked himself in astonishment.","He was dumbfounded!","How did that happen?","An hour ago, he was still envying Wang Zhaole because the latter was Level 8 while he was still Level 7. In the blink of an eye, he was Level 9.","Wow!","“I’m Level 9 now! Xuan Yi, did you hear that? I’m a Level 9 Spiritual King now! I’m the second best of the three of us! I’m better than you!”","Feng Xun was so excited that he couldn’t form a coherent sentence.","He had risen two levels in a row!","The last time he made such achievements was back home during his childhood. After that, he had to work on one level at a time like everybody else.","He was so happy with the outcome that he wanted to throw his sister into the sky and catch her with both arms.","However, Xuan Yi glanced at Feng Xun as if the latter were an idiot.","What a familiar look.","Feng Xun sensed Xuan Yi’s spiritual essence and immediately looked like a deflated balloon.","“Why are you a Level 9 Spiritual King, too? Why?!”","Feng Xun was frustrated.","If there were a bed in the room, he would have wrapped himself in a blanket and rolled around in bed.","Why...","Why was it so hard to surpass Xuan Yi?!","Xuan Yi glanced at him before looking at Feng Wu.","She was the girl who had brought them this miracle.","He didn’t say anything and kept his feelings to himself.","His eyes glowed when he looked at her.","I’ll protect you for the rest of my life, no matter what you think.","That’s my own decision.","But...","Feng Wu was rather dumb in that respect. She simply thought Xuan Yi was thinking of her. She had no idea he had made a life pledge toward her.","Feng Xun ignored Xuan Yi and threw himself at Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu, you’re my dearest sister!” Feng Xun looked like a puppy wagging its tail. There were stars in his eyes, and he looked like he could fly.","Yang Zhihu was baffled. Sister? His dearest sister?","He wondered if he was supposed to know that, but he didn’t ask, in case it was top secret.","Feng Xun held onto Feng Wu’s sleeve and swayed it back and forth. “Why are you so pretty? Why are you so awesome? I can’t believe I have such a clever sister. You’re like a fairy...”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She wondered where Feng Xun learned how to extol her to the skies. Was there a school for such things? It sounded like he wouldn’t stop."]},{"number":3215,"title":"Chapter 3215 They’re Too Scared to Come","paragraphs":["3215 They’re Too Scared to Come","Feng Wu said in resignation, “The competition is about to begin.”","Feng Wu had accepted the competition because she wanted Feng Xun and Xuan Yi to practice their skills. She herself didn’t plan to do any actual fighting.","Feng Xun’s eyes immediately lit up.","That was right!","The competition!","Feng Wu and Mu Yan had agreed that each side would come up with five contestants, and Mu Yan had picked out the ones that the Junwu Empire would send.","Feng Xun had complained to Feng Wu about accepting the competition, but now, he just wanted to celebrate this great decision.","“Let’s go! We’ll make them cry!”","He could barely keep both his feet on the ground.","It felt great because the five giants had given them such a hard time earlier.","Feng Xun and his people found the swords first, but the five brothers tried to rob them. After a bloody battle, the two sides agreed to settle the conflict via an eating competition.","However, the five brothers drank some potion that activated their giant bloodline and could suddenly eat so much more. Feng Xun was furious!","He had never been so frustrated in his life and had been trying to vent his anger. Finally, he had found a chance.","Around the arena stage, the people of the Dongsang Kingdom were as arrogant as ever since they thought they would definitely win the competition.","Their five giants were all Level 8 Spiritual Kings, which gave them much more strength.","On top of that, they had determined which Junwu cultivators could participate in the competition.","Feng Xun, Xuan Yi and Mu Nan were all Level 7 Spiritual Kings. They didn’t know Feng Wu’s level and thought that Wang Zhaole, the Level 8 Spiritual King, was the most powerful of them all.","The Junwu Empire didn’t stand a chance!","They couldn’t understand why Feng Wu would agree to fight this battle.","The colonels hadn’t lost all hope.","Was it possible that they still had some all-purpose transformation liquid left?","Even so, it couldn’t guarantee that Feng Xun and Xuan Yi would become Level 8 Spiritual Kings, and that still wouldn’t be enough.","They were so anxious.","Time ticked by, and it was soon time to start the competition that Feng Wu and Mu Yan had agreed on.","However, Feng Wu still hadn’t shown up.","The Dongsang Kingdom was pleased.","Mu Yan raised her eyebrows in satisfaction.","She said, “Time is about to run out. Where’s everybody? Where are the contestants of the Junwu Empire? Where did they go?”","She had her supporters. A girl chimed in, “Are they scared? Did they run away?”","The girl was Yu and was a sweet talker. Her adulation had always made Mu Yan happy, so she took the girl everywhere with her.","“Run away? Really? She agreed to that bet. Will she go back on her word?” Mu Yan feigned a confused tone.","Yu said, “They can’t win the competition and may even get killed. People will laugh at them for running away, but they get to live. I guess they’d rather choose the latter.”","As word of the competition spread, the event attracted much attention, especially since Feng Wu and Feng Xun were involved.","More and more people were gathering here.","The place was packed, and the nearby area was completely surrounded.","The proud people of the Junwu Empire wouldn’t stand for such mockery.","Wang Zhaole retorted, “What do you mean where’s everybody? I’m right here! Feng Xun went to cultivate. You’ll be scared out of your wits when he returns!”","Mu Yan burst out laughing."]},{"number":3216,"title":"Chapter 3216 Let Me Do It","paragraphs":["3216 Let Me Do It","Mu Yan burst out laughing.","She knew Feng Xun’s current level.","She had been trying to capture the general’s son for a while. If she could achieve that, she would do her kingdom a great service.","Once Mu Yan brought Feng Xun back to Sakiya, she could redeem herself for the mistakes she had made.","“Time’s up. Where are your people?” Mu Yan gloated.","Yu echoed, “I think they’re too scared to come.”","Mu Yan said, “It’s not up to them. They took the bet, so they must take this challenge. If they’re too scared, they can surrender!”","She looked around and felt greatly satisfied when she saw the angry expressions of the people of the Junwu Empire.","“Babu, you and your four brothers can come with me.” Mu Yan waved at the five giants.","The five brothers sighed in relief.","They had lost their freedom earlier. Luckily, they had just won it back.","The people of the Junwu Empire were displeased when Mu Yan and her people started leaving.","Wang Zhaole stepped forward. “Have you forgotten about me?”","All eyes were on him.","Mu Yan didn’t expect to hear that, so she looked at Wang Zhaole in bewilderment. “You?”","Wang Zhaole said, “Aren’t I one of the five people you’ve picked out?”","He was right.","Mu Yan had picked the five contestants: Feng Wu, Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Wang Zhaole and Mu Nan.","The first three hadn’t returned yet, but the other two were still here.","Mu Yan looked Wang Zhaole up and down, feeling amazed. “Don’t you know the other three have given up? You’re the only one left. Do you want to die?”","Wang Zhaole said, “Let me repeat this: No one has given up. They’re still cultivating.”","Mu Yan rolled her eyes at him. “What can they possibly do in two hours?”","Wang Zhaole said, “They’ll surprise you!”","Mu Yan laughed. “Surprise me? Are they going to rise a level?”","So want if they could?","That wouldn’t change anything.","“If you have a death wish, I won’t stop you!” Mu Yan turned to the five brothers. “I don’t care who fights this battle. Kill him! Don’t stop before that!”","Babu smirked. “Allow me!”","He attacked Wang Zhaole without a moment of hesitation.","The formidable giant was a Level 8 Spiritual King!","Wang Zhaole could withstand the strikes at first, but he soon began to lose ground.","The people of the Junwu Empire grew anxious.","Wang Zhaole was the most powerful member of the five, but Babu was the weakest of the five brothers.","If Wang Zhaole couldn’t win this battle, would they still have a chance?","No!","Thump!","Babu punched Wang Zhaole in the chest.","The force almost crushed Wang Zhaole’s chest, and the momentum nearly pushed him out of the arena.","He held onto the edge of the stage, stopping himself from falling.","Yang Hong ground his teeth and shouted, “Get down from there, or they’ll kill you!”","Mu Yan had said that in public."]},{"number":3217,"title":"Chapter 3217 Painful Fingers","paragraphs":["3217 Painful Fingers","“Should I let myself fall?”","Wang Zhaole asked himself the question.","The answer was obviously no.","His main task was to stall and wait for the other three to come back.","He had to stay on the stage.","Feng Wu had worked so hard to gain some advantages for them. He couldn’t give them away so easily.","Mu Yan was watching Wang Zhaole.","She thought Wang Zhaole would fall off the stage, but things didn’t go as she had expected.","Wang Zhaole jumped back onto the stage.","“Why is he back?","“Is he an idiot? Why didn’t he take the chance while he had it? Why did he jump back up?” Mu Yan couldn’t understand it.","Babu couldn’t understand it either.","He only sneered at Wang Zhaole in a malicious way.","“If you want to die, I’ll give it to you!”","This time, Babu punched Wang Zhaole in the head.","It was too fast and too powerful to parry.","If Wang Zhaole hadn’t made his breakthroughs, he wouldn’t have been able to withstand the punch.","Still, it didn’t make him feel any better. He was almost struck down.","Babu punched him three times.","Poof!","He swung his giant fist at Wang Zhaole’s head.","Wang Zhaole tried his best to dodge, and had just enough time to protect his vital parts.","The fist brushed past his face.","Thump!","Wang Zhaole was sent flying backward.","He smashed into the ground on his back and kept sliding further away.","His clothes were ripped, and his back was bleeding.","Wang Zhaole dug his fingers into the ground, trying to stop himself.","As he slid, the friction scraped off the first third of his fingers.","When he reached the edge of the stage, he managed to grab it with his maimed hands.","He couldn’t give up.","Mu Nan was far less capable than he was and couldn’t withstand even one punch!","Therefore, Wang Zhaole knew he couldn’t give up.","The others couldn’t bring themselves to see his hands.","What a miserable sight!","There was only a fraction of all his ten fingers left.","His fingers had turned into ten bloody stubs.","The pain must be excruciating!","Everybody’s expressions changed when they saw this.","What a stubborn man! Mu Yan snorted.","Wang Zhaole was trying his best to climb back onto the stage.","However, his hands felt weak, and he was covered in wounds. The pain almost made him faint.","He barely had any strength left.","Just then, a pair of feet appeared in front of him.","Babu stepped on Wang Zhaole’s hands.","“Ah!”","Wang Zhaole screamed.","The sound made one’s hair stand up.","His hands were already badly injured, and Babu had huge feet.","To make it worse, he stomped on Wang Zhaole’s hands.","“Ah!”","Wang Zhaole roared.","That hurt!","He had never been in so much pain before.","...","Wang Zhaole was the only son of an affluent family. Both his father and grandfather were also the only sons of their fathers. As a result, Wang Zhaole had lived an indulgent life as a child. Fearing that he might be spoiled, his father sent him to Imperial College, which was why he ended up in Peace Grassland.","Wang Zhaole had never felt such excruciating pain.","He passed out.","Seeing that Wang Zhaole was unconscious, Babu was bored. He kicked Wang Zhaole off the stage, as if the latter was a broken toy."]},{"number":3218,"title":"Chapter 3218 Master Zhu","paragraphs":["3218 Master Zhu","The colonels saw this coming and caught Wang Zhaole in time.","Mu Yan frowned at Babu, wondering why he only kicked Wang Zhaole off the stage.","Why didn’t he just kill that boy?","Just then!","!!","Mu Yan saw someone approaching them.","Whoosh!","Three people soon reached the arena.","They were Feng Wu, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi.","“Feng Wu!”","They had arrived at a critical moment.","Seeing that Wang Zhaole had collapsed in the colonels’ arms, Feng Wu frowned, but before she could say anything, the others described to her what had happened.","They had forgotten that Feng Wu was only supposed to be a Level 6 Spiritual King, and most of them had higher levels than that.","They all treated Feng Wu as their leader. Everybody was filled with righteous indignation as they complained to Feng Wu about how brutal the Dongsang Kingdom’s people were.","Feng Wu’s face darkened when she saw Wang Zhaole’s maimed fingers.","Mu Yan was still provoking them.","“Where are the rest of your people? One is down. Send the next one.”","Mu Nan wanted to step forward, but Feng Xun stopped her.","He smirked. “I’m right here.”","He then walked up onto the stage with an intimidating aura.","Mu Yan’s eyes glinted coldly when she saw Feng Xun. She told Babu, “He’s the general’s son and Jun Linyuan’s childhood friend. You know what to do.”","She was furious that Babu hadn’t killed Wang Zhaole earlier.","Babu didn’t even look at her.","He would determine how this battle was fought. Why was this woman so meddlesome?","He studied Feng Xun carefully.","He had been confident before that he could crush Feng Xun with a single strike without breaking a sweat, but now, Babu felt uneasy, as if Feng Xun was much more capable than he was.","Both of them were very cautious.","They stared at each other, and neither would make the first move.","In the end, Babu broke the impasse.","Mu Yan thought that given Feng Xun’s age, he couldn’t have cultivated long enough to become a capable fighter.","However, she realized how wrong she was when Feng Xun and Babu finally started exchanging blows.","Babu was on the losing end from the very beginning.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Under Feng Xun’s constant attacks, Babu could only defend himself and had no energy to counterattack.","How did this happen?","Mu Yan was dumbfounded.","That shouldn’t happen. Feng Xun was supposed to be...","“When did Feng Xun become a Level 9 Spiritual King?” Mu Yan heard a voice behind her.","She turned around and saw that it was Zhu Yi, Sakiya’s third disciple.","Next to Zhu Yi was Bu Jingyu, Sakiya’s youngest disciple.","Bu Jingyu looked rather dumb at the moment. Instead of watching the battle, he was watching Feng Wu, who was treating Wang Zhaole’s wounds.","Bu Jingyu even wanted to greet Feng Wu, but Mu Yan stopped him with a stern look.","Bu Jingyu nodded.","“Master Zhu.” Mu Yan greeted Zhu Yi.","Being Sakiya’s third disciple, Zhu Yi was quite a capable cultivator. Mu Yan didn’t know his exact level, but he had to be a Level 9 Spiritual King at least."]},{"number":3219,"title":"Chapter 3219 What Does That Mean?","paragraphs":["3219 What Does That Mean?","Zhu Yi glanced at Mu Yan and nodded at her before turning his attention to Feng Xun.","“Isn’t Feng Xun a Level 7 Spiritual King? When did he rise to Level 9?” Zhu Yi’s face darkened.","The sudden improvement made him feel that things were getting out of hand.","Level 9?","!!","Mu Yan’s smile froze on her face.","Her Dongsang comrades were equally shocked.","Feng Xun had only been a Level 7 Spiritual King two hours ago. Everybody saw it.","But now...","A Level 9 Spiritual King?","Mu Yan turned around and stared at Zhu Yi.","Zhu Yi nodded. “There’s no doubt about it. Feng Xun is a Level 9 Spiritual King.”","Mu Yan sucked in her breath.","She didn’t want to believe it, but she couldn’t change what had happened.","There was a thump, and Feng Xun broke Babu’s rib with a kick.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Babu couldn’t believe it either. He stared at Feng Xun and said, “You won’t be able to do it again!”","Feng Xun leapt into the air and broke Babu’s second rib.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Babu stumbled backward and bellowed at Feng Xun. “Bring it on!”","Feng Xun smirked.","Although all his lucky draws gave him cultivation experience, he was especially lucky today because the strength of his legs had been enhanced.","His legs felt like they were filled with endless power.","He hadn’t made the best use of them yet.","Since Babu wanted to try him out, he would give the giant that chance.","Feng Xun moved.","Invisible energy seemed to spread from his right leg.","Babu’s face darkened, and he had a bad feeling, but he wouldn’t accept what was happening.","He was a Level 8 Spiritual King with the giant bloodline. So what if Feng Xun was a Level 9 Spiritual King? He had just become one! Babu believed he could withstand Feng Xun’s kick.","He wouldn’t give in.","“I’ll break you!”","Feng Xun raised his leg, and his kick felt like a tornado.","A wave of energy rushed toward Babu.","“You can’t defeat me!” Babu crossed his arms in front of his chest.","He wasn’t afraid of Feng Xun.","The next second, there was a loud thump, and Babu was sent flying backward as he made an arc in the air.","“What?”","Everybody cried out in surprise.","The arrogant Babu felt utterly humiliated.","Mu Yan looked like her eyes were going to pop.","She stared at Feng Xun and Feng Wu in turn.","Feng Xun hadn’t been so capable before. Something must have happened when Feng Wu took him away for two hours.","“Find out what happened!” Mu Yan whispered to Yu.","Yu nodded and soon disappeared into the crowd. No one knew where she went.","Zhu Yi frowned a little. “Feng Xun’s kick...”","Mu Yan had suggested this bet.","If the Dongsang Kingdom lost, she would have to take responsibility.","She didn’t want Zhu Yi to see her lose the bet.","Therefore, she promised Zhu Yi that what happened to Babu was only an accident, and it wouldn’t happen again.","Zhu Yi looked at Mu Yan in a strange way.","Mu Yan was perplexed.","Zhu Yi frowned at her. “Miss Mu, you should focus on your medical skills. Martial arts aren’t your thing.”","Mu Yan was irritated.","What was that supposed to mean?","Bu Jingyu chuckled. “My senior brother is saying that you should stick to your pills.”","..."]},{"number":3220,"title":"Chapter 3220 Grand Kick","paragraphs":["3220 Grand Kick","Mu Yan wanted to slap Bu Jingyu.","However, Bu Jingyu hid behind Zhu Yi and made faces at Mu Yan.","Mu Yan was furious.","Meanwhile, the second giant walked onto the stage.","!!","It was Babei.","The purity of the five brothers’ bloodline was ranked according to their ages. Badong’s was the purest, and Babu had the least pure blood of them all.","Babei was slightly better than Babu.","“Feng Xun, bring it on!”","Babei challenged Feng Xun.","Feng Xun snorted. “What are you waiting for?”","Less than five minutes later, Feng Xun kicked Babei off the stage while he stood there without a scratch on him.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","They couldn’t believe their eyes.","Feng Xun won!","He had won two games in a row!","Resting his hands on his waist, Feng Xun shouted at the Dongsang Kingdom’s people. “Anyone else? Who’s next?!”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead, finding her brother rather idiotic. She wished she didn’t know him.","The five brothers were all infuriated by Feng Xun.","Basi was next.","Unfortunately, he didn’t last long before Feng Xun kicked him off the stage.","How did this happen?","Everybody was baffled.","How was this possible?","However, they panicked when Banan also fell off the stage.","“Hahahaha —”","Feng Xun had never been so pleased with himself before. Resting his hands on his waist, he shouted at the Dongsang Kingdom’s side. “Is there anyone else? Anyone?”","Badong took a deep breath and opened his eyes.","Zhu Yi spoke at that moment.","“Watch out for his kick. Try not to give him any chance.”","Badong nodded.","Meanwhile, the people of the Junwu Empire were over the moon.","“Wow! We’ve turned things around!”","“Today must be our lucky day! We’ve turned the tide twice already!”","“The Dongsang Kingdom must be furious!”","...","Badong wouldn’t accept it.","He was the most capable of the five brothers because he had the purest bloodline.","His strength came from his giant bloodline.","His battle against Feng Xun started while everybody watched excitedly.","It was the most intriguing battle so far.","Once Badong successfully topped Feng Xun’s kicks, the game reached a stalemate.","Badong punched with fists as heavy as large rocks.","Although Feng Xun was a Level 9 Spiritual King, he probably couldn’t withstand a direct punch.","Feng Xun barely had a chance to attack.","When he finally found an opportunity to use his kick, he was soon interrupted.","Thump!","Badong kicked at Feng Xun’s right shin, and the latter grimaced in pain.","That hurt!","Feng Xun confronted Badong with a limp.","However, Badong had seen Feng Xun’s weakness and kept attacking the injured leg.","The energy felt like a tidal wave.","Feng Xun’s face darkened, and he kept falling back.","Meanwhile, Zhu Yi smiled in satisfaction and murmured, “If Feng Xun can fuse with my master’s Grand Kick, the enhancement of his legs would be a real transformation. Otherwise...”","Zhu Yi was only mentioning it in passing, but somebody was listening carefully.","...","Feng Wu was concerned with the battle, so she didn’t miss Zhu Yi’s comment.","She glanced at Zhu Yi."]},{"number":3221,"title":"Chapter 3221 Miracle Doctor (1)","paragraphs":["3221 Miracle Doctor (1)","Feng Wu involuntarily glanced at Zhu Yi.","Sensing her gaze, Zhu Yi looked back at her.","Their eyes met. Feng Wu nodded at him and raised her hand.","Zhu Yi rubbed his chin. Somehow, he felt the beautiful girl was thanking him. Was he overthinking it?","!!","By then, the competition had come to an end.","Feng Xun was kicked off the stage, but Badong didn’t look any better.","Frustrated, Feng Xun wanted to run back onto the stage. Feng Wu shook her head, stopping her brother right away.","Feng Xun said, “Let go of me! I’ll kick his ass! Don’t stop me!”","Feng Wu said, “Practice your kicking first. Don’t worry. Xuan Yi will get back at him for you.”","Only then did Feng Xun calm down.","Xuan Yi was a promising swordsman.","Unfortunately, the girl he cared about was treating Feng Xun’s leg. She didn’t see any of his marvelous moves!","Badong was a tough fighter, but Xuan Yi eventually defeated him.","The Dongsang Kingdom lost the battle.","Mu Yan was dumbfounded.","The Dongsang Kingdom had used all five contestants, but the Junwu Empire still had Feng Wu and Mu Nan left.","No one could challenge the result.","Mu Yan began to panic, and so did the five giants.","Seeing their expressions, Zhu Yi asked, “What’s the bet?”","Bu Jingyu was equally curious, and he looked at Mu Yan.","However, Mu Yan didn’t dare answer that question.","She kept her head low, embarrassed.","Someone else told Zhu Yi, “The stake for the first competition was five swords with inscriptions, but the five giants raised the stake on their own and made themselves part of it as well. They ended up losing that eating competition.”","It was Hirano, an assassin from the Dongsang Kingdom, who spoke.","Zhu Yi frowned. “It’s one thing to lose five inscription swords, but the five brothers?”","He stared at the giants.","This time, the five brothers stood in a row like five bears. They lowered their heads and looked dejected.","Zhu Yi was in charge of a hundred people who were as capable as the colonels of the Junwu Empire.","That was to say, Zhu Yi had a similar ranking to Yang Zhihu.","When Zhu Yi looked at the five giants, none of them dared to move.","Hirano continued, “After these five people lost, they were unwilling to accept it, so Mu Yan initiated a martial arts competition. The bet was that if we won, the five of them would regain their freedom and wouldn’t become the Junwu Empire’s slaves. If we lost, then...”","Hirano, who was a bystander, couldn’t bring himself to go on. He only frowned.","“Then what?” Zhu Yi pressed.","Hirano looked at Miracle Doctor Mu Yan and sighed. “Mu Yan said if the Junwu Empire won, we would provide them with bottles of blood samples from each of the special bloodline warriors.”","“Nonsense!”","Zhu Yi was genuinely angry.","He glared at Mu Yan.","Mu Yan wasn’t even qualified to study the special bloodlines. They belonged to her master!","The special bloodlines were the Dongsang Kingdom’s trump card. In the future, they could be used against the Junwu Empire. If she gave the blood samples to their opponents, it was equivalent to giving them the key to that secret!","Mu Yan would ruin the Dongsang Kingdom’s great plan!","Seeing how angry Zhu Yi was, Mu Yan muttered, “The best medicine refiner in the Junwu Empire is only at the Supreme Level. What can they possibly find out?”"]},{"number":3222,"title":"Chapter 3222 Miracle Doctor (2)","paragraphs":["3222 Miracle Doctor (2)","Of course, Zhu Yi knew that the Junwu Empire was inferior in medical skills, formations, and inscriptions.","The Junwu Empire knew little of these skills.","But what if they knew something?","Zhu Yi glared at Mu Yan, then turned to Feng Wu. “I hope I can buy back all five of them.”","!!","Feng Wu looked at him indifferently. “We agreed on a bet. Can you change it so casually?”","Zhu Yi was speechless.","Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","He was impressed!","He didn’t dare say a word around Zhu Yi, but she was bold enough to talk back!","Wait. She had even tricked his master.","Thinking this, Bu Jingyu didn’t dare make a sound.","The secret was known only to him and Feng Wu.","Zhu Yi asked Feng Wu, “Is it unnegotiable?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Zhu Yi nodded at Feng Wu and left.","Seeing this, Mu Yan was flustered.","“Master Zhu!”","However, Zhi Yi had no intention of helping her.","Mu Yan turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “I know the Junwu Empire has little medical skills, so I’ll make a deal with you!","“I’ll never give you the special blood, but...”","Mu Yan took out a bottle of potion from her sleeve and gave Feng Wu a condescending look. “This is a Semi-divine Golden Crow pill refined by my master. It’s a healing pill! You’ve never seen it before in the Junwu Empire! This is a treasure that even your emperor would want to keep for himself! Take it!”","Mu Yan was extremely arrogant, and her tone was filled with disdain.","Looking at the Semi-divine Golden Crow Pill in Mu Yan’s hand, Feng Wu gave her a strange look.","Feng Xun also stared at Mu Yan in amazement, wondering if this woman was an idiot.","The ointment Feng Wu applied on his face just now was a Semi-divine one. Even the emperor would want it for himself? Was she stupid?","Feng Xun was a hot-tempered little fiend. How could he allow Mu Yan to do as she pleased?","However, before Feng Xun could lose his temper, Feng Wu gave him a nudge.","What a silly man.","If Mu Yan knew Feng Wu was a Semi-divine medicine refiner, the latter wouldn’t give Feng Wu the special blood.","Feng Wu stared at Mu Yan. “I don’t want that. I only want the special blood.”","She needed to study it.","To be honest, the Dongsang Kingdom was a lot better in terms of medical skills.","Mu Yan frowned at Feng Wu and said irritably, “Why are you so stubborn?!”","Feng Wu smiled at her. “I only want the special blood.”","Mu Yan said, “If one bottle isn’t enough, I may be...”","Feng Wu still smiled at her. “I only want the special blood.”","Mu Yan said, “I won’t give it to you! You can stop dreaming!”","Feng Wu immediately caught the loophole.","Taking the hint, Feng Xun started yelling. “OMG! Did you hear that! The Dongsang Kingdom has no credibility! They lost the bet and won’t admit it! If you can’t afford it, don’t make the bet in the first place!”","Feng Xun was a popular man, and it was clear enough to everybody what he was getting at.","Hence, all sorts of mocking voices filled the air.","“Oh my! The Dongsang Kingdom won’t keep their word!”","“The Dongsang Kingdom is shameless! Everyone, come and take a look! The Dongsang Kingdom is shameless!”","“The Dongsang Kingdom...”","Instead of criticizing Mu Yan, the people of the Junwu Empire denounced the Dongsang Kingdom as a whole, and the people of the Dongsang Kingdom were furious."]},{"number":3223,"title":"Chapter 3223 Miracle Doctor (3)","paragraphs":["3223 Miracle Doctor (3)","Mu Yan had caused the trouble. Why should the kingdom take the blame?","The Dongsang Kingdom didn’t belong to Mu Yan alone!","However, they couldn’t refute the Junwu Empire, because the latter was right.","Mu Yan had no idea how hard it would be to deal with Feng Wu.","!!","She glared at Feng Wu with hatred in her eyes.","She tried to think if she had anything on Feng Wu.","There was indeed something.","Feng Wu and the crown prince seemed to be in a secret relationship, and Mu Yan thought only she knew. However...","Mu Yan wondered if it would harm or help Feng Wu if she revealed that secret.","Frankly, if someone said Mu Yan was in a relationship with the crown prince, she would be thrilled.","Therefore, she couldn’t tell anyone. Other than that, she didn’t have anything else on Feng Wu.","Mu Yan stared at Feng Wu. “Is there really no other way? For example, I can give you inscriptions and formations...”","The surrounding people looked at Mu Yan eagerly. The Dongsang Kingdom’s inscriptions and formations were extraordinary!","The items that Mu Yan offered had to be good!","“The Dongsang Kingdom has a team of eagles. They rely on formations to tame them.","“They also have inscription bombs. If the eagles drop them from the air, they can cause a lot of casualties. If they activate their major weapons...”","The people of the Junwu Empire had been bombed before, so they were still scared.","Hearing the discussion around them, Mu Yan gave Feng Wu a sidelong glance. “What if I give you five giant spirit eagles? I can also give you inscription bombs. How about ten?”","Mu Yan had thought Feng Wu would agree, but Feng Wu gave her a strange look. “Giant spirit eagles? Inscription bombs? What are those?”","Mu Yan looked at Feng Wu in surprise, as if she was looking at a country bumpkin.","She raised her voice agitatedly. “Are you so ill-informed? You don’t even know about giant spirit eagles? You haven’t even heard of inscription bombs?”","She didn’t try to hide the disdain in her eyes.","Feng Xun glared at Mu Yan. “This is Xiao Wu’s first time in Peace Grassland. Why is it so strange that she doesn’t know what giant spirit eagles and inscription bombs are?!”","After that, Feng Xun explained to Feng Wu what those things were.","Feng Wu was amazed.","So, the giant spirit eagles were equivalent to fighter jets in the modern world.","Inscription bombs? That name was self-explanatory. They were made of special materials and inscriptions, and could blow up cultivators above the Spiritual King Stage.","Without inscriptions, ordinary bombs wouldn’t be able to injure cultivators above that stage.","Feng Wu said, “I didn’t know such things existed.”","Feng Xun said grimly, “They do exist, but we...”","Feng Xun didn’t finish his sentence, but Feng Wu knew what he meant.","He was saying that the Junwu Empire was so behind in these arts that it had neither of those.","“Indeed, we don’t have any giant spirit eagles because that involves an extremely profound formation. It’s not something that two Level 8 inscription masters can control. As for inscription bombs, it’s not like we don’t have any, but...”","Feng Xun whispered to Feng Wu, “Ours are weaker than theirs.”","Feng Xun tried to downplay it, but Mu Yan didn’t give him that chance. “Weaker? I think you mean much weaker!”"]},{"number":3224,"title":"Chapter 3224 Miracle Doctor (4)","paragraphs":["3224 Miracle Doctor (4)","Feng Xun tried to downplay it, but Mu Yan didn’t give him that chance. “Weaker? I think you mean much weaker!”","Feng Xun was so angry that he wanted to punch her to death.","He was so mad!","So was everybody in the Junwu Empire.","!!","Feng Wu stared at Mu Yan. “Is that true?”","Mu Yan said, “Of course.”","Feng Wu tilted her head and gave it some thought.","Actually, giant spirit eagles and inscription bombs were very useful, especially the latter. She could do a lot of things with them.","Feng Wu smirked inwardly but kept her face calm. “Deal.”","Mu Yan had thought Feng Wu would try to bargain, but she didn’t expect Feng Wu to agree so easily. What a surprise. She decided Feng Wu was too short-sighted.","Mu Yan glanced at Yu.","Yu soon brought forward a wooden box.","There were a total of ten inscription bombs in the box.","Feng Wu frowned. “Is this the latest model?”","Feng Xun nodded at Feng Wu. “That’s right. I’ve seen them use it before. It’s very powerful. It can’t kill us, but it can stop us for a moment. When experts fight, a moment’s delay can be fatal.”","Feng Wu nodded and turned to Mu Yan.","She wanted to see the giant spirit eagle now.","Mu Yan stared at Feng Wu and gave her a strange smile. She could give Feng Wu the giant spirit eagle, but it was up to the latter to control it.","Just then, Yu carried a small giant spirit eagle over with both hands.","Feng Wu had thought that the giant spirit eagle was a living creature, but she was wrong...","It turned out that ‘giant spirit eagle’ was only a title.","It was a manufactured aircraft that was only big enough to fit one person, but there was a lot of space at the bottom, which was reserved for fuel and inscription bombs.","As expected, the Dongsang Kingdom was very advanced in such technologies.","Mu Yan was ready to take the five giants away, but Feng Wu said, “Stop.”","Mu Yan turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “I’ve already given you what you want! We’re even now!”","Feng Wu smiled. “That’s right. Our account is settled now, but...”","She pointed at the five brothers. “They haven’t settled theirs yet.”","Theirs?","Mu Yan said angrily, “But what I gave you...”","Feng Wu cut her off. “As a matter of fact, you know very well what you just gave me is worth far less than all the special blood.”","Mu Yan said, “That’s not true. I was...”","Feng Wu said, “That’s true because you offered them to me without hesitation.”","Mu Yan was speechless. She stared at Feng Wu, wondering why the latter was so clever.","Feng Wu was right. The giant spirit eagles and the inscription bombs were indeed high-level items in the Dongsang Kingdom. However, she still had some authority, so she didn’t feel the pinch at all when she gave them away. However, all the special blood...","Even if her master could forgive her, Mr. Sakiya would still want to kill her.","In the end, they finally came to an agreement.","The Ba brothers didn’t have to be Feng Wu’s slaves, but each of them had to leave a bottle of blood for Feng Wu.","Between becoming slaves and losing some blood, anybody would choose the latter.","The brothers took action as soon as Feng Wu made the request.","Five bottles of fresh blood were soon brought to Feng Wu.","Mu Yan left with the five brothers, feeling proud of herself.","Being a member of the Dongsang Kingdom gave her a sense of superiority."]},{"number":3225,"title":"Chapter 3225 Inscription Girl (1)","paragraphs":["3225 Inscription Girl (1)","The sense of superiority mainly came from the fact that the Dongsang Kingdom had mastered these technologies, but the Junwu Empire hadn’t.","However, Mu Yan had no idea what she had traded away.","Feng Xun gave Feng Wu a strange look. “Why didn’t you ask for more? There’s only one giant spirit eagle and ten inscription bombs. What’s the point?”","Of course they were useful. Feng Wu smiled at Feng Xun but didn’t give him an explanation.","Feng Xun rubbed his head. “We don’t know how to use the giant spirit eagle.”","This was the first time Feng Wu had seen something like this.","No one knew if Mu Yan did it on purpose, but the hatch of the giant spirit eagle was tightly shut. In other words...","If they didn’t crack open this hatch, they wouldn’t even be able to enter.","Feng Xun seemed to have thought of something, and flew into a rage. “That Mu Yan! She didn’t give us the key to the inscriptions! We can’t open it without the key!”","The surrounding people were furious. How could that woman be so mean?!","At this moment, a group of people arrived, panting from running.","The leader was Elder Mu, and behind him were his disciples. At that moment, they were running toward Feng Wu and Feng Xun in a hurry.","“Quickly, take the giant spirit eagle away.” Elder Mu waved at his disciples.","The four young men immediately rushed toward the flying machine.","Feng Wu looked at them in bewilderment and wondered what they were doing.","“Hey!” Feng Xun intervened and stared at Elder Mu. “What are you doing? The giant spirit eagle is ours.”","The others around them also gave Elder Mu strange looks.","Elder Mu frowned and glared at Feng Xun impatiently. “Young Lord Feng, this isn’t the time for you to make trouble. Step aside.”","Make trouble?","Feng Xun was furious.","Elder Mu had come with a group of people to steal his sister’s things, but this old fool was accusing Feng Xun of causing trouble? Feng Xun was amused.","“I’m making trouble? What kind of logic is that?” Feng Xun stared at Elder Mu.","Elder Mu’s face darkened as he stared at Feng Xun. “Young Lord Feng, this is a giant spirit eagle. It’ll determine the future of the Junwu Empire!”","Feng Xun asked, “So?”","Elder Mu reprimanded Feng Xun in the manner of a senior. “We’ll start studying it as soon as we bring it back. We’ll be able to replicate it soon! Once we can do that, Young Lord Feng, we won’t be suppressed by the Dongsang Kingdom in the future! Do you know that?!”","Feng Xun said, “Wait. Other things aside, my sister won this giant spirit eagle, didn’t she?”","Elder Mu glanced at Feng Wu. “That’s true, but there’s a limit to what’s important...”","Feng Xun waved his hand. “I don’t care about your limit. All I know is that this belongs to my sister. No one is allowed to touch it!”","After that, Feng Xun stared at the four disciples of Elder Mu.","Feng Xun was already a Level 9 Spiritual King, and no one could withstand his aura.","Therefore, the four disciples panicked and let go of the machine.","They looked to their master for help.","Elder Mu’s face flushed red. “Feng Xun! You don’t know what you’re doing!”","At this moment, another group of people rushed over.","It was Elder Yan, who had received the news.","By now, Yan Han had already come out of seclusion, so she followed behind Elder Yan.","Elder Yan was also an inscription master, so after hearing this news, he rushed over like a madman.","“Giant spirit eagle! Giant spirit eagle!”"]},{"number":3226,"title":"Chapter 3226 Inscription Girl (2)","paragraphs":["3226 Inscription Girl (2)","Elder Yan was also an inscription master, so after hearing this news, he rushed over like a madman.","“Giant spirit eagle! Giant spirit eagle!”","Before Elder Yan arrived, everybody could hear his excited voice.","When Elder Mu heard Elder Yan’s voice, he immediately frowned.","“Yan, why are you here?” Elder Mu didn’t look happy.","Elder Yan looked at Elder Mu and immediately laughed. “That’s because I heard that there’s an intact giant spirit eagle. That’s why I rushed over to take a look. I don’t want it to be taken away in a scam. If that happens, I’ll never be able to get it back.”","What Elder Yan said was more than a suggestion; it was more like a veiled threat.","Elder Mu sneered. “You make it sound like you had an intact giant spirit eagle previously.”","Giant spirit eagles were hard to come by.","Even in the Dongsang Kingdom, it was extremely precious. The Dongsang Kingdom didn’t use it casually. Once used, the eagle would definitely cause an earth-shattering effect.","For example, a large wave of inscription bombs could be dropped, causing a mess.","With the giant spirit eagle, the Dongsang Kingdom could control the sky.","Back then, the Junwu Empire’s fortress had been attacked by giant spirit eagles and inscription bombs. At that time, the fortress was almost in ruins.","Later on, Feng Xiangnan, the general of the fortress, came forward and negotiated with Xue Zhibei, the general of the other side’s fortress, and an agreement was signed.","No one knew what price the Northern Feng General had to pay before the Dongsang Kingdom finally stopped taking control of the sky.","The two sides had been preparing their troops at the border and training their younger generation of cultivators. There was no big battle, but there was constant friction.","The Junwu Empire had caught giant spirit eagles before, but they were always broken. This was because the giant spirit eagle would self-destruct, and no one in the Junwu Empire could stop it.","Hence, Elder Mu glared at Elder Yan. “Now isn’t the time for you to cause trouble. This giant spirit eagle will self-destruct very soon! Do you still want to fight with me over this?!”","Elder Yan thought about it and agreed.","Yan Han darted a look at Feng Wu and said in an arrogant tone, “Did you hear that? I told you to get out of the way!”","In terms of inscriptions, Yan Han believed only her grandfather and Elder Mu were the strongest on Peace Grassland. No one else could compare with them!","Elder Yan glared at Yan Han. “Shut up! Apologize to Feng Wu now!”","Elder Yan had seen how capable Feng Wu was.","Feng Wu didn’t bat an eye when confronting Elder Dongfang, but Yan Han dared to provoke her. Elder Yan was almost scared out of his wits!","Elder Yan smiled apologetically at Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, this giant spirit eagle...”","Feng Wu gave him a strange look.","Didn’t Elder Yan see her break the protective shield earlier?","Feng Wu tried her best to think back. Elder Yan had been sitting a few steps away from the protective shield, and he hadn’t seen her use the Phoenix Pen to crack the inscription shield... No wonder he was trying to get the giant spirit eagle.","However, Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m afraid you can’t have it.”","Before Elder Yan could say anything, Feng Wu gave Feng Xun a look.","Of course, Feng Xun understood what Feng Wu meant. Hence, he picked up the giant spirit eagle single-handedly.","“Let’s go!” Feng Xun was ready to leave.","He didn’t forget to yell at Xuan Yi as he walked, “Inscription bombs! Don’t forget the inscription bombs!”","Xuan Yi didn’t answer him, but he did catch up with Feng Xun with the box of inscription bombs in one hand.","Feng Wu watched from behind as Xuan Yi carried the inscription bombs as if they were beer in a basket..."]},{"number":3227,"title":"Chapter 3227 Inscription Girl (3)","paragraphs":["3227 Inscription Girl (3)","Feng Wu followed him right away.","At that moment, Elder Mu and Elder Yan were anxious.","Elder Mu stomped his foot in exasperation. “How can she be so insensible? How can she not care about the big picture?!”","Elder Yan didn’t know what to say since he also thought Feng Wu was messing around.","!!","“We can’t let her ruin such a rare item!” Elder Mu glared at Elder Yan.","Elder Yan shrugged.","“Elder Helian must hear about this!” Elder Mu wanted Elder Yan to go with him, but Elder Yan wasn’t sure about this decision.","That was because he remembered very clearly that Feng Wu had a powerful background. She could even pat Mr. Xu on the shoulder and call him Old Xu.","Elder Mu, Elder Yan and the rest of them left as quickly as they came.","However, the onlookers had yet to leave.","They usually focused on cultivation, so it was rare for them to have the time to participate in something completely irrelevant. However, they were rooted to the spot for a long time and even discussed it with their companions.","“Feng Wu... I don’t think she’s going to hand over the giant spirit eagle.”","“She won the giant spirit eagle. She can do whatever she wants with it. Right?”","“That’s true, but it’s about the overall situation. By doing this, isn’t she a little... short-sighted?”","“I don’t know if you’ve noticed, but Elder Mu and Elder Yan don’t seem to be able to do anything to her.”","Peace Grassland had a strict hierarchy. When subordinates saw their superiors, they were all in awe, and the crowd hadn’t dared to say a word when the two elders were around just now.","However, Feng Wu turned the two elders down right away, which was incredible.","Everyone discussed and said all sorts of things.","A figure in the crowd stared at Feng Wu for a long time.","It was none other than Zuo Qingluan.","After arriving at Peace Grassland, Zuo Qingluan had the most complicated feelings.","Back at Imperial College, she used to be the vice dean, and Feng Wu was only a student.","Back then, she had looked at Feng Wu with disdain and hadn’t even bothered to deal with her.","However, after arriving at Peaceful Grassland, it was as if Feng Wu had taken a growth potion, and her cultivation had progressed at an incredible speed!","Zuo Qingluan had never seen anyone cultivate so fast. She began to panic.","Every time she saw Feng Wu, she would feel both proud and superior. She despised Feng Wu but couldn’t stop feeling flustered. In this sort of situation, she had tried her best to cultivate and had almost suffered from the deviation of her spiritual essence. She used up all the elixirs she had.","Finally, she became a Level 3 Spiritual King.","But Feng Wu... If the information was right, she was already a Level 6 Spiritual King!","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and clenched her fists.","The blue veins on her forehead and the back of her hands bulged and throbbed.","She held a piece of paper in her hand. The paper was soaked with sweat, and the words were blurry.","However, Zuo Qingluan remembered every word.","“Should I do it?” Zuo Qingluan asked herself.","She stared at Feng Wu from behind.","Feng Wu was surrounded by Feng Xun and Xuan Yi, and Elder Mu and Elder Yan were fawning over her... Zuo Qingluan felt Feng Wu had everything, but she had nothing!","What did she have to lose?","As long as she could kill Feng Wu openly, she didn’t mind selling her life and dignity to the devil. There was nothing wrong with that!","“Feng Wu, you have a lot of things to do, but the only thing I have to do for the rest of my life is figure out how to kill you!”"]},{"number":3228,"title":"Chapter 3228 Inscription Girl (4)","paragraphs":["3228 Inscription Girl (4)","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and dashed toward the Dayless Woods.","Feng Wu had no idea of Zuo Qingluan’s plan.","Feng Xun carried the giant spirit eagle to her room and put in the inscription bombs as well.","Seeing Elder Mu and Elder Yan chasing after them, Feng Xun pushed Feng Wu in, closed the door with a clang, and locked it from the outside.","!!","Feng Wu was speechless.","She wanted to tell the elders that she actually knew inscriptions.","However, Feng Xun pushed her so fast that she stumbled and was already inside.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Forget it. Didn’t they say the giant spirit eagle had the ability to self-destruct? Who knew when that would happen? Could the Dongsang Kingdom control it and set it off?","Feng Wu didn’t hesitate, and went to the hatch of the giant spirit eagle.","There was no inscription key.","Feng Wu recalled the smug look on Mu Yan’s face before she left.","Earlier, Mu Yan had already been a short distance away, but she still raised her hand to show Feng Wu what she was holding.","That jade stone was probably the inscription key.","Feng Wu studied the hatch carefully. It wasn’t easy to crack open.","She took out the Phoenix Pen and wrote “open” on the inscription keyhole.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, it didn’t open!","Even the Phoenix Pen, which had always been successful, couldn’t open this hatch. That was interesting.","Sitting cross-legged in front of the hatch, Feng Wu examined it inch by inch. Sure enough, there were complicated inscriptions around it. They were strange words spread out in a mandala pattern.","It was an invisible pattern that ordinary people wouldn’t notice.","Feng Wu searched her mind for the inscription information her beautiful master had forced her to read.","Soon, she found it.","When she was a child, her beautiful master had taught her a lot of things and stuffed a lot of information into her head. Feng Wu couldn’t understand many of them back then, but according to her beautiful master, she should just memorize them all.","Hence, Feng Wu memorized so many things until she thought her hair would fall out.","God knew how many strange things she had memorized.","The things she had painstakingly memorized were stored in her mind like stars. They were usually dim, but when Feng Wu searched through her memories, she could extract anything useful instantly.","Feng Wu was curious. How much did her beautiful master know? It seemed there was nothing in the world that he didn’t know.","The flying machines were called giant spirit eagles in the Dongsang Kingdom, but according to the information her beautiful master had given her, it was called a fighter jet.","Feng Wu studied the fighter jet.","According to the information, this fighter jet was called a two-winged fighter jet.","This was because it had two upper and lower wings, and in the middle was the cockpit where the pilot sat.","Feng Wu took a closer look and saw that the two-winged fighter jet was made of wood covered with iron sheets.","Why was it like that? Why wasn’t it solid iron? Wasn’t iron more durable?","The information Feng Wu had memorized told her that the propeller, which had an inscription on it, couldn’t carry too much weight.","It had been wood only in the beginning, and the current fighter jet was already considered an improvement.","Moreover, only one person could sit inside. Any more weight, and the jet wouldn’t be able to take off.","As for the hatch, Feng Wu also found a line of inscription numbers on it.","She wrote those numbers with the Phoenix Pen, and the hatch opened.","Feng Wu crawled inside."]},{"number":3229,"title":"Chapter 3229 Inscription Girl (5)","paragraphs":["3229 Inscription Girl (5)","Sitting in the hard cockpit seat, Feng Wu quickly examined the fuselage.","What her beautiful master asked her to memorize were the most difficult words and numbers.","Because her beautiful master didn’t have a physical body back then, he couldn’t find her such a high-end fighter jet. Therefore, Feng Wu had never touched a real fighter jet before.","However, being a secret agent in her previous life, how could she not know the structure of a fighter jet?","!!","It was part of her training, and she had to take exams on it.","Feng Wu sometimes felt the technology here was similar to the modern technology she remembered.","However, the machines here were driven by inscriptions, which seemed to be the fuel for everything.","The aircraft had a wingspan of 10m and a length of 9m. The size of its wingspan was nearly 20 square meters, and it was mainly powered by propellers.","Feng Wu knew the jet had two sets of wings because the inscription propeller wasn’t big enough to provide enough power with a single set of wings. Hence, two sets of wings were needed to increase the lift.","Feng Wu knew a lot about modern fighter jets, and her beautiful master had given her a lot of information about fighter jets here.","It wasn’t difficult for her to understand this first-generation double-winged wooden propeller fighter jet.","The only thing she needed to study was the inscription propeller.","As long as she could understand it thoroughly, all problems would be solved.","Other than the inscription propeller, nothing else would be a problem for the Junwu Empire.","To prevent the double-winged wooden propeller jet from self-destructing, Feng Wu began to disassemble it.","She first removed the upper and lower wings, then the fuselage. After that, she dismantled the jet.","She was very fast. In less than 15 minutes, the jet was completely dismantled and turned into a pile of iron sheets, wood, and various components.","Sitting cross-legged on the ground, Feng Wu stared at the inscription propeller and carefully studied the inscriptions inch by inch.","This was a very complicated inscription pattern.","It was both an inscription and a spiritual formation. Everything was tangled in a complicated way.","If she wanted to analyze it, she had to figure out the inscription and formation first.","Feng Wu finally understood why the Junwu Empire didn’t have any fighter jets.","The main obstacle was the inscription pattern on the inscription propeller.","The pattern was too complicated. Even though she was a Level 8 inscription master and formation master, she still felt dizzy after looking at it for a while.","This wasn’t something that could be solved overnight.","However, once it was solved, the Junwu Empire would become much more powerful.","Feng Wu and her friends were all members of the Junwu Empire. She had to do what she could to bring honor to the empire.","She took out a microscope she had made herself and pointed it at the inscription pattern. She then carefully drew it on hard bamboo paper.","What she didn’t know was while she was studying the propeller, the people outside were already in an uproar.","The main participants were Elder Mu and Elder Yan.","They were exasperated when Feng Xun stopped them from going into the room.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi guarded the door, and the two elders couldn’t get past them.","When the elders tried to reason with the two young lords, the latter insisted the jet belonged to Feng Wu, and no one could take it away without her permission.","The two elders were speechless.","Usually, they couldn’t stop quarreling, but now, the two of them actually joined forces and vented their anger at the same target."]},{"number":3230,"title":"Chapter 3230 Head of Magical Equipment Division (1)","paragraphs":["3230 Head of Magical Equipment Division (1)","The two elders looked at each other in frustration, but there was nothing they could do.","The jet might self-destruct at any moment.","Elder Mu prompted Elder Yan. “Let’s talk to Elder Helian!”","Elder Yan hesitated.","!!","Yan Han snorted. “She’s always proud like that. It’s as if no one’s good enough for her. There’s no use begging for her help. Grandpa, don’t even think about it!”","Normally, Elder Yan would refute Yan Han, but now, he actually agreed with her.","Feng Wu was too proud.","“Let’s go.”","Elder Yan had no choice but to follow Elder Mu.","They found Elder Helian and told him what had happened.","Feng Wu had taken away the fighter jet and wouldn’t give it back.","Elder Helian stared at them. “What are you talking about? I can’t understand a word.”","He then dismissed the two elders.","Who were they kidding? Xiao Wu could take whatever she wanted!","He recalled she had a pen that could easily solve any inscriptions, but he thought it was a disposable one.","Elder Yan also knew Feng Wu had a pen, but he was sure that it was a disposable inscription pen from the general. He thought, “The general now favors Imperial College. That’s why he gave Feng Wu this pen to remove inscriptions.","“That way, the general can blame everything on Feng Wu, and other people won’t think he’s biased toward Imperial College.”","All members of the Military Academy thought that way, and so did the elders of Imperial College.","After being dismissed by Elder Helian, the two elders stood outside and looked at each other in frustration.","“Let’s talk to Mr. Xu.” Elder Mu ground his teeth. “He’s the head of the Magical Equipment Division. I’m sure he’ll do something about this!”","Elder Yan didn’t like that idea.","Mr. Xu was the head of the Military Academy and had always had a condescending manner. He hardly ever spoke to someone like Elder Yan.","Moreover, Elder Yan felt he was betraying Feng Wu.","Yan Han held Elder Yan’s arm and said sweetly, “Grandpa, when will that jet self-destruct?”","Before Elder Yan could say anything, Elder Mu bellowed, “We don’t know when that’ll happen. I think the Dongsang Kingdom can control it. It may explode right now!”","Elder Yan gave Yan Han a stern look. “Why are you still here? Go back to your place!”","Yan Han said, “But Grandpa...”","Elder Yan said sternly, “It’s none of your business! Leave!”","After scolding Yan Han, Elder Yan reminded her, “Don’t talk to Feng Wu in that way anymore. Understood?!”","Yan Han was furious!","How could her grandfather say that?","Feng Wu was such a selfish person; Yan Han was just pointing out the truth. What was wrong with that?!”","“I’m your granddaughter, not her!” Yan Han stormed off.","Elder Yan was infuriated!","Before he could say anything, Elder Mu dragged him away. “Let’s talk to Mr. Xu!”","That wasn’t as easy as it sounded.","However, Mr. Xu was Elder Mu’s direct superior, so Elder Mu eventually got to meet Mr. Xu, who was still cultivating.","“This had better be important!” Mr. Xu was displeased."]},{"number":3231,"title":"Chapter 3231 Head of Magical Equipment Division (2)","paragraphs":["3231 Head of Magical Equipment Division (2)","“This had better be important!” Mr. Xu was displeased.","These people were disturbing him while he was cultivating.","Elder Mu immediately told Mr. Xu what Feng Wu had done.","Of course, Elder Mu’s description was biased. According to him, Feng Wu was being unreasonable, and she was fooling around without considering the bigger picture.","Elder Yan wanted to interrupt several times, but he was stopped by Elder Mu’s gaze.","Mr. Xu frowned. “A giant spirit eagle? Isn’t that the Dongsang Kingdom’s fighter jet? Is it intact?”","Elder Mu nodded, “Yes! Without a scratch!”","Mr. Xu was capable of obtaining a fighter jet, but he couldn’t do that.","The Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom were at a stalemate right now. If he did something, that balance would be broken.","Therefore, Mr. Xu couldn’t make any reckless moves.","Elder Mu looked at Mr. Xu expectantly.","Elder Yan couldn’t help but interject. “Feng Wu won the fighter jet, so...”","Elder Mu glared at Elder Yan. Was he an idiot? Why did he bring that up now?","“I don’t care who won it! It belongs to the Junwu Empire!”","“Shut up!” Mr. Xu frowned and waved at them. “Get out!”","Elder Mu stared at him in disbelief.","Get out?","What did Mr. Xu mean?","“Feng Wu’s fighter jet...”","Mr. Xu stared at Elder Mu and asked coldly, “Are you asking me to rob a girl?”","Elder Mu said, “No, of course not.”","Beads of cold sweat trickled down Elder Mu’s forehead.","He realized Mr. Xu was angry.","No one could afford the rage of a Spiritual Saint.","“Go away!”","Mr. Xu flicked his sleeves.","Elder Mu and Elder Yan were wrapped in the cold wind and thrown out of the door.","Elder Mu was speechless.","So was Elder Yan.","The two elders looked at each other.","How did that happen?","“Is Mr. Xu... not going to get involved?” Elder Yan asked.","He worked under Mr. Lu and didn’t know Mr. Xu well.","However, Elder Mu had worked with Mr. Xu for years.","“That shouldn’t have happened.” Elder Mu rubbed his temples.","He had seen with his own eyes how much Mr. Xu cared about the fighter jets.","The first master in the Magical Equipment Division knew a few things about fighter jets. Because of that, he became Mr. Xu’s favorite person.","No matter what that master did, Mr. Xu wouldn’t object to it.","That was how important the fighter jets were to Mr. Xu.","But now...","“The Magical Equipment Division is in urgent need of an intact fighter jet, so I thought...” Elder Mu was confused.","He thought Mr. Xu would take away Feng Wu’s fighter jet by force and send it to the Magical Equipment Division.","Mr. Xu was in charge of the entire Magical Equipment Division.","The Junwu Empire was in desperate need of fighter jets. The first person to build one could become a general right away!","“Let’s go take another look...” Elder Mu wouldn’t give up. He grabbed Elder Yan and ran toward Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, Mr. Xu thought of Master Duanmu, who had sent him a letter a few days ago. “I’m at the final stage of my research. Need an intact fighter jet ASAP.”","Mr. Xu frowned.","He got up and headed for the general’s residence."]},{"number":3232,"title":"Chapter 3232 Emergency (1)","paragraphs":["3232 Emergency (1)","Feng Wu had been trying hard to understand this fighter jet.","The Junwu Empire could build the frame, but it was extremely difficult to make the inscription propeller.","Even for Feng Wu, who had the Phoenix Pen and was a Level 8 inscription and formation master, it was still impossible to build one. For now, she could only transcribe all the formations and inscriptions and work on them later.","Not everybody could do that because one had to be at least a Level 8 inscription master to accurately transcribe them.","Halfway through, she heard a knock on the door.","Feng Wu frowned and opened the door to find Elder Helian outside.","“What?” Feng Wu frowned. She had told them no to disturb her.","Elder Helian said, “Mr. Lu is injured. Xiao Wu, help him now!”","“Mr. Lu?”","Feng Wu and Mr. Lu were quite close. Mr. Lu had taken special care of her in the past, so Feng Wu felt obligated to help him.","She said, “Alright...”","Turning around, Feng Wu locked the door and drew a “lock” with the Phoenix Pen.","Inside were the important inscriptions on the propeller, which Feng Wu hadn’t finished copying yet. She would have to study them later.","After locking the door, Feng Wu went to see Mr. Lu with Elder Helian.","Feng Wu looked grim when she saw Mr. Lu.","Not many people were here, and all of them were influential members of the Junwu Empire.","The general and Mr. Xu were both there.","“What’s wrong?” Feng Wu arrived in a hurry.","When Mr. Xu turned around and saw Feng Wu, he frowned and questioned Elder Helian, “Where’s Dongfang Ziyun?”","When Elder Helian said he would fetch someone, Mr. Xu thought he meant Dongfang Ziyun. To his surprise, Feng Wu arrived.","Why was Dongfang Ziyun so arrogant?","Because she was the only Supreme Level medicine refiner, she could talk directly to the schoolmasters.","That was why she was so desperate when she heard Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Feng Wu had robbed her of her fame!","With a Semi-Divine medicine refiner around, why would anyone go to a Supreme Level medicine refiner?","But...","The big bosses were busy handling the Dongsang Kingdom and had no idea that Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Feng Wu had demonstrated her skills to the elders, but all the elders thought the others had told the three bosses. As a result, none of the three knew this piece of information.","For instance, Elder Helian had no idea that the general and Mr. Lu didn’t know Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Therefore, Elder Helian was amazed when Mr. Xu mentioned Dongfang Ziyun. “Dongfang Ziyun? Why do we need her? Feng Wu is the best medicine refiner here!”","When Elder Helian was a peak Spiritual Overlord, he didn’t dare speak to Mr. Xu in this way, but they were both Spiritual Saints now. Although Elder Helian was still a junior one, he was much more confident.","He pushed Feng Wu forward. “Xiao Wu, help Mr. Lu!”","Nobody knew what happened to Mr. Lu, but he kept vomiting blood, and his eyes were also bloodshot red. Both were bad signs.","It happened so suddenly that everybody was taken by surprise.","At that moment..."]},{"number":3233,"title":"Chapter 3233 Emergency (2)","paragraphs":["3233 Emergency (2)","Feng Wu nodded at Elder Helian and was going to check Mr. Lu’s pulse.","“Nonsense!” Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu. “What do you know about medicine? Who gave you permission?!”","Elder Helian was furious.","“Mr. Xu, lower your voice. Xiao Wu is a Semi-Divine medicine refiner and much better than your Dongfang Ziyun! If she can’t treat Mr. Lu, no one can!”","!!","Elder Helian glared at Mr. Xu and wouldn’t give in.","A Semi-divine medicine refiner?","Mr. Xu’s calm eyes were filled with surprise!","Everyone knew what it meant to be a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Just like the flying fighter jets, they were scarce.","A Semi-Divine level medicine refiner was even more precious than the inscription technique for a flying fighter jet.","“Helian, you...”","Elder Helian said, “Can she give herself the strength of a Semi-Divine medicine refiner? Xiao Wu personally refined a Semi-Divine spirit liquid in front of Elder Dongfang. What, didn’t Elder Dongfang tell you?”","Although Elder Helian had already broken through to the Spirit Saint Stage, he was still an elder of Imperial College and one level lower than Mr. Xu.","Mr. Xu’s eyes flickered as he studied Feng Wu.","He couldn’t imagine how this girl could be a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had already checked Mr. Lu’s pulse.","Mr. Lu’s pulse was heavy and urgent. It was like sand being swept up by a torrent. Everything was falling apart, and it was exceptionally dangerous!","While she was checking his pulse, the general kept staring at her in confusion.","Was this girl really a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?","It was probably a misunderstanding.","“What’s wrong with Mr. Lu?” Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu with a dark look in his eyes.","Feng Wu said, “It’s just an old illness.”","Just?","She said “just”?","After some thought, Feng Wu took out some silver needles and inserted thirteen of them into Mr. Lu’s chest. Each needle was placed so accurately that even Mr. Xu had to admit that he couldn’t have done better.","As soon as an expert made a move, one would know.","Feng Wu only needed thirteen needles to stabilize Mr. Xu.","Mr. Xu wasn’t the only one who was surprised.","The general also looked at Feng Wu in surprise.","After the thirteen needles were inserted, Feng Wu waved her hand, and the ends of the needles rose and fell like a wave of wheat.","An invisible electric current flowed from her fingertips into the silver needles and then into Mr. Lu’s acupoints.","Throughout the entire process, Mr. Xu and the general watched in amazement.","The trembling of the silver needles ended after fifteen minutes.","Mr. Lu, who had been sweating profusely, had already calmed down. It was as if he had fallen asleep. His breathing was no longer heavy and short. Instead, it had become light and long.","Anyone with eyes could tell that Mr. Lu’s condition had improved.","Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu. “Are you really a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","Feng Wu grinned at him. “Didn’t Elder Dongfang tell you?”","Feng Wu took the opportunity to make Elder Dongfang look bad.","Mr. Xu’s expression froze.","Feng Wu smiled. “She’s seen me make Semi-Divine pills twice. She’s not going to deny it, is she?”","Mr. Xu’s expression remained the same, but Feng Wu knew he was going to teach Elder Dongfang a lesson when he got back.","At that moment, the general waved at Feng Wu. “Kiddo, come here.”","Feng Wu ran to him eagerly. He was her godfather, and she wanted to cozy up to him.","The general looked at her in amazement."]},{"number":3234,"title":"Chapter 3234 Semi-Divine Healing Pill (1)","paragraphs":["3234 Semi-Divine Healing Pill (1)","This girl had already demonstrated her luck, powerful cultivation ability, and medical skills. God knew what kind of surprises she would bring in the future.","The general wasn’t too shocked because nothing could shock him anymore after watching Jun Linyuan grow up.","However, this girl in front of him was the only one who could surprise him like that after all these years.","“I heard you ran away with a fighter jet?” the general asked casually.","What was that?","Who had gossiped to her godfather?","Feng Wu glanced back at Mr. Xu and snorted inwardly. Not many people could get close enough to the general to talk about such things.","She said, “I won the fighter jet myself. If I don’t take it with me, am I supposed to give it to someone else?”","The girl’s voice was soft and cute. It sounded especially pleasant in the night wind.","What could the general do?","He patted Feng Wu’s head. “Kiddo, you do know it’s a weapon of the empire?”","Feng Wu tilted her head. “I do.”","The general said, “Our inscription masters and formation masters are all researching fighter jets. If we have this one...”","Feng Wu’s eyes twinkled. “I’m working on it, too.”","The general thought of her Phoenix Pen and fell silent.","The girl was indeed correct. She was absolutely extraordinary in inscriptions.","“Did Master Linghu teach you inscriptions?” The general was curious since Master Linghu had never mentioned this.","Feng Wu shook her head.","The general was about to ask, but Feng Wu said, “My master is even more powerful than Master Linghu.”","The general was curious. “Who is your master?”","Feng Wu said solemnly, “Well... I can’t tell you yet.” Her master had asked her to keep it a secret.","When the general saw the unprecedented serious expression on her face, he couldn’t help but smile and pat her head. “Alright, if you can figure it out, it’ll be a great achievement. I’m looking forward to it.”","Feng Wu said confidently, “Don’t worry. I’ll figure it out soon!”","The general was about to say something, when his eyes narrowed.","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","What was going on?","In the next moment, the general, who had never revealed his emotions, patted Feng Wu’s head and turned to the house. “Xu Yan, Helian Li, follow me!”","In an instant, Mr. Xu’s expression turned solemn. He didn’t say anything else.","Elder Helian had never experienced this before, and he was a little confused, but he had some idea of what was going on, so his expression turned solemn!","The general told Feng Wu, “Help Mr. Lu.”","The next moment, the general, Mr. Xu and Elder Helian all disappeared on the spot.","Feng Wu was speechless.","They left in such a hurry!","What happened?","Feng Wu had no idea what was going on, but she knew it was an emergency!","When Mr. Lu woke up, it was already the next morning.","Feng Wu stayed by Mr. Lu’s side the entire day and night. When Mr. Lu woke up, he was still in disbelief.","“I actually survived this time...” A bitter smile appeared on Mr. Lu’s face.","Feng Wu frowned at him. “Your old wounds are already very serious. Aren’t you going to treat them?”","She had never known a person so badly injured.","Mr. Lu’s meridians and blood vessels had aged very severely, as if he was an old hero in his twilight years.","This shouldn’t have happened...","Mr. Lu looked at Feng Wu in silence."]},{"number":3235,"title":"Chapter 3235 Semi-Divine Healing Pill (2)","paragraphs":["3235 Semi-Divine Healing Pill (2)","Because he had been unconscious, he didn’t know that Feng Wu had saved his life.","Mr. Lu asked, “How long have I been unconscious?”","Feng Wu said, “You’ve been unconscious since last night.”","Last night... Mr. Lu calculated the time, and his expression turned ugly!","He grabbed his black-gold combat boots and put them on. His valiant appearance made him look like he was going for a duel!","“Where are you going?” Feng Wu looked displeased.","Mr. Lu shook his head. “A child like you shouldn’t be concerned with that. What you should do is cultivate and strive to break through. You have to become stronger as soon as possible.”","With that, Mr. Lu was about to rush out.","“Do you want to die?” Feng Wu stared at Mr. Lu and enunciated each word. “Your meridians are aging severely. Under normal circumstances, a Spiritual Saint shouldn’t be like this. You have been taking Semi-Divine Healing Pills, right?”","Mr. Lu turned around and stared at her with his dark eyes.","Semi-Divine Healing Pills?!","How did she know that?","Feng Wu asked, “Are you terminally ill?”","Mr. Lu’s back stiffened. He stared at her with cold eyes. Suddenly, he forced a smile. “What are you talking about?”","Feng Wu stared at him solemnly and said in a serious tone, “When I checked your pulse last night, I knew you were using Semi-Divine Healing Pills to extend your life, but neither the general nor Mr. Xu knew about it. Therefore, I didn’t tell anyone else about this. You and I are the only ones.”","Mr. Lu stared at her without saying anything.","Feng Wu asked, “You only have less than a year left, right?”","Mr. Lu’s pupils contracted, and he was ready to attack.","However, he quickly realized Feng Wu was the daughter of the general and definitely not a spy of the Dongsang Kingdom. That was why he didn’t make a move.","It was a critical piece of information.","If the Dongsang Nation knew about this, who knew what they would do?","Feng Wu looked at him. “Doesn’t the general know?”","Mr. Lu said, “The general knows a little, but he doesn’t know it’s so serious.”","Feng Wu said, “Have you thought about this? If you die, the situation on Peaceful Grassland will change drastically!”","Mr. Lu gave her a warning look. “That’s exactly why we can’t let anyone else know.”","Feng Wu asked, “But what will happen a year from now?”","Mr. Lu’s expression suddenly softened. “Fortunately, your all-purpose liquid helped Helian advance to the Spirit Saint Stage.”","Feng Wu said, “He just entered that stage. Can he replace you?”","Mr. Lu fell silent.","He looked at the first rays of dawn on the horizon and suddenly smiled. “When I’m gone, someone will eventually grow up...”","“Are you willing to leave this world?” Feng Wu looked at Mr. Lu.","Mr. Lu smiled bitterly. “Life and death are determined by fate. Riches and honor are determined by the heavens. My lifespan has reached its limit.”","He was at the peak of the Spirit Saint Stage. Who would have thought he would have a terminal illness? He had no choice but to give in to his fate.","“I can only blame myself for focusing on cultivating my stages back then and neglecting the cultivation of my physical body.” Mr. Lu smiled bitterly. “The ancient saying is right: Cultivating one’s spirit and not one’s body is the number one illness of cultivation.”","Mr. Lu chuckled. “I only wanted to improve my cultivation, so I often cultivated in seclusion. I forgot about my physical strength. Therefore, my advancement speed was extremely fast. From time to time, I would even advance two levels in a row.”"]},{"number":3236,"title":"Chapter 3236 Physical Cultivation","paragraphs":["3236 Physical Cultivation","“I have an advantage in cultivating the spiritual side because my perception is much stronger than others. It’s also because of this that I’ve always been biased toward this aspect.","“My spirit has reached the Spiritual Saint Stage, but my physical body is far behind.","“Of course, after reaching that stage, my defenses naturally increased, but that’s about it. At this stage, my body meridians have become stagnant.” Mr. Lu shook his head. “It’s impossible for me to go back and cultivate my physical body.”","He turned to Feng Wu and warned her earnestly, “Kiddo, if one only cultivates the spirit but not the body, they’ll be pestered by a myriad of evil spirits. You must remember this.”","!!","A chill ran down Feng Wu’s spine.","In fact, she had always been cultivating her spirit as well. Her level kept increasing, and she often advanced two or three levels at a time. Her speed was incredible!","She also had a vague feeling that her meridians were blocked.","She remembered what her master had taught her.","At that time, she could have advanced quickly, but her beautiful master hadn’t allowed it, and only wanted her to train her body. That was why she was called a prodigy, but her cultivation level wasn’t high.","When she asked her beautiful master how to help Feng Xiaoqi with his cultivation, her master told her that the first thing to do was to temper Feng Xiaoqi’s body. The cultivation of his spirit could wait.","Feng Wu had listened to her master and refused to let Feng Xiaoqi cultivate even on the most difficult days. She only let him cultivate when he achieved the Ultimate Spiritual Body.","She had actually forgotten that.","Over the past year, she had been so immersed in her cultivation that she had forgotten the most important lesson her beautiful master had taught her...","At that thought, she broke out in a cold sweat and felt a chill run down her spine.","Mr. Lu was relieved to see her reaction.","Feng Wu looked at Mr. Lu. “Does that mean a person will get a terminal illness when his physical strength falls behind?”","Mr. Lu smiled bitterly. “I thought that wasn’t the case, but look what happened to me.”","Feng Wu fell silent.","A dignified expert at the peak of the Spirit Saint Stage had a terminal illness. If word of this were to spread...","“The probability is very low, but it’s not entirely possible.” Mr. Lu stared at Feng Wu seriously. “It’s up to fate whether you’re chosen or not.","“When I got sick later on, I looked for information and researched it. I found...” Mr. Lu took a deep breath. “People who skip levels, which is to say, people who cultivate faster, have a higher probability of getting sick.","“It’s probably a one in ten thousand chance.” Mr. Lu nodded. “You’re so lucky. You should be fine.”","Feng Wu smiled wryly. Sometimes, when she was unlucky, she didn’t believe it herself.","After saying this, Mr. Lu headed for the door.","Feng Wu asked, “Where are you going?”","Mr. Lu said, “The general and the Dongsang Kingdom’s Xue Zhi Bei arrange to battle every three days. Mr. Xu and I guard them while they fight.”","She was speechless. No wonder it was so difficult to meet the general. He had a life-and-death battle every three days.","“I must go.” Mr. Lu turned around and was about to leave.","Feng Wu said, “They’re gone.”","Mr. Lu stared at her.","Feng Wu said, “Last night, while you were unconscious, the general left with Mr. Xu and Elder Helian.”","Mr. Lu’s expression instantly turned extremely ugly!","“Sh*t!”","With that, he turned on his heel and headed for the door, moving as fast as he could.","When Feng Wu came out, she only saw Mr. Lu disappearing into the distance. As for where he had gone, she had no idea."]},{"number":3237,"title":"Chapter 3237 Fighter Jet","paragraphs":["3237 Fighter Jet","The difference in their capability was too great.","Feng Wu stood rooted to the ground.","Her godfather had looked awful last night, and Mr. Lu was so worried just now... She had a bad feeling about this.","Something big was about to happen.","What annoyed Feng Wu was that she was still too weak to interfere.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead and felt she had to cultivate her physical body as soon as possible.","Just then, someone rushed into the room. It was Feng Xun.","His voice arrived before he did.","“Xiao Wu! Something bad has happened! Something bad has happened!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. Could it be her godfather?","Just as Feng Wu’s face turned pale, Feng Xun grabbed her hand. He was sweating profusely. “This is bad! This is really bad!”","Feng Wu asked, “What happened?”","“You’ll know when you get back. Come with me!”","Feng Xun had no idea that his father had to fight Xue Zhibei every three days, nor did he know how dangerous the situation was...","He was anxious about something else.","When Feng Wu went back to her room and saw the door, she realized that something was wrong.","The inscription she had set up with the Phoenix Pen had been tampered with.","Feng Xun was about to push the door open to enter, but Feng Wu shook her head. She took a few steps forward and studied the inscription carefully, memorizing all the details.","If her inscription was altered by someone else, no matter how careful they were, there would still be traces left behind.","Feng Xun was so anxious that he was practically jumping around!","Thankfully, Feng Wu pushed the door open after she was done.","Nothing else had been touched except for the fighter jet.","Feng Wu had already dismantled the fighter jet and sorted those parts into categories. Now, everything else was there except for...","What she was most worried about had happened.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu. “Did you lose anything? Anything?”","Feng Wu didn’t reply. Instead, she asked Feng Xun, “How did you know something was wrong?”","Feng Xun said, “I’ve been standing guard at the door. Xuan Yi and I have been here because we know this fighter jet is precious and we can’t afford to lose it. However...”","Scratching his head in embarrassment, Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu guiltily. “But I went to the toilet, and when I came back, Xuan Yi was lying on the ground, and I saw a shadow disappear before my eyes.","“I chased after that person, but they were too strong. They were at least a Spiritual Overlord. I couldn’t catch up at all.","“Yang Zhihu saw this and helped me to chase that person. I wonder if he can take them down.","“I saw a package on that person’s back... but it shouldn’t be a fighter jet, right? That fighter jet is so big. How can it be...”","Feng Wu smacked her forehead.","“It’s the fighter jet,” she told Feng Xun. “Someone stole it.”","“What?! How can that be? I remember that the package isn’t all that big. It was less than a meter long, but a fighter jet...”","At this moment, two people rushed in from outside.","They were none other than Elder Mu and Elder Yan.","Elder Mu stared at Feng Wu. “Where’s the fighter jet? Answer me! Where’s the fighter jet?”","Elder Yan looked at Feng Wu nervously as well.","As soon as they arrived, they heard constant shouts. “Catch the thief, catch the thief!” Apart from the fighter jet, what else would a person steal from the colonels’ quarters?","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on."]},{"number":3238,"title":"Chapter 3238 Furious Feng Wu (1)","paragraphs":["3238 Furious Feng Wu (1)","Feng Wu felt a headache coming on.","She had performed acupuncture on Mr. Lu last night and didn’t sleep at all. When Mr. Lu finally woke up, she was so shocked by what he said that she broke out in a sweat, and only just managed to calm down.","As soon as she returned, she was told that the inscription propeller of the fighter jet had been stolen.","Elder Mu and Elder Yan also wouldn’t stop pestering her.","!!","Feng Wu was speechless.","Elder Yan looked down and saw a pile of metal on the ground. It was obvious that Feng Wu had already dismantled the fighter jet.","Elder Yan was thrilled. “Did you open the hatch? You’ve even dismantled it! That’s awesome!”","Feng Wu didn’t speak.","Elder Yan was still excited. “Feng Wu, I didn’t expect you to know so much about inscriptions...”","However, before Elder Yan could finish speaking, Elder Mu interrupted, “Where’s the inscription propeller?”","Elder Mu had sharp eyes. The first thing he did after entering was to look for the inscription propeller. However, after searching for a while, there was only a pile of metal. Where was the legendary inscription propeller?!","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had already squatted down to check on Xuan Yi.","Thankfully, the person’s target wasn’t Xuan Yi. They only wanted to escape and Xuan Yi was only struck once.","However, one strike alone was already very serious.","Feng Wu applied the Semi-Divine Golden Crow ointment on Xuan Yi’s abdomen. After some thought, she handed him the remaining half of the ointment. “If you’re injured again, apply it right away.”","While Feng Wu was treating him, the boy kept watching her in a gentle manner and didn’t say a word.","“Did you hear me?”","It wasn’t until Feng Wu said that that he blushed a little and he nodded.","Elder Mu, on the other hand, was so anxious that he kept asking Feng Wu, “Where’s the inscription propeller? Huh? Where’s the inscription propeller?”","Feng Wu snapped at him. “Can’t you tell?”","Elder Mu said, “Is it gone?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right.”","Elder Mu said, “How can it be gone? You! Why are you...”","Feng Xun stopped Elder Mu in a hurry. “Someone stole it!”","Elder Mu shook off Feng Xun’s hand. “Stole it? This is the colonels’ quarters. How could it have been stolen? Did you fake the scene and pretend it was stolen because you didn’t want to give it back?!”","Feng Xun almost exploded at Elder Mu’s words!","“What?!” Feng Xun glared at him. “Elder Mu, you can’t make up things like that! If Xiao Wu steals from us, she won’t let Xuan Yi get hurt!”","Elder Mu was still skeptical. “Then how did it get stolen? Didn’t you guard it?!”","Feng Xun said, “Xuan Yi and I have been guarding the door. Elder Helian led Xiao Wu away last night, saying they were...”","“That’s enough.” Feng Wu gestured at Feng Xun. “I’ll take care of it.”","Even the general only vaguely knew about Mr. Lu’s injuries, let alone others. She couldn’t draw attention to Mr. Lu’s condition.","However, Elder Mu was displeased by Feng Wu’s attitude. “You’re going to take care of it? How? You let someone steal the inscription propeller, so how are you going to get it back? How can you make it sound so easy?!”","Feng Xun almost lost his temper at Elder Mu. He was about to charge at him, but Feng Wu pushed him away.","Standing in front of Elder Mu, Feng Wu raised her chin arrogantly. “Who the hell do you think you are?”"]},{"number":3239,"title":"Chapter 3239 Furious Feng Wu (2)","paragraphs":["3239 Furious Feng Wu (2)","Elder Mu said, “I...”","Feng Wu said, “I won that fighter jet. I can do whatever I want with it and give it to whoever I want. I can throw it away or burn it if it pleases me. What does it have to do with you?”","Elder Mu said, “You...”","Feng Wu said, “Do you think you’re an elder just because I call you that? Who do you think you are? I don’t owe you anything!”","!!","Elder Mu almost vomited blood from anger!","Feng Wu said, “Don’t try to intimidate me! Even my father can’t control me. Don’t flatter yourself! How dare you talk to me like that? Get lost!”","Elder Mu’s expression was extremely ugly!","Seeing that Feng Wu was infuriated, Elder Yan felt a little intimidated.","He grabbed Elder Mu and headed for the door.","Elder Mu still wanted to struggle, but Elder Yan glared at him. “Think about what happened in the general’s residence...”","They had all been there. When the general dragged Feng Wu in, everyone had thought she was done for. However, Feng Wu later came out, patting Mr. Xu’s shoulder and calling him Old Xu...","Mr. Xu didn’t retort and only left angrily.","That was enough to prove that Feng Wu had played her cards right in front of the general.","Seeing Feng Wu stare at him, Elder Yan felt a chill run down his spine and pushed Elder Mu away.","After they left, Feng Xun rubbed her forehead. “Speaking of which, Elder Mu is only at the initial stage of the Spiritual Overlord level. He’s not much stronger than me. What’s there to be arrogant about? He’s just an elder of the Magical Equipment Division. That’s why he’s so full of himself.”","Feng Wu nodded. She didn’t care about Elder Mu’s reaction, but she couldn’t stand the fact that the inscription propeller had been stolen.","She asked Feng Xun and Xuan Yi about the details, but Feng Xun knew nothing. Xuan Yi told her, “He’s almost two meters tall and a Spiritual Overlord. He’s fast and a little...”","Feng Wu asked, “A little what?”","Xuan Yi said, “He felt like someone from Dongsang.”","Feng Wu asked, “The Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu frowned a little. She had figured out about half of the inscription propeller after she removed it, so she took the opportunity to block the self-destruct function.","Could it be that the Dongsang Kingdom had discovered that the inscription propeller couldn’t self-destruct? Was that why they sent someone to steal it?","This was a possibility, but it definitely wasn’t the only possibility.","Feng Wu carefully noted down the inscription on the door.","The inscription was very similar to modern code.","Codes were composed of strings of alphabet letters, but the words used for inscriptions were even more complicated. Ordinary people couldn’t master them at all. Only talented people had a chance.","The words on the door had been destroyed.","Someone had modified them to break her door lock.","This person’s technique was very agile, and his attainments in inscriptions were extraordinary. He was at least a Level 8 inscription master and a Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Feng Xun asked curiously, “Xiao Wu, are you getting anywhere?”","Feng Xun was infuriated when Feng Wu told him her speculation.","“Could it be Elder Mu?!”","Leaning against the pillar, Xuan Yi asked coldly, “Why can’t it be Elder Yan?”","After that, they both turned to look at Feng Wu.","Tilting her head, Feng Wu asked Feng Xun, “Can you find the two elders’ inscriptions?”","To her surprise, Feng Xun said, “Yes!”","Seeing how surprised Feng Wu was, Feng Xun said, “We have the Magical Equipment Division. The elders both work there, so if you want to find their work, you can find it there.”","Feng Wu had heard them mention the Magical Equipment Division several times recently.","“So, exactly what is the Magical Equipment Division?” Feng Wu asked in confusion."]},{"number":3240,"title":"Chapter 3240 Going to See Jun Linyuan Again","paragraphs":["3240 Going to See Jun Linyuan Again","Feng Xun said, “The Magical Equipment Division is one of the two divisions on the same level as our Combat Division. They’re both led by the general.","“The main function of the Magical Equipment Division is to design and create inscription and formation weapons.","“They also apply inscriptions and formations on normal weapons.","“It’s a very mysterious place. Even the elders might not know where it is.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it that secret?”","Feng Xun said, “That’s right. The masters of inscriptions and formations recruited from the two institutes and from among civilians have probably all gathered there.","“There’s a Level 9 inscription master in there! He’s also a Level 9 formation master!” Feng Xun’s eyes lit up at the mention of him. “I heard he’s the only hope for the Junwu Empire to build a fighter jet!”","Feng Wu frowned. “Level 9?”","Feng Xun said, “That’s right. He’s known as a grandmaster in the Magical Equipment Division. If you see him, don’t call him Master. You have to call him Grandmaster, or he’ll get angry.”","Feng Wu said, “Is he that arrogant?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course. He’s our only chance to build a fighter jet. What do you think? Even our father treats him with respect.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Feng Wu could accept the fact that the person who stole her fighter jet was from the Junwu Empire.","However, if this person was from the Dongsang Kingdom, he would definitely be a spy. Moreover, he was a spy who had been in the fortress for many years. She would never forgive such a person!","Feng Wu was definitely going to get to the bottom of this. No one could escape unscathed after stealing something from her.","However, how serious the punishment was would depend on whether this person was a spy.","The last thing Feng Wu wanted was for the Magical Equipment Division to be involved. Otherwise, it would mean there was a spy there.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","The general was dealing with an urgent situation, and something ominous was about to happen. The current situation had become very difficult.","With her current strength, she couldn’t help the general. Hence, all she could do now was to catch this spy hidden in the fortress. Perhaps, she could follow the clues and find out who was behind that spy.","Feng Xun asked Feng Wu, “What should we do now?”","Feng Wu said, “We wait.”","Feng Wu nodded.","She didn’t have much time left. The second Immortal Spiritual Fruit would ripen in five days. Before that, she had to infiltrate Mr. Sakiya’s team and steal the fruit.","Before that, she had to catch the spy!","Jun Linyuan... Why hadn’t he come out of seclusion yet?","Feng Wu went to see Jun Linyuan again.","As she had expected, Jun Linyuan still hadn’t come out.","When she asked Feng, he gave a wry smile and said that the seclusion could take anywhere between five days and several months.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She couldn’t wait that long. Hence, she asked bluntly, “How do I get into the Magical Equipment Division?”","Feng asked curiously, “Miss Wu, do you want to join the Magical Equipment Division?”","Feng Wu nodded and told the steward about the inscription propeller she had disassembled.","The steward was shocked. “Miss Wu, are you researching the fighter jet?”","Feng Wu nodded seriously. “The Junwu Empire is too weak in that aspect, and the enemy’s military is much stronger than ours. They’re still developing, but what are we doing? I noticed Feng Xun and the others don’t have any inscriptions on their weapons yet.”"]},{"number":3241,"title":"Chapter 3241 South Mountain Forbidden Zone","paragraphs":["3241 South Mountain Forbidden Zone","Feng nodded. “We’re indeed short of inscription masters. We have them now, but they’re not capable enough. You can go to the Magical Equipment Division and see how they’re doing if you want.","“With the token His Majesty gave you, they won’t be able to stop you,” the steward said. “But it would be great if you had an excuse.”","Feng Wu asked, “An excuse?”","Feng nodded. “Isn’t your godfather the general? He can write you a note.”","Feng Wu smiled wryly. “He went to fight Xue Zhibei.”","Feng nodded. “That’s true. They do that every three days, and the battles go on and on.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Why do they have to fight every three days?”","The steward smiled bitterly. “That’s Xue Zhibei’s request.”","After some thought, the steward said to Feng Wu in all seriousness, “Your father is an amazing man. He’s incredible.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","She had met the general. He was indeed a beautiful middle-aged man. He was arrogant to others, but he was very gentle to her, the little daughter he had just met. Other than that, she had never heard of anything incredible about the general.","Feng looked into the distance with admiration in his eyes. “You know the Dongsang Kingdom has always been more powerful than the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng said, “They have fighter jets and inscription bombs, but have you seen them use those things?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","The steward gave Feng Wu a serious look. “That’s why your father agreed to Xue Zhibei’s request. They’ll fight every three days until one side falls. If the general loses, Xue Zhibei will lead an army equipped with inscription weapons to crush the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu’s heart skipped a beat when she heard Feng’s straightforward description.","That was crazy!","It felt like a sword hanging above their heads, ready to chop off their heads at any moment.","Feng Wu asked, “Is the Dongsang Kingdom that powerful?”","Feng said, “That’s right.”","Feng Wu didn’t understand. “Then why did Xue Zhibei make this deal with the general? Wouldn’t it be easier if he invaded the Junwu Empire and slaughtered all our people like 14 years ago?”","“Because it’s a political requirement,” the steward said concisely.","“What political requirement?” Feng Wu pressed.","But at that point, the steward stopped explaining.","Feng Wu said, “Are we always going to live under the threat of the Dongsang Kingdom’s powerful military equipment?”","Feng only told Feng Wu, “We’re not completely hopeless. The crown prince is our only hope.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Feng said, “If he becomes the most powerful man in the world, everything will change. And you —”","The steward looked at Feng Wu. “You’re the hope of our empire, too.”","Feng wouldn’t say anything else.","Feng Wu said goodbye to the steward and went back to the colonels’ quarters.","Yang Zhihu had already returned by then.","Yang Zhihu was injured, and Xuan Yi had already given him the Semi-Divine Golden Crow ointment.","Therefore, Yang Zhihu looked fine except for his pale lips.","Yang Zhihu said, “I fought with that person. They’re from the Dongsang Kingdom, and...”","Feng Wu said, “Go on.”","Yang Zhihu said, “That person fled into South Mountain and disappeared. I can’t enter the South Mountain forbidden zone.”","Feng Wu frowned. “The South Mountain forbidden zone is...”"]},{"number":3242,"title":"Chapter 3242 Who’s the Suspect?","paragraphs":["3242 Who’s the Suspect?","Yang Zhihu thought for a moment and told Feng Wu, “Legend has it that the Magical Equipment Division is located in the forbidden zone of South Mountain, but very few people have the authority to know its exact location.”","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu fell into deep thought. Soon, she said to Feng Xun, “Bring Elder Yan and Elder Mu here.”","Feng Xun immediately went to carry out the order.","Hearing Yang Zhihu’s words, Feng Wu paced back and forth in her room.","What she didn’t want to happen the most had happened.","The person who stole the inscription propeller was an assassin from the Dongsang Kingdom, and it was very likely that this assassin had infiltrated the Magical Equipment Division.","In other words, there was a Dongsang assassin hiding in the Magical Equipment Department, which was a terrifying matter.","To make it worse, the general and Mr. Lu weren’t around. Even Elder Helian wasn’t here.","The only one who could call the shots was Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu rubbed her brow, feeling a headache coming on.","Elder Yan was fine, but Elder Mu was still a little emotional.","Without another word, Feng Wu asked the two elders to draw inscriptions on a board.","Elder Yan looked at Feng Wu in confusion because he didn’t understand why.","Elder Mu had a proud expression on his face. “Why should I listen to you? Who do you think I am?”","Feng Wu said coldly, “Someone stole my inscription propeller. I suspect it’s one of you.”","WHAT?!","Feng Wu’s words almost scared the two elders to death.","Elder Yan and Elder Mu both stared at Feng Wu in shock.","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. I suspect you. Show me your inscriptions. That’s your only chance to prove your innocence.”","Elder Mu didn’t look pleased. “Feng Wu, don’t go too far! You’re only a colonel! Elder Yan and I are both generals! To be honest, you should be kneeling now!”","Feng Wu stared at Elder Mu coldly. Without another word, she took out Emperor Wu’s token.","She now realized the token was quite useful. Whenever someone of a higher rank tried to show off, the token would bring peace to the world.","As expected, when Feng Wu took out the token, Elder Mu’s face flushed red with anger, but he didn’t dare say anything else.","He could only squat on the ground and use a carving knife to carve inscriptions on a wooden board.","Every inscription master had their own sequence. The higher their level, the more unique their style.","It was just like writing an article. Some people’s articles were especially stylish, so even if their names were concealed, it was easy to guess who the author was.","The inscription master who had cracked Feng Wu’s inscriptions was an advanced one with a great style.","Not long after, Elder Yan handed in his work.","Feng Wu glanced at it and put it aside.","At that moment, Elder Mu slowly handed in his work.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","She looked at the inscriptions and then at Elder Mu.","Elder Mu panicked a little under her gaze.","“Hey, hey, what kind of look is that? I’m not a thief!” Elder Mu was extremely flustered.","He asked Elder Yan to testify for him.","“Yan, I’ve been with you from the beginning to the end. You can testify for me, right?!”","Elder Yan said to Feng Wu in a hurry, “Xiao Wu, Elder Mu has indeed been with me the whole time. We’ve never been apart...”","Feng Wu knew it wasn’t Elder Mu. He had been right in front of her when Yang Zhihu had tried to catch the man who had injured Xuan Yi."]},{"number":3243,"title":"Chapter 3243 Who’s the Suspect? (2)","paragraphs":["3243 Who’s the Suspect? (2)","Feng Wu looked at Elder Mu indifferently. “Who taught you how to draw inscriptions?”","Elder Mu stared at Feng Wu. “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu waved the token in front of Elder Mu and asked again, “Who taught you inscriptions?”","This time, Feng Wu’s tone was more serious, and her eyes were cold.","!!","Elder Mu’s heart skipped a beat, and he felt intimidated.","He couldn’t understand it. He was stronger than Feng Wu and had a higher status than her, but he still felt like a subordinate around her.","Elder Mu said, “Master Duanmu taught me.”","Feng Wu asked, “Master Duanmu? As in Master Duanmu from the Magical Equipment Division?”","Elder Mu said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu asked, “Does he have any other disciples?”","Elder Mu said, “Yes, they’re all in the Magical Equipment Division.”","He suddenly looked up and stared at Feng Wu. “Are you suspecting my master? That’s impossible!”","Elder Mu immediately became agitated. “My master is the most powerful inscription master. He’s the person who has the highest chance of developing a flying fighter jet. His attainments in inscriptions are one of the best in the entire Junwu Empire and even in all of Peace Grassland!","“He doesn’t care about that inscription propeller! That’s pure slander!” Elder Mu’s expression was very ugly.","Feng Wu wasn’t affected by his attitude. She simply said, “So, did you try to take the inscription propeller because you wanted to give it to your master?”","Elder Mu said “Well...”","Feng Wu asked, “So, does he really not care about this inscription propeller?”","Elder Mu said, “Anyway, my master’s status is very high. He would never do such a thing! Don’t make random accusations!”","Feng Wu said, “You can go.”","Elder Mu said “What?”","Now that Feng Wu had asked him to leave, he felt uneasy.","He looked at Feng Wu anxiously. What did she mean?","Feng Wu gave Yang Zhihu, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi a look.","What happened was quicker than words could describe!","The three of them swarmed forward and instantly restrained Elder Mu!","Everything happened too quickly. In the blink of an eye, Elder Mu had already lost his freedom and was forcefully restrained.","Elder Mu stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You... What are you doing?!”","Elder Yan looked at Feng Wu in shock as well.","He had never seen a colonel dare to attack a captain-general.","Moreover, this colonel had actually succeeded.","Feng Wu said to Elder Yan, “We don’t have much time. Sorry about this.”","Elder Yan looked at Feng Wu in astonishment. “Feng Wu, what do you mean?”","Feng Wu didn’t explain what was going on, but she apologized to Elder Yan earnestly. “I’ll apologize to you in person after this is over.”","Elder Yan wanted to resist, but how could he?","Behind Feng Wu were several elders from the elder council.","If he tried to escape, he would be considered a traitor.","Elder Yan was in a terrible mood... He didn’t even know what had happened.","In the end, Elder Yan and Elder Mu were locked up in the Disciplinary Hall.","At the entrance of the two cells, four elders sat cross-legged and wouldn’t allow anyone to approach.","Feng Wu told Elder Dongfang about it herself.","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “How dare you!”","Feng Wu smirked. “Elder Mu must be locked up because he has a close relationship with the suspect. If word gets out, the Military Academy will have to take responsibility for it.”"]},{"number":3244,"title":"Chapter 3244 South Mountain Magical Equipment Division (1)","paragraphs":["3244 South Mountain Magical Equipment Division (1)","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “Nonsense!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s see who the general will believe.”","Elder Dongfang sneered. “Who do you think you are? Yes, you have a token bestowed by His Majesty. Do you think you’re such a big deal?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. I’m quite the big deal. So? Not only do I have His Majesty’s token, but my father is also the general himself. What do you think? You’re green with envy, aren’t you? It’s something you’ll never have!”","!!","Elder Dongfang was furious with Feng Wu.","However, now that things had come to this, she realized how difficult it was to deal with Feng Wu.","Elder Dongfang put a hand on her chest. She would never talk to Feng Wu again because it was too frustrating!","However, Feng Wu picked up a chair, sat down in front of Elder Dongfang, and gave the latter a sidelong glance. “I need a note.”","“What note?” Elder Dongfang frowned.","Feng Wu said, “Mr. Xu is in charge of the Magical Equipment Division. Since he’s not here, you’re in charge of the department. I need to get inside now, so write me a note.”","Elder Dongfang was dumbfounded. She hadn’t expected to hear such a straightforward request.","“Are you begging me?” Elder Dongfang was instantly delighted!","Feng Wu smiled at her. “I suspect there’s a spy in the Military Academy. What do you think will happen when Mr. Xu comes back?”","Elder Dongfang didn’t believe her, but Feng Wu smirked. “Of course, you don’t believe me because you don’t know anything about inscriptions, but the general does. When I tell him, who do you think he’ll blame?”","What could Elder Dongfang do?","She knew how eloquent and sharp-tongued this young lady was.","“Alright, alright. I can give you a note to join the Magical Equipment Division as a newly recruited inscription master, but...” Elder Dongfang deliberately made things difficult for Feng Wu. “But you won’t have a high rank.”","Feng Wu said, “I can live with that.”","At this moment, she still didn’t know how vengeful Elder Dongfang was.","When Feng Wu took a closer look at the stamped note...","A junior inscription apprentice?","Feng Wu asked, “What does that mean?”","Elder Dongfang raised her eyebrows smugly. “Aren’t you fine with not having a high status? Plus, the lower your status, the less attention you’ll attract, right?”","Feng Wu gave Elder Dongfang a half-smile. “Fine. I’m going now.”","Elder Dongfang didn’t say anything else. She walked Feng Wu to the foot of the mountain.","She stopped and turned to Feng Wu. “Anyone who goes in must be blindfolded.”","Feng Wu asked, “Doesn’t that apply to you as well?”","Elder Dongfang said, “I have the authority to know where the Magical Equipment Division is, but you don’t.”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Fine. You know the location of the Magical Equipment Division. What’s there to be proud of?”","Elder Dongfang said, “The Dongsang Kingdom has been looking for the division’s location, trying to bomb it. Shouldn’t I be proud of having that knowledge?”","Feng Wu smiled. “If the Magical Equipment Division really gets bombed, Elder Dongfang, you’ll be the first suspect.”","Feng Wu’s words infuriated Elder Dongfang!","She took out a black cloth from her pocket and pulled Feng Wu over. The thick black cloth, which was four fingers wide, completely covered Feng Wu’s eyes.","Feng Wu didn’t know what the cloth was made of, but she couldn’t see anything at all. In fact, she couldn’t even see any light.","Elder Dongfang dragged Feng Wu deeper into South Mountain.","She was very vindictive."]},{"number":3245,"title":"Chapter 3245 South Mountain Magical Equipment Division (2)","paragraphs":["3245 South Mountain Magical Equipment Division (2)","Elder Dongfang was still very vengeful. Her grip on Feng Wu’s hand was so strong that it hurt.","Worst of all, she led Feng Wu around South Mountain and kept walking in circles.","One moment they were on the right route, but the next moment, it was the wrong one.","Sometimes she would follow the right path, and other times, she deliberately deviated from it.","!!","After walking for four hours, she finally led Feng Wu to a huge rock.","The rock seemed time-worn, and rain had turned the surface as smooth as a mirror.","Feng Wu heard Elder Dongfang speak a series of strange words.","The pronunciation of this language was very strange, and there was no pattern to it. Furthermore, the speech lasted for a full minute. No ordinary person would be able to remember it.","Even Feng Wu couldn’t remember it.","However, never in Elder Dongfang’s wildest dreams would she have thought Feng Wu would activate the Spiritual Fossil Stone when she was reciting the password.","The Spiritual Fossil Stone could record both image and sound.","If Elder Dongfang found out about it, she would want to kill Feng Wu.","Elder Dongfang gave Feng Wu a smug look as soon as she finished speaking, feeling rather superior.","In fact, even she herself didn’t know why she still had to argue with Feng Wu when she was a senior member and in charge of the Military Academy.","Perhaps it was because this girl was too infuriating.","About five minutes after Elder Dongfang finished reciting the complicated and difficult password, there was a cracking sound.","It was as if a heavy door was being opened.","Feng Wu wasn’t in a hurry.","That was because she had actually been recording with the Spiritual Fossil Stone the entire time.","Elder Dongfang pushed Feng Wu forward and said in a cold voice, “Here’s the new inscription master. Put her on the Imperial College team.”","The person who opened the door was obviously a perceptive one.","As soon as Elder Dongfang mentioned the Imperial College team, the person inside smiled coldly. “Sure.”","Elder Dongfang said to Feng Wu, “Work hard there. It’ll be hard for you to get out from now on.”","With that, Elder Dongfang turned around and left smugly.","The middle-aged woman with a hoarse voice dragged Feng Wu inside.","Crack...","The opened door closed again.","“What level are you at now?” The middle-aged woman’s voice was cold, and she wasn’t very nice to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Level 8?”","The middle-aged woman smacked Feng Wu on the head. “Level 8 my ass! In the Magical Equipment Division, braggarts die fast! Understood?!”","Ouch —","Only then did Feng Wu remember she had come in as a junior inscription master, and her goal was to catch the spy who had stolen her inscription propeller.","Rubbing her head, Feng Wu said grumpily, “Can I take this off my eyes now?”","The middle-aged woman then realized she had forgotten about the cloth.","After entering the Magical Equipment Division, Feng Wu no longer needed to be blindfolded.","The blindfold was to prevent others from revealing the location and attracting unnecessary attacks.","“Sure.” The middle-aged woman had a sharp tongue but a soft heart. She still respected inscription masters, so she ripped the black cloth off Feng Wu’s eyes.","Feng Wu finally saw the light again.","Rubbing her eyes, she gradually got used to the orange light and looked around.","This was a passageway that only allowed two people to pass through side by side.","There seemed to be no end to this passageway.","There was a small hole every few meters on the walls on both sides, and there was a lamp hanging from each small hole."]},{"number":3246,"title":"Chapter 3246 I Want to Go Inside","paragraphs":["3246 I Want to Go Inside","There were small holes in the walls, and wall lamps hung from them.","The oil in the wall lamps seemed to be whale oil. It had a unique fragrance, and the flame was stable.","Feng Wu looked to her side.","Next to her was a plump old woman who looked fierce and unapproachable. She looked at Feng Wu in surprise.","“You’re really a handsome and lively girl.”","The plump woman was quite fierce at first, but when she saw how lovely Feng Wu was, she couldn’t use the same tone anymore. Her tone couldn’t help but soften.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s your name?”","Seeing Feng Wu’s sparkling eyes, the plump woman couldn’t help but feel she was talking to an angel. What an adorable girl!","The woman softened her tone and said proudly, “Others call me Auntie Qing. I’m in charge of logistics here. All inscription masters are under the management of my logistics team.”","“Nice to meet you, Auntie Qing.” Feng Wu’s voice was sweet and soft, which was very pleasing to the ear.","As expected, Auntie Qing’s attitude changed. She asked Feng Wu curiously, “Did you offend Elder Dongfang?”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know?”","Seeing that she had guessed correctly, Auntie Qing was extremely pleased with herself. She said proudly, “What’s so hard to guess? Every time Elder Dongfang sends someone over, if she thinks highly of them, she’ll send them to the Military Academy team. If she doesn’t like them, she’ll send them to the Imperial College team. I’ve always been the one to receive them. How can I not know?”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","In charge of logistics? Then Auntie Qing must have seen a lot of people. Feng Wu knew she would definitely find out a lot of things from Auntie Qing. However, there was no hurry.","The most important thing now was to figure out the structure of the Magical Equipment Division.","Logically speaking, Elder Dongfang should have told her about the situation in the Magical Equipment Division along the way.","However, Elder Dongfang wasn’t a generous person.","Feng Wu was lucky to get here without any injuries, let alone obtain any information from Elder Dongfang.","Hence, when Feng Wu asked Auntie Qing, the latter’s eyes widened. “Did you offend Elder Dongfang that badly?”","Feng Wu could tell at a glance that Auntie Qing was a straightforward person and didn’t like pretentious girls. She rubbed her nose and said, “Elder Dongfang has a niece. I made her vomit blood, so... ahem...”","As expected...","Auntie Qing burst into laughter. “Dongfang Ziyun has always been so pretentious because she’s a Supreme Level medicine refiner. I didn’t expect you to make her vomit blood. Good girl. I like you!”","Feng Wu looked at Auntie Qing curiously. “Aren’t you afraid of offending Elder Dongfang?”","Auntie Qing said, “Offend her? She wouldn’t dare offend me. If she makes me unhappy, I’ll assign the person she values to the Imperial College team. She’ll be furious!”","Feng Wu knew Auntie Qing must be more than just a logistics worker. She even dared to offend Elder Dongfang.","She asked, “You keep talking about the Military Academy team and the Imperial College team. What’s the difference?”","Auntie Qing said proudly, “There’s a big difference. Let me tell you, if you want to have a bright future, it’s best if you join the Military Academy team. After you join this team, you may be lucky enough to cozy up to Master Duanmu and enter his team. Your military rank will definitely soar.”"]},{"number":3247,"title":"Chapter 3247 Clever Girl (1)","paragraphs":["3247 Clever Girl (1)","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up when she heard what Auntie Qing said.","“Can I get in?”","“We’ll have to ask.” The more Auntie Qing looked at Feng Wu, the more she liked the girl. Hence, she led Feng Wu to the Military Academy team. “If you’re going to join one of the teams, it’s definitely going to be the Military Academy team.”","Auntie Qing muttered to herself as she walked, “You have to know the Military Academy is in charge of the Magical Equipment Division. If you join the Imperial College team, you’ll be bullied.”","Auntie Qing then led Feng Wu to a huge building.","This was a hollowed-out cave. It was nearly ten meters tall and occupied an area of thousands of square meters. It was separated into sealed spaces.","A path in the middle divided the cave into two sections.","The area on the left was very small and only took up a quarter of the cave, while the area on the right was three times as big.","There were doors on either side, and the two sides faced each other.","Auntie Qing took Feng Wu to the Military Academy’s side first.","When the guard saw Auntie Qing bring someone over, he asked, “Is that the inscription master recruited from the common people?”","Before Auntie Qing could say yes, a cold voice cut her off. “A civilian? I don’t think so. Isn’t that right, Feng Wu?”","An old acquaintance?","Turning around, Feng Wu found the man familiar.","Upon closer inspection, Feng Wu realized she was looking at an elder from the Military Academy. She had only glanced at him from afar but hadn’t paid much attention to him.","“Elder Wu.” Auntie Qing was surprised to see that Feng Wu had been recognized.","Clasping his hands behind his back, Elder Wu strolled out and stared at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you from Imperial College?”","Feng Wu recalled Elder Wu had only met her once, and then...","She didn’t see him when she shared the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Elder Wu probably was already away from the fortress then.","In other words, Elder Wu didn’t know about the group breakthrough in Imperial College, nor did he know about Feng Wu’s relationship with the general.","In his eyes, she was just a girl who was in a scandal with Jun Linyuan.","That was even better. Otherwise, if he knew too much about Feng Wu, it would be difficult for her to take action.","“I’m from Imperial College,” Feng Wu admitted in resignation.","The shortcut she wanted to take was completely blocked.","Auntie Qing looked at Feng Wu in resignation and told her in a low voice, “Elder Wu is in charge of the Military Academy team in the Magical Equipment Division.”","At this moment, Elder Wu had already started to blame Auntie Qing.","“Why did you bring her here?!”","Auntie Qing glanced at Elder Wu and was about to speak.","Unexpectedly, Feng Wu beat her to it. “I asked Auntie Qing to show me around. Why? Is no one allowed to hang out outside the Military Academy? Do you own this place?”","Auntie Qing looked at Feng Wu in admiration.","Although Elder Wu couldn’t do anything to her, this girl had volunteered to take the blame. Auntie Qing felt Feng Wu had a sense of propriety and was really likable.","Elder Wu darted a look at Feng Wu and warned her, “This is the Magical Equipment Division. You better stay put, or no one will back you up! I’m sure the crown prince won’t break the rules here because of you!”","The crown prince? Auntie Qing’s eyes lit up. Holding Feng Wu’s hand, she asked curiously, “You know the crown prince? Are you that close to him?”","Elder Wu felt a headache coming on. He glared at Auntie Qing and said, “How many people do you think the crown prince has connections with? Do you think any Tom, Dick, or Harry can be associated with the crown prince?”"]},{"number":3248,"title":"Chapter 3248 Clever Girl (2)","paragraphs":["3248 Clever Girl (2)","Feng Wu didn’t know what Auntie Qing’s background was, but the woman wasn’t afraid of Elder Wu at all.","She retorted, “Old Wu, what are you talking about? Xiao Wu is so pretty. It’s only natural that the crown prince likes her. You don’t know anything!”","Feng Wu gave Auntie Qing a surprised look and gave her a thumbs up.","Auntie Qing raised her chin proudly. That old man wasn’t the only one who could raise his voice.","Elder Wu glared at Auntie Qing and was so angry that his beard shook. However, for some reason, he didn’t flare up in the end. He only glared at Feng Wu and left.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Why was she the one being glared at?","Did Elder Wu specialize in picking on an easy target?","But before Feng Wu could say anything, Elder Wu had already left. Meanwhile, Auntie Qing snorted. “Old Wu is such a troublemaker.”","She looked at Feng Wu apologetically. “Xiao Wu, you’ve been discovered by Old Wu. I really can’t put you in the Military Academy team now.”","Feng Wu told her it was fine.","Auntie Qing took Feng Wu’s hand. “Come on. Let’s go to the Imperial College section. I’ll take you to their supervisor and tell them to take good care of you.”","She explained to Feng Wu as they walked. “The person in charge is the head of the Magical Equipment Division. He’s in seclusion now, so you won’t be able to see him for the time being.","“The second-in-command is the deputy minister. He’s also in charge of the Military Academy, and he’s Old Wu, the man you saw just now.","“The third-in-command... Normally, he should be the person in charge of Imperial College, but for some unknown reason, that position has been given to Master Duanmu.","“Although Master Duanmu is the third-in-command, his status is extraordinary. Even the ministers don’t dare to offend him. Master Duanmu can directly talk to Mr. Xu and even the general.","“The next one in the command chain is finally from Imperial College. His name is Wang Zhiheng. He used to be Master Duanmu’s junior brother, but for some reason, the two of them don’t have a good relationship now.”","Auntie Qing was telling Feng Wu all the secrets of the Magical Equipment Division. She had a good impression of Feng Wu.","If she didn’t have a good impression of Feng Wu, she could just throw the latter into the team after bringing her over. No explanation was needed.","As Auntie Qing spoke, Feng Wu listened. Auntie Qing was in high spirits, and Feng Wu listened attentively. It was a harmonious conversation.","Auntie Qing suddenly asked Feng Wu, “Do you know how the Magical Equipment Division works?”","Feng Wu asked, “What? How?”","Auntie Qing said, “Didn’t you ask around before you came in? You really don’t know anything?”","Feng Wu put on an innocent face.","Auntie Qing sighed. “You foolish girl... Why is Elder Dongfang so petty? Why is she so calculative with a child? Why is she even angry with you? She’s too old to behave that way.”","Auntie Qing told Feng Wu, “There are dozens of teams here. The higher-ups give out missions, and the teams take them on.","“We have several modes here. The most common one is the inscription workshop where the master takes in junior apprentices.”","Auntie Qing led Feng Wu into Imperial College’s section. As they walked, she pointed at the separated spaces around them and said to Feng Wu, “Look, some of these rooms are big and some are small. The ones near the door are the biggest, and the further in you go, the smaller the rooms.”"]},{"number":3249,"title":"Chapter 3249 Clever Girl (3)","paragraphs":["3249 Clever Girl (3)","“Look at this workshop. It says ‘Yang’s Workshop.’ In other words, this inscription master’s surname is Yang. I know Master Yang. He’s at Level 7 and his disciples are Levels 4 and 5.","“Master Yang has his own apprentices. He’s doing well because he’s only responsible for producing blueprints. His apprentices do the carving and coloring.","“Look over here —”","Auntie Qing led Feng Wu to an open area at the back. There were domed cubicles here with no ceilings, just like modern office cubicles.","Auntie Qing pointed at them and said, “Most of these inscription masters are at Level 5. They are unwilling to be apprentices, or they can’t find a teacher who’s willing to teach them. They’ll accept orders here in their own names.","“But they work very slowly. It can take them at least a month to produce a few low-level inscription weapons.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s not so efficient...”","Auntie Qing said, “Their pay isn’t high either. It starts at 30 per 1,000 words.”","Feng Wu asked, “30... What?”","Auntie Qing: “30 essence crystals for 1,000 words.”","Feng Wu said, “The essence crystals are quite easy to earn.”","“No, they’re not.” Auntie Qing was amused by Feng Wu. “They’re so inefficient that they’re lucky if they can make enough to survive. As long as they can make breakthroughs and inscribe higher-level inscriptions, however, their income will skyrocket.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","Feng Wu saw that they looked like they were inscribing on grains of rice. Every inscription was extremely difficult, and no mistakes were allowed.","This was how inscriptions worked. If there was even the slightest mistake, the inscriber would have to start over.","Auntie Qing told Feng Wu, “Do you remember Master Yang just now? He can get 300 essence crystals for every 1,000 words. However, he has two apprentices under him, so he doesn’t really have much left.","“Let’s go. I’ll introduce you to the person in charge of Imperial College, Master Wang Zhiheng. He can get 1,000 essence crystals per 1,000 words.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is he a Level 8 inscription master?”","Auntie Qing said, “Yes, he’s a Level 8 inscription master. Master Duanmu across the hall is Master Wang’s senior brother, and he can get this much.”","Auntie Qing gestured at Feng Wu as she spoke.","Feng Wu hissed. “That high?”","Auntie Qing said, “Of course. Master Duanmu is really capable. He’s efficient and does good work. Of course... that was in the past.”","Feng Wu asked, “What about now?”","“Right now...” Auntie Qing was about to say something, when they arrived at Wang Zhiheng’s workshop. Auntie Qing stopped talking right away and told Feng Wu, “Don’t mention Master Duanmu in front of him, or there will be consequences.”","Feng Wu nodded.","“Speaking of which, Master Wang has a buddy named Yang Zhihu in the fortress. Have you met him?” Auntie Qing asked. “They’re very close and have become sworn brothers. If you know Yang Zhihu, Master Wang will be much closer to you.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Yang Zhihu? He’s my teacher.”","Auntie Qing looked at Feng Wu in surprise. “Really?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s true. I’m from the colonels’ quarters.”","Auntie Qing sized up Feng Wu from head to toe. “I didn’t know you’re so good at cultivation.”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Auntie Qing took Feng Wu to Wang Zhiheng’s workshop and introduced her to the master, telling him that Feng Wu was Yang Zhihu’s student.","As expected, Master Wang looked at Feng Wu a lot more kindly."]},{"number":3250,"title":"Chapter 3250 Clever Girl (4)","paragraphs":["3250 Clever Girl (4)","Before Auntie Qing left, she had told Feng Wu that if anyone dared to bully her, she could go to the logistics department. Auntie Qing wouldn’t give that person anything to eat!","Feng Wu thanked Auntie Qing with a smile.","After Auntie Qing left, Feng Wu asked Master Wang curiously, “What’s Auntie Qing’s background? I don’t think Elder Wu can do anything to her.”","Wang Zhiheng didn’t know Feng Wu very well, but he couldn’t resist how familiarly Feng Wu was acting.","Before he knew it, he was already talking to Feng Wu as if she was an equal.","Master Wang asked, “Don’t you know?”","Feng Wu said, “No, I don’t.”","Master Wang said, “Didn’t she take good care of you? I thought you knew each other well.”","Feng Wu said, “No, I just came in today. It’s Auntie Qing’s first time seeing me. As for why she took care of me, maybe that’s because I’m so adorable.”","Master Wang didn’t know what to say.","He had to admit that the girl in front of him was indeed adorable. Just looking at her made one feel good, like a room filled with sunlight.","The girl might as well be called “little sunshine.”","“Maybe some girls are meant to be liked by everybody,” thought Master Wang.","“Do you know that the Magical Equipment Division has a minister?” Master Wang asked.","Feng Wu said, “I do. I heard he’s in seclusion right now.”","Master Wang said, “The minister’s surname is Qing.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Auntie Qing is actually Mrs. Qing, then?”","Master Wang nodded.","Feng Wu said, “She doesn’t look the part at all.”","The Magical Equipment Division’s minister was under Mr. Xu’s direct command. He was on the same level as Elder Dongfang and Elder Helian.","However, Auntie Qing was an ordinary-looking woman. She was plump and fierce, but could she be the minister’s wife? Feng Wu couldn’t believe it.","Master Wang told Feng Wu, “It’s a complicated story. You can ask Auntie Qing.”","He didn’t spread gossip.","Feng Wu nodded.","Even Master Wang didn’t realize that after this brief interlude, he and Feng Wu became much closer. They didn’t feel like strangers anymore.","After all, he was the person in charge of the Imperial College team and Yang Zhihu’s buddy. Feng Wu had to befriend him.","Master Wang asked Feng Wu, “What’s your level?”","Feng Wu said honestly, “Level 8.”","Master Wang frowned. “Tell me the truth!”","Feng Wu was truly frustrated. She had always told the truth, but everyone thought she was bragging. Life was so difficult.","She said earnestly, “I’m telling the truth.”","Master Wang’s expressions immediately turned ugly.","He had a good impression of Feng Wu. He had thought she was a pretty girl with sparkling eyes, but he hadn’t expected her to be so pompous!","Since she was Yang Zhihu’s student, Wang Zhiheng felt he had to discipline her!","Just then, there was knocking on the door outside.","Master Wang said, “Come in.”","It was Master Yang’s apprentice, Mo Ziming.","“Master.” Mo Ziming didn’t even look at Feng Wu when he walked in. He took out a board full of words and asked Master Wang, “I can’t activate the inscriptions on this board. I’ve checked it ten times, but it still won’t work.”","Mo Ziming frowned in confusion.","Mo Ziming’s inscriptions had to be engraved on a formation. It had to be accurate."]},{"number":3251,"title":"Chapter 3251 Clever Girl (5)","paragraphs":["3251 Clever Girl (5)","Master Wang didn’t have time to teach the proud Feng Wu a lesson. He decided to solve the problem for his disciple first.","He took the wooden board and checked each word in turn.","He frowned because he couldn’t find any problems.","He wouldn’t give up. Taking a magnifying glass from the side, he looked down the board word by word.","He went through it from beginning to end but still couldn’t find what was wrong.","Rubbing his forehead, he said to Mo Ziming, “Mo Ziming, leave it here for now. I want to study it properly.”","Mo Ziming nodded. When he went down, he saw someone out of the corner of his eye and subconsciously turned his head","Ssss —","He gasped when he saw Feng Wu.","This girl looked like she had walked out of a painting!","In an instant, Mo Ziming was stunned and forgot to move.","“I wonder if this beautiful young lady is engaged yet,” Mo Ziming thought to himself. He was a Level 7 inscription master and a young man with a promising future. He was the only son in his family, which was flourishing —","Just then, Master Wang said to Mo Ziming without looking up, “Take Feng Wu away and have her work next to you. Teach her slowly.”","After thinking for a moment, Master Wang added, “Her foundation is rather shaky, and she’s a little vain. Teach her well.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She was going to ask him why her foundation was weak and why he thought she was vain. She felt so wronged.","“Master Wang...”","Feng Wu was about to defend herself, when Mo Ziming walked up to her and said, “Miss Feng Wu, Master Wang is studying the inscriptions on the board. Come with me. I’ll show you around.”","She indeed had to get familiar with the environment.","Seeing that Master Wang was immersed in the inscription board, Feng Wu sighed and said to Mo Ziming, “Thank you, Brother Mo.”","“You’re welcome, Miss Wu.”","Mo Ziming was excited to be able to get close to the beautiful girl. How could he feel tired or impatient?","When he took Feng Wu away, Feng Wu turned around and glanced at Master Wang.","She had wanted to tell him what was wrong with the inscriptions on the board, but since Master Wang said that her level of inscriptions was too low, Feng Wu didn’t want to tell him anymore.","“This is our workshop.”","Mo Ziming led Feng Wu into the nearest workshop.","The space of nearly a hundred square meters was divided into five sections.","In the middle of the five sections was a rather large area. A long table was placed in the area for discussion.","There were people in every room.","Mo Ziming introduced each of the five rooms to Feng Wu. “I’m Master’s eldest disciple, and I’m in Room 1. Rooms 2 to 5 are all used by Master’s other disciples.","“The disciples are allocated to the rooms according to seniority.","“As for you...”","Mo Ziming looked around and couldn’t find an empty room. He smiled wryly at Feng Wu and said, “Why don’t you share a room with me? If there’s anything you don’t understand, you can ask me.","“As for accommodations...” Mo Ziming told Feng Wu, “We inscription masters work day and night to engrave inscriptions. We rarely rest. If you’re really tired, you can just sleep in the house over there.”","Mo Ziming pointed to the accommodations section not far away.","Feng Wu said, “No, I don’t think I’ll be here for long. If I need to, I’ll just inscribe something in the middle area.”","If Jun Linyuan found out she had stayed in the same room alone with a man, he would be furious.","“Wait,” Feng Wu thought, “Why should I care what he thinks?”"]},{"number":3252,"title":"Chapter 3252 Clever Girl (6)","paragraphs":["3252 Clever Girl (6)","Mo Ziming tried to persuade Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, if you sit here, I can teach you...”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s your inscription level?”","Mo Ziming was very proud. “Level 7.”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","What was that supposed to mean? Shouldn’t she be worshiping him now?","Mo Ziming was hurt by Feng Wu’s cold expression.","Just as he was about to speak, someone came out of Room 2.","A chubby, kind-looking young man’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu. “This is...”","“Master’s new disciple,” Mo Ziming said immediately.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m not...”","However, Mo Ziming and his second senior brother didn’t listen to Feng Wu at all. They started chatting excitedly!","“A new disciple? We finally have a little junior sister! Master finally did the right thing. Instead of finding us a junior brother, he found us a little junior sister.”","“What? What junior sister?”","A person jumped out of Room 3. He seemed to be a lively character. He was as thin as a bamboo stick and had sparkling eyes.","“Look, here’s the junior sister! She’s especially beautiful!” Both senior brothers were very excited.","The third boy’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu.","Before he could compliment Feng Wu, she said, “I’m not your junior sister...”","Mo Ziming asked, “Aren’t you the junior inscription master who just came in today?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I am.”","Mo Ziming said, “Master asked me to bring you back because he has tacitly accepted you. Don’t be afraid. Since Master has said so, nothing can change it. You’ll stay in our workshop.”","The other two senior brothers came back to their senses and consoled Feng Wu.","Feng Wu felt a little embarrassed.","Wouldn’t it be a little too pretentious for her to mention what her inscription level was now?","Moreover, the senior brothers were sincere and enthusiastic, and Feng Wu couldn’t resist their kindness.","Hence, she could only smile wryly. “Thank you.”","Feng Wu looked at the last two rooms.","Mo Ziming’s attention was all on Feng Wu’s face. Seeing that she was looking inside, he told her, “They haven’t completed the task that Master gave them, so they can’t come out yet, in case the process is delayed.”","Feng Wu was curious. “Process? Are you working on different stages of the same assignment?”","“Of course,” Mo Ziming said proudly, “We’re researching the flying fighter jet. We three senior brothers here and the two in the rooms are the few people in Imperial College who have studied the flying fighter jet the most. Master has been leading us on the flying fighter jet project.”","The flying fighter jet? Feng Wu didn’t expect Master Wang to be researching it, either.","Feng Wu said, “I heard Master Duanmu...”","At the mention of Master Duanmu, Mo Ziming and the other two didn’t look too happy.","Yue Ban, the second disciple, pursed his lips and was a little worried. “Master Duanmu is indeed studying the flying fighter jet as well. I heard he made some progress and seems to be moving faster than us...”","Dong Chen, the third disciple, frowned. “So what if he’s a little faster? I don’t like Master Duanmu’s attitude. He makes his disciples do all the work for him. I don’t think he has ambition anymore.”","Mo Ziming nodded. “That’s right. I think our master will be the first to figure it out.”","Just then, they heard footsteps outside."]},{"number":3253,"title":"Chapter 3253 Clever GIrl (7)","paragraphs":["3253 Clever GIrl (7)","The footsteps didn’t stop, and went straight to Master Wang’s workshop.","They looked at one other doubtfully.","Who dared to go straight to their master’s workshop? Weren’t they afraid of being punished for this?","However, they quickly ignored this matter and went back to talking about the fighter jet.","Feng Wu asked, “How far are you on the research on the fighter jet?”","Mo Ziming rubbed his chin. Although he liked Feng Wu very much, he still wouldn’t tell her about such a confidential matter.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Mo Ziming, did the board you give to Master Wang represent the highest level of research you’ve ever done?”","Mo Ziming almost choked. He suddenly had a feeling that the success he was so proud of wasn’t worth mentioning.","It had to be his imagination, right?","“Can you understand it?” Mo Ziming looked at Feng Wu suspiciously.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, she heard the sound of a teacup falling to the ground next door.","“I’d rather die than ask for his help!","“Doesn’t he know what he did?”","Feng Wu and the others jumped at the sudden noise and rushed next door.","Before they got there, the voice came again.","No one knew what the other party said, but Master Wang was furious. He roared, “I remember the bet we made three years ago. Do I need you to remind me? Go back and tell him I’ll die before begging him for mercy! Get lost!”","There was a furious roar, then something heavy fell to the ground.","Feng Wu was about to go to Master Wang’s workshop, when Mo Ziming stopped her at the door.","Mo Ziming’s originally relaxed expression was now unprecedentedly serious. There was grievance, pain, anger... All kinds of emotions were jumbled together on his face.","Feng Wu looked back and saw that the young men from Rooms 4 and 5 had come out as well. They looked indignant.","Everyone seemed to be furious.","At that moment, the footsteps that had passed by them came out of Master Wang’s room.","It was a group of five people.","The leader of the group wasn’t bad-looking, but the smugness on his face ruined his looks, making him look unpleasant.","The four people behind him all had their chins raised arrogantly.","When they saw Feng Wu and the five disciples outside their rooms, the group leader laughed.","“I was wondering who it was. Aren’t you Master Wang’s disciples?” The arrogant man glanced at Mo Ziming disdainfully. “As Master Wang’s eldest disciple, what level are your inscriptions at now?”","Mo Ziming clenched his fists, and his bloodshot eyes were filled with extreme anger!","Seeing that Mo Ziming wouldn’t answer, he said, “I heard you’re still at Level 7.”","The man even approached Mo Ziming and straightened the latter’s collar. “Guess what? I’m at Level 8 already. I can’t understand why they used to call you a genius. You’re as foolish as your master!”","The man wanted to leave after that.","Blue veins popped on Mo Ziming’s forehead.","He raised his hands, but that man quickly suppressed him.","“You’re a much worse inscription master than me. You won’t stand a chance.”"]},{"number":3254,"title":"Chapter 3254 Tell You Who I Am (1)","paragraphs":["3254 Tell You Who I Am (1)","The person looked at Mo Ziming with a smile. “Mo Ziming, your master is only at Level 8. Would you like to become my disciple?”","Mo Ziming was so angry that he wanted to retaliate, but his strength was inferior to the other man’s.","The man left with a smug look on his face.","Mo Ziming was so furious that he was shaking.","!!","Feng Wu frowned. “Who was that? Why is he so pompous?”","Yue Ban said grimly, “He’s Ji Ying, Master Duanmu’s first disciple, and he’s just as pompous as his master.”","By then, Mo Ziming had run off, and no one knew where he went.","Feng Wu looked at Yue Ban.","Yue Ban shrugged. “Mo Ziming and Ji Ying are cousins, and they’ve been holding grudges against each other since they were little.”","That explained why Mo Ziming was so angry when Ji Ying wanted to become his master.","While Yue Ban and the others returned to their rooms, Feng Wu headed for Master Wang’s workshop.","She knocked on the door, but no one answered.","The door wasn’t locked, so Feng Wu stuck her head inside.","She was slightly surprised when she saw Master Wang angrily studying that inscription board. She didn’t expect that in such a situation, he still wanted to study inscriptions.","She quietly walked up to Master Wang and stood a short distance behind him.","“The 25th symbol in the third line is wrong,” Feng Wu calmly reminded him.","When Master Wang turned around and saw her, he simply ignored her. Lowering his head, he continued to study each character with a magnifying glass.","However, Feng Wu’s words kept replaying in his mind.","The 25th symbol in the third line?","He couldn’t help but look at that symbol.","The symbols were complicated and difficult to distinguish, and it took him a while to find that specific symbol.","However, he would be lying if he said he wasn’t curious.","Master Wang searched carefully and found the symbol.","“Nothing is out of place,” thought Master Wang.","He soon smiled bitterly. What was wrong with him? He actually thought the girl could figure something out.","He suddenly spotted something when he was about to look away.","Wait...","The symbol just now did seem a little awkward.","Master Wang’s gaze shifted to the board again.","When he looked at it again from beginning to end, his eyes suddenly lit up!","“Oh god!","“This symbol really is the problem! It shouldn’t be used here. I should use the symbol that’s synonymous with it! Yes! If I use it here, the grammar is wrong!!”","Master Wang was thrilled.","He picked up another board and carefully engraved each symbol in turn.","He soon finished the new board.","He didn’t know why the inscriptions were so effective, but when they were finally activated, Master Wang’s eyes lit up.","He turned around to find Feng Wu smiling at him.","Master Wang immediately asked, “How did you know that the symbol was wrong?”","That couldn’t have been a wild guess.","“Who told you that?!” He stared at Feng Wu in suspicion.","Feng Wu shrugged. “Do you think Master Duanmu sent me here?”"]},{"number":3255,"title":"Chapter 3255 Tell You Who I Am (2)","paragraphs":["3255 Tell You Who I Am (2)","For a moment, Master Want thought about that possibility.","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation. “Then you really think too little of me. Do you think Duanmu can order me around?”","Master Wang stared at Feng Wu with unblinking eyes, as if he wanted to pierce through her with his gaze!","Unfortunately, Feng Wu was much more resilient than the others, and Master Wang eventually lost the staring competition.","!!","Feng Wu said, “Who am I? I’m a Level 6 Spiritual King, a Level 8 inscription master, a Level 8 formation master, a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, Jun Linyuan’s buddy, Young Lord Feng’s sister, the general’s goddaughter, and Little Phoenix’s master...” She left out the part where she was Mu Jiuzhou’s disciple.","She had obviously borrowed this sort of character narration from a TV series she watched before.","That character was the best!","Feng Wu decided to add more titles to herself in the future. That sounded so cool.","However, her existing titles had already befuddled Master Wang.","He stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment and didn’t say anything for a long time.","Eventually, he heaved a long sigh.","Why should he bicker with a little girl? Isn’t it normal for a little girl to like to brag?","“Are you really a Level 8 inscription master?” That was what bothered Master Wang.","Feng Wu said, “I am.”","Master Wang said, “I’ll believe you if you can recreate the inscriptions on this board.”","Feng Wu said, “Sure.”","She took her Phoenix Pen and a blank board, then started writing the inscriptions.","Each stroke left a deep indentation on the board.","It was more like carving than writing.","In less than ten minutes, she finished writing the inscriptions.","Instead of handing the board to Master Wang, she activated the inscriptions right away.","The board was in the shape of a propeller.","Master Wang’s research was on inscription propellers that could make fighter jets fly.","Seeing the inscription propeller move like a windmill, Master Wang looked up at Feng Wu in surprise and didn’t say anything for a long time...","The girl wasn’t lying.","She was indeed a Level 8 inscription master!","She was probably even better than that because she was much faster than he was. Moreover, she could carve it with her pen, which was incredible.","Master Wang stared at Feng Wu. “Have you studied fighter jets before?”","Feng Wu nodded, “I studied one for half a day.”","Master Wang didn’t know what to say.","Her half-day-long research was more effective than his years of research. What could he say? Complimenting her would make him feel like a failure.","Master Wang gave Feng Wu a complicated look. “You’ve learned so much after half a day of research.”","Feng Wu shrugged. “What a pity. If I had half a day more, I might have solved the second half of the inscriptions and formations.”","Master Wang asked, “The second half? Are you saying you’ve already figured out the first half?","The inscriptions and formations on a propeller were so intricate and complicated.","Master Wang had only studied less than one-tenth of it, but this girl... That wasn’t possible!","He wouldn’t believe it.","In the end, Feng Wu took out the board in front of Master Wang and started drawing inscriptions on it.","Feng Wu analyzed the inscriptions and formations and showed them to Master Wang.","She drew one formation after another and only stopped after she drew ten of them.","Master Wang looked at Feng Wu’s exquisite inscriptions and asked in a hoarse voice, “What’s this?”"]},{"number":3256,"title":"Chapter 3256 The Rest of the Formations","paragraphs":["3256 The Rest of the Formations","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t I just say I analyzed the first half of the inscription propeller? I figured out the complicated patterns on it and came up with these ten drawings of inscriptions and formations.","“There are ten layers in total and each layer is on top of the next. Together, they form a large inscription formation. The Dongsang Kingdom is really... I have to say, their technology is indeed advanced.”","Master Wang looked at Feng Wu in shock. “Are these formations real?”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Of course they’re real.”","!!","Master Wang asked, “How can you be sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Why can’t I be sure? I took the inscription propeller off the fighter jet and analyzed the spiritual formations on it. When I reached the tenth layer, I had something to do and went out. When I came back, the fighter jet was gone.”","Master Wang was so shocked that he didn’t say anything for a long time. Finally, he realized what was going on.","“Wait, a fighter jet? You have a complete fighter jet? Where did you get it?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I told you already. I’m very capable. A complete fighter jet isn’t a problem.”","When Master Wang thought about Feng Wu’s quirky behavior, he realized the girl did have good fortune that others didn’t. It was understandable that she had a fighter jet, but...","“Your fighter jet?”","“It was stolen.” Feng Wu shrugged and told Master Wang her suspicion.","Master Wang narrowed his eyes.","“A spy from the Dongsang Kingdom?!”","Feng Wu said, “I suspect someone has snuck in. I can live with losing the fighter jet, but we have to uncover this spy, or the entire Magical Equipment Division will be exposed at any moment.”","Master Wang fell into deep thought for a long time.","After all, he had only just met Feng Wu, and he wouldn’t trust her completely right away. That was why he was still skeptical.","Feng Wu shrugged. “It’s fine. I’ll catch the spy myself. I have a plan.”","Since Feng Wu had a solution, Master Wang turned his attention back to the inscription propeller.","He stared at the ten drawings on the table. “So... Are all of them real?”","Feng Wu said, “Every part of it.”","Master Wang asked, “So, you’ve already reached the tenth layer of the inscription propeller?”","Feng Wu said, “You can say that.”","Master Wang asked, “If I give you the inscription propeller, are you confident that you can analyze the remaining formations?”","Feng Wu said, “It shouldn’t be a problem.”","Master Wang rose to his feet and paced around the room.","He circled the huge workshop over and over again.","Feng Wu looked at him curiously.","Master Wang couldn’t make up his mind, so he told Feng Wu, “I’d like to have some time on my own.”","Feng Wu noticed that Master Wang was staring at the ten drawings. She realized he must want to confirm their authenticity.","Feng Wu nodded and left the room.","After Feng Wu left, Master Wang returned to his seat as fast as lightning. He was even faster than a young man.","He held a magnifying glass in his right hand and examined the inscriptions word by word. His other hand covered the remaining part.","As he read, he deduced and calculated and would only refer to the remaining part after he calculated the next step."]},{"number":3257,"title":"Chapter 3257 Xiao Wu, You’re Amazing","paragraphs":["3257 Xiao Wu, You’re Amazing","The more he read, the more astonished he became.","He didn’t dare to be too greedy and study all ten drawings at once, so he only examined the first one.","However, he was astonished after examining the first one.","Everything was correct!","There was no mistake!","He was amazed.","He then moved on to the second drawing.","Suddenly, he felt the fog in his head lift, and everything felt clearer.","“OMG!”","Master Wang was shocked to discover that his level of inscriptions seemed to have unknowingly entered a new realm during the process of studying the drawings!","He seemed to have reached Level 9!","Holy crap!","Master Wang couldn’t believe it. He took out a board and started carving and soon finished a brand new one.","Suddenly, Master Wang’s heart skipped a beat!","If he was only at Level 9 now... Feng Wu had drawn ten drawings in the blink of an eye. Wasn’t her level even higher?","She was being modest when she said she was at Level 8.","However, he wouldn’t believe her and thought she was bragging.","Master Wang rubbed his forehead in embarrassment.","It wasn’t that he didn’t want to believe her, but that she was too beautiful to be a Level 8 inscription master.","Master Wang thought of something else. When she introduced herself earlier, could the series of titles all be true?","He couldn’t think about it. If that were true, it would be terrifying.","Master Wang put down the drawings and walked straight out the door. After taking a few steps, he suddenly realized something!","These drawings were a treasure!","Master Wang went back to the desk, carefully folded the drawings, and put them in his chest pocket.","However, that still didn’t feel safe enough.","What if it rained?","Hence, Master Wang rummaged through the cabinets again. After some fumbling around, he finally found unused oil paper.","He carefully wrapped the drawings in oil paper before placing them in his chest pocket. He then patted his chest to flatten the paper.","For a moment, he felt like he owned the entire world.","No words in this world could describe how excited he was.","And what was Feng Wu doing now?","After she came out of Master Wang’s workshop, she started her investigation.","She hadn’t forgotten that her biggest mission in the Magical Equipment Division was to investigate the inscription propeller.","Now that Feng Wu was familiar with Auntie Qing, they could talk about other things.","Therefore, she went to talk to Auntie Qing.","Auntie Qing was very busy. She was in charge of all the logistics.","She had to take care of the clothes, food, accommodations and transportation of all inscription masters. Moreover, she had to provide them with inscription tools and the payment of essence crystals... Auntie Qing was very busy.","When Feng Wu went over, she saw Auntie Qing settling the accounts for essence crystals.","Seeing that Auntie Qing was in a daze from all the calculations, Feng Wu made a simple calculator out of inscriptions and handed it to her.","Aunt Qing didn’t think much of it at first, but her eyes lit up when she started using it.","“This is good stuff!” Aunt Qing tugged at Feng Wu’s arm in excitement. “With this, it’ll be much easier to calculate the items. I won’t have to worry about making a mistake anymore. I can go through the math with the inscription calculator after calculating it in my head. I won’t make any errors again. Xiao Wu, you’re amazing!”","Feng Wu smiled. “There were materials nearby. I wouldn’t have been able to make it anywhere else.”"]},{"number":3258,"title":"Chapter 3258 It’s Ji Ying","paragraphs":["3258 It’s Ji Ying","After giving Auntie Qing some benefits and getting closer to her, Feng Wu would be able to ask more questions.","Now was a good time.","Feng Wu asked Auntie Qing, “Why is the Magical Equipment Division so secretive? There aren’t many people coming and going every day, are there?”","Feng Wu and Auntie Qing were the only ones in the room, so they spoke casually, as if they were just chatting.","Auntie Qing was happy to have someone beside her. In addition, Feng Wu had done her a huge favor, so Auntie Qing told her everything she knew in return.","She was quite a special figure here.","Other people had to restrain themselves from talking about certain things, but Auntie Qing didn’t.","She told Feng Wu, “We hardly ever have any visitors. Today is an exception.”","Feng Wu looked surprised. “Wow, what’s going on today? Did something good happen? Is that why more people are coming and going?”","Auntie Qing said, “I don’t know if anything good happened, but you’re definitely my good news.”","Feng Wu couldn’t let Auntie Qing digress.","She went back to the original topic. “I wonder who is the person who arrived here on the same day as me. Are they going to Imperial College?”","Auntie Qing smiled. “You’re the only new inscription master. The other two are old friends. One of them is our deputy minister.”","Feng Wu asked, “Deputy Minister? Is that the Elder Wu I saw before?”","Auntie Qing smiled and said, “We have two deputy ministers here. One is Elder Wu, who is in charge of handing out assignments. The other one is Mr. Zhao. He’s in charge of our security.”","Feng Wu said, “What? Mr. Zhao is back today?”","Auntie Qing nodded. “Anyway, he often goes back and forth. We’re used to it. I remember someone else went out today.”","Feng Wu looked at Auntie Qing.","Auntie Qing slapped her head. “Gosh, why can’t I remember?”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. My dear Auntie Qing, please don’t forget at such a critical moment!","She looked at Auntie Qing. “Is he an inscription master? Can he go out often? If I know who he is, I can ask him to bring me something...”","Feng Wu’s words sounded casual, but in fact, she was guiding Auntie Qing so that she could remember.","It worked!","The next moment, Auntie Qing slapped her head. “I remember who it was! It was Ji Ying!”","Ji Ying?","Why did that name sound so familiar? Feng Wu felt she had heard that name before.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","“Ji Ying? Master Duanmu’s eldest disciple?” Feng Wu looked at Auntie Qing with sparkling eyes.","“You’ve heard of him too?” Auntie Qing’s inquisitive eyes lit up. “Ji Ying is very influential in our Magical Equipment Division. He’s a Level 8 inscription master and Master Duanmu’s first disciple. He has a bright future ahead of him. Are you engaged to anyone?”","Feng Wu sighed. “Auntie Qing, you’re not trying to set me up with him, are you?”","What Auntie Qing said surprised Feng Wu.","Auntie Qing looked at Feng Wu and said earnestly, “I treat you as one of us, so I’ll tell you the truth.”","Auntie Qing whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Huh?","Feng Wu looked at Auntie Qing in surprise.","She hadn’t expected that. Auntie Qing had told her to be wary of Ji Ying and not to fall for him.","Feng Wu smiled wryly. Of course, she wouldn’t fall for Ji Ying, but...","“Didn’t you say Ji Ying is very popular in the Magical Equipment Division? Why...”"]},{"number":3259,"title":"Chapter 3259 The Past","paragraphs":["3259 The Past","“Didn’t you say Ji Ying is very popular in the Magical Equipment Division? Why...” Feng Wu asked curiously.","Aunt Qing told her seriously, “Ji Ying is indeed an impressive figure here, and many girls are secretly in love with him, but he’s... Listen to me. Don’t fall for him. He doesn’t have a conscience!”","Aunt Qing then whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","She cried out and looked at Auntie Qing. “How could he do such a thing?!”","Auntie Qing said, “Right? He’s definitely not an ideal candidate!”","Feng Wu nodded and told Auntie Qing what she had seen at Mo Ziming’s place.","Auntie Qing laughed coldly. “Ji Ying is taking advantage of his master’s reputation. Good for him. He even dares to ridicule Master Wang.”","Feng Wu said curiously, “Master Wang and Master Duanmu seem to have a grudge against each other.”","Aunt Qing let out a long sigh. “This is a story from a long time ago. If you were to ask someone else, they might not be able to tell you. Only the older generation of inscription masters know. These newcomers have no idea.”","Feng Wu’s eyes sparkled as she looked at Auntie Qing.","What could Auntie Qing hide from her?","She told Feng Wu that while this Master Duanmu was good at inscriptions, he wasn’t a good person.","Back then, Master Duanmu and Master Wang were fellow disciples. Their master also had a female disciple, and the two young men fell in love with her.","However, the girl liked Master Wang.","No one knew what Master Duanmu did next, but he forced his junior sister to marry him.","She frowned. “Did she marry him in the end?”","“She did.” Aunt Qing sighed. “After they were married, Master Wang left his hometown and never returned. After Master Duanmu finally forced his junior sister to marry him, he didn’t treat her well and married another wife.”","“Wife? How can she be a wife?” Feng Wu frowned. “He already has an official wife. Other women can only be concubines, right?”","Aunt Qing nodded. “But Master Duanmu raised that lady’s status despite that, giving her the title of Madam Ru. That’s the same as making her another wife.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Master Duanmu was clearly unsatisfied with his first wife.","“And?” She had a feeling she was about to hear a melodramatic story.","As expected, Aunt Qing told her, “Later on, Madam Ru became very powerful. She was Master Duanmu’s favorite, and he spent all day in his room learning inscriptions. Madame Ru actually tortured the junior sister until the latter became sick. At that time, the junior sister was already pregnant, and the mistreatment caused her to miscarry. Just when she needed to recover from it, Madam Ru deliberately created an accident and made her fall into the stream. It was winter at that time.”","She asked, “Did Master Duanmu know about this?”","Auntie Qing slammed the table angrily. “Is he dead? He’s a living person. His wife was tortured to this extent in front of him, and he wasn’t blind. He must know, but he just acquiesced.”","Feng Wu frowned. “That’s worse than killing her. Master Duanmu went too far.”","Auntie Qing said, “He was taking revenge because she was in love with Master Wang before they were married. Any girl can fall in love with one or two talented young men before they get married. Right, Xiao Wu?”"]},{"number":3260,"title":"Chapter 3260 Madam Ru","paragraphs":["3260 Madam Ru","“Ahem...” Feng Wu didn’t know how to answer her.","Auntie Qing went back to the topic. “Anyway, when Master Wang came back to visit his junior sister, he saw her on her last breath. She used to be such a fair and tender girl who had never done any housework. When they met again, she had been tortured into an old woman with rough fingers and a withered face. She wasn’t even 30 years old...”","As Auntie Qing spoke, her eyes filled with tears. “Madam Ru was the same age as the junior sister, but she was still bright, beautiful and delicate, looking as fresh as a sixteen-year-old girl. Why do good people die in vain, but evil lives for a thousand years?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s how the world works. The good guys get bullied, and the bad guys get to enjoy themselves.”","Auntie Qing looked at the girl in astonishment. She didn’t expect Feng Wu to be so understanding.","Feng Wu smiled. “But good and evil will always be paid back. It’s only a matter of time.”","Auntie Qing exhaled. “I hope you’re right.”","Feng Wu was confident of her verdict. For example, Master Duanmu had already annoyed her, and his life would become quite unpleasant.","Feng Wu then asked, “Where’s Madam Ru? Is she still alive?”","Auntie Qing sneered. “Of course she’s still alive. She even wants to compete with me for the position of logistics officer. My husband is the minister! She must be dreaming!!”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Auntie Qing continued, “By the way, she’s Lady Duanmu now. If you call her Madam Ru again, she’ll be furious.”","Feng Wu chuckled again.","Auntie Qing thought of something else. “Guess what? That junior sister brought Lady Duanmu back when she found the latter on the ground, covered in blood. In the end, it became the story of the farmer and the snake.”","The more Auntie Qing spoke, the more indignant she became. “Why should we be good? The bad guys are so happy now.”","Feng Wu comforted Auntie Qing. “Not necessarily. I don’t think things will end well for Madam Ru. However, there must be something special about her that Master Duanmu likes.”","Auntie Qing said “What can possibly be unique about her? She’s delicate, shy and gentle, and can coax men. Guess what? My husband actually told me to learn from her! Bah! Does he want me to be as vicious as her?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Doesn’t Mr. Qing know what Madam Ru has done?”","Auntie Qing said, “How can men see all that? They only see superficial things. Other than that, they’ll say women are all jealous. They say we’re all jealous of other women’s good looks and good personalities... Isn’t that infuriating?”","The more Auntie Qing spoke, the angrier she got, but Feng Wu burst out laughing.","Auntie Qing stared at her. “What are you laughing at?”","Feng Wu said, “I thought Mr. Qing was a henpecked husband. How dare he say that? Wasn’t he afraid of the consequences?”","Auntie Qing said, “Of course there were consequences. I chased him with a frying pan until he was almost crippled!”","Feng Wu pursed her lips and smiled. She could tell from Auntie Qing’s tone that she still had feelings for her husband.","Feng Wu changed the subject. “What about Ji Ying? What did he do?”","Aunt Qing said, “Ji Ying was brought back by Madam Ru herself. He’s both a disciple and a godson. By then, Master Duanmu had already been deceived by that woman. Naturally, he would do whatever she said.”"]},{"number":3261,"title":"Chapter 3261 The Honey Trap","paragraphs":["3261 The Honey Trap","“I don’t know what’s going on with this Ji Ying, but he learns inscriptions very fast. According to my kid, it seems Ji Ying built a solid foundation when he was young. He can simply memorize inscriptions and use them after a short while.","“But something’s very strange.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s strange?”","Aunt Qing said, “It’s very strange. After Ji Ying grew up, he didn’t have such talent anymore. His speed at learning inscriptions isn’t much faster than my boy now. That’s why my boy said that he had a good foundation when he was young.”","A thought flashed across Feng Wu’s mind, but it was too fast for her to catch.","She then asked, “Then... which clan is Ji Ying from?”","Auntie Qing said, “Which clan? I don’t remember if he belongs to any clan. I think he was a poor kid adopted by the Duanmu family. If he had a clan, why would he find a new one?”","Feng Wu said, “But didn’t your kid say that Ji Ying had a foundation as a child? Only a good family can nurture a child’s inscription skills from a young age. Ordinary families can’t afford to do that.”","It was very extravagant to hire an inscription master to teach a child.","Auntie Qing was stumped and looked at Feng Wu. “You’re right.”","And then? Feng Wu stared into Auntie Qing’s eyes.","Aunt Qing looked suspicious. “Why didn’t I think of this before? But that shouldn’t matter, right? Maybe his family fell from grace in the past?”","Aunt Qing didn’t think much of it, but she made a mental note of it.","It was very difficult to achieve Level 8 in inscriptions.","How many people were there in the Junwu Empire? At least a million people. However, among them, only Elder Mei, Elder Yan and Master Wang Zhiheng here had reached Level 8.","The Military Academy had a few more, but not too many.","Feng Wu had reached that level because she had her beautiful master, who was the most capable cultivator on the continent.","So...","How could Ji Ying have become a Level 8 inscription master?","Feng Wu took the opportunity to chat with Auntie Qing for a while longer, learning everything she needed to know about the Military Academy’s side. Only then did she get up to leave.","Auntie Qing was quite reluctant to see her leave.","She kept telling Feng Wu to visit more often.","Feng Wu smiled. “Sure. I’ll come here often when I’m free. I hope you don’t find me annoying.”","On her way back, she ran into Mo Ziming.","She had already found out that the conflict between Mo Ziming and Ji Ying stemmed from their masters.","Master Duanmu had always been mighty, condescending and arrogant. He and Master Wang had a grudge against each other because of their junior sister’s marriage and misfortune. How could they let this matter rest?","Thus, the two sides started fighting.","Mo Ziming had always been suppressed, mocked and humiliated by Ji Ying. It would be strange if he didn’t hate Ji Ying.","Feng Wu felt sorry for Mo Ziming when she saw him.","Mo Ziming looked a little embarrassed. He had wanted to put on a good show in front of his junior sister, but in the end, he was humiliated by Ji Ying.","“Xiao Wu...” As soon as Mo Ziming started talking, a person walked toward them.","It was Ji Ying again.","“Young lady, do you know who I am?” Ji Ying, who had returned, stood in front of Feng Wu with his most elegant posture.","As he tried to seduce her, he glanced at Mo Ziming provocatively.","Mo Ziming was furious.","Ji Ying tried to reel Feng Wu in with his crooked smile."]},{"number":3262,"title":"Chapter 3262 I’ll Build My Own Fighter Jet","paragraphs":["3262 I’ll Build My Own Fighter Jet","“You must be Miss Feng Wu. I’m really sorry. I left in a hurry just now and forgot to greet you. I’m Ji Ying, Master Duanmu’s eldest disciple. Miss Feng Wu, I’d like to get to know you better.”","Crossing her arms, Feng Wu gave Ji Ying a half-smile.","How hilarious. Ji Ying was actually trying to seduce her.","Feng Xun was ten times more handsome than he was. Where did Ji Ying get the confidence that he could seduce her?","Mo Ziming was furious because he felt he had his eye on the girl first.","“Ji Ying, what are you doing?!” Mo Ziming glared at Ji Ying.","Ji Ying unhurriedly glanced at him. “Do I need your approval to court the girl I like?”","How straightforward!","Mo Ziming glared at Ji Ying, unable to say a word.","Ji Ying smiled at him. “Don’t tell me you’re in love with Miss Feng Wu, too.”","Mo Ziming’s face turned red, but he didn’t say anything.","Ji Ying smiled and looked at Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, who do you think is better, me or Mo Ziming?”","She gave Ji Ying another half-smile.","Ji Ying didn’t feel embarrassed at all. He even took another step forward and said with a smile, “Miss Feng Wu, do you know that Master Duanmu is the most powerful master in the entire Magical Equipment Department? He’s at Level 9 now.”","Feng Wu asked, “So?”","Miss Feng Wu was actually talking to someone like Ji Ying. Mo Ziming felt like he was about to explode. He took a step forward and pulled Feng Wu behind him, while he stood between Feng Wu and Ji Ying.","His gesture was obvious, but Ji Ying ignored him and smiled at Feng Wu.","“Do you want to come to Duanmu’s Workshop?” Ji Ying smiled at Feng Wu. “Our workshop is led by a Level 9 master. You can learn a lot. Moreover —”","Ji Ying smiled at her. “Guess what?”","He whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","He said, “Master Duanmu will soon build a fighter jet.”","Ji Ying’s eyes sparkled. “It’ll be the first fighter jet of our empire. All participants will be remembered forever.”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you think I’m after fame?”","Ji Ying said, “Everybody is.”","Feng Wu laughed. “Not me.”","Ji Ying wouldn’t believe her.","Feng Wu said, “That reminds me of something.”","Ji Ying frowned. “What?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll never become a freeloader. I can make my own fighter jet.”","Ji Ying seemed to have heard the funniest joke in the world. He raised his head and laughed out loud. “Gosh, my belly... Little Feng Wu, you’re so funny. Why are you so adorable?”","Ji Ying wanted to pinch Feng Wu’s cheeks.","Mo Ziming raised his hand and blocked Ji Ying!","Feng Wu watched Ji Ying stumble back.","Ji Ying glared at Mo Ziming. “I’m gonna kill you!”","Mo Ziming wouldn’t back down. “If you want to fight, bring it on!”","Seeing that the two of them were about to fight, a person stopped them.","“Stop.”","It was Master Wang.","Ji Ying didn’t have much respect for Master Wang because both of them were Level 8 inscription masters. The two of them were equal."]},{"number":3263,"title":"Chapter 3263 Elated","paragraphs":["3263 Elated","However, just as Ji Ying was about to ridicule Master Wang, he suddenly saw the purple ribbon and golden seal on the latter’s waist. His eyes instantly narrowed.","In the imperial court, only the prime minister, the grand commander, and the grand minister were qualified to have the golden seal and purple ribbon.","In the Magical Equipment Division, such an ornament represented a Level 9 inscription master!","Ji Ying was a Level 8 inscription master, so he had a silver seal with a green ribbon.","Ji Ying stared at Master Wang. “You...”","He couldn’t believe it...","How did Master Wang get his golden seal and purple ribbon?","He thought only Master Duanmu was qualified to have them.","However, Ji Ying knew very well that since Master Wang had them, he wasn’t lying, because such a lie would be too easy to expose.","Ji Ying knew that arguing with Master Wang was hardly the most important thing right now, nor did he have time to pursue a beautiful girl. He had to inform Master Duanmu and his wife right away.","He said, “Xiao Wu, I’ll see you around.”","Feng Wu gave him a half-smile. “If you dare.”","Ji Ying gave Feng Wu a suspicious look and didn’t quite understand what she meant. Why wouldn’t he dare?","Ji Ying gave Feng Wu a meaningful look before he turned to leave.","By then, Mo Ziming finally noticed his master’s golden seal and purple ribbon. His eyes lit up. “Master?! Master?!”","His voice was very loud, and they were by the main road. Many people coming and going noticed the golden seal and purple ribbon on Master Wang’s waist. They immediately spread the news in a frantic manner.","This was incredible news.","Imperial College had declined because their most advanced inscription masters were only at Level 8, while their opponents were Level 9 ones.","Imperial College used to have a person in charge, but he was forced out by Master Duanmu. Now that Master Wang had reached Level 9, how could the people from Imperial College not be excited?!","The feeling of exultation made them so happy that they cried!","Meanwhile, Master Wang said to Mo Ziming and Feng Wu, “We’ll talk when we get back to the workshop.”","Feng Wu and Mo Ziming nodded.","Feng Wu remained calm.","After all, her breakthrough in inscriptions was still very smooth because she had advanced to Level 8 without any obstacles. Since Master Wang was already at Level 9, and she was at least as good as him, she should be at Level 9 as well.","Moreover, she was much better than Master Wang.","However, Mo Ziming didn’t feel as calm.","What was that? His master had made a breakthrough?","Level 9? That was the same as Master Duanmu!","Mo Ziming almost couldn’t stop his urge to scream.","He had been waiting for this day for too long!","The news spread faster than they expected.","When Feng Wu and the others arrived at Wang’s Workshop, the four senior brothers were standing at the door and looking at Master Wang in excitement.","Master Wang was also very happy.","He had waited for this day for too long.","However, he managed to remain calm and only waved at the others.","“Master! Are you really at Level 9?” Yue Ban rushed to their side.","Master Wang pretended to be calm and nodded with a straight face.","Yue Ban was trembling. “Master, the Military Academy won’t dare bully us anymore, right?! We have a Level 9 inscription master now!”"]},{"number":3264,"title":"Chapter 3264 Master Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3264 Master Feng Wu","Master Wang didn’t respond to that.","Master Duanmu had been a Level 9 inscription master for years and had gained enough authority to hide the truth from the masses. He also had a close relationship with his superiors. Such a situation couldn’t be changed overnight.","Luckily...","Master Wang patted his chest pocket, where he had put the ten drawings.","!!","They were his only hope of building a fighter jet.","The drawings also enlightened him, making it possible for him to rise to Level 9.","At that thought, Master Wang looked at Feng Wu with gratitude.","Yue Ban followed Master Wang’s gaze and smiled when he spotted Feng Wu. “Good things come in pairs. Congratulations, Master!”","Master Wang looked at Yue Ban in bewilderment. “What do you mean?”","Yue Ban said, “Master, you’ve become a Level 9 inscription master, and that’s the first piece of good news. Another happy event is having a lovely junior sister!”","A lovely junior sister?","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Master Wang shook his head. “She’s not your junior sister.”","His disciples were all flustered.","They didn’t want to lose their junior sister.","Mo Ziming stepped forward. “Master, Feng Wu is so smart. She must be a quick learner! Please take her in!”","His junior brothers all chimed in.","Master Wang shook his head. “That won’t be appropriate.”","Appropriate?","They all looked at Master Wang in bewilderment, finding his choice of words rather strange.","Master Wang said, “Miss Feng Wu is the only reason that I rose to Level 9.”","He walked up to Feng Wu, straightened his clothes, and bowed.","His demeanor was so formal.","The Level 9 master was bowing at Feng Wu.","All his five disciples were shocked.","They looked from Master Wang to Feng Wu in amazement.","“Thank you, Master Feng Wu, for your instructions.”","Everyone was astonished.","They all looked at Feng Wu.","What did their master mean?","?!","“I thought you were a low level inscription master; I’m so ashamed of myself.”","The others were speechless.","So?","What did that mean?!","Mo Ziming was the most astonished of them all.","He had offered to let Feng Wu stay in his room in the workshop and had offered to teach her a thing or two. What he just heard shocked him.","Meanwhile, Master Wang stood straight again.","Mo Ziming ground his teeth and stared at Master Wang. “Master, what do you mean?”","Master Wang said mildly, “I only rose to Level 9 because of Miss Feng Wu’s patient instructions. What’s so hard to understand?”","Of course Mo Ziming understood it; he just had a hard time accepting it.","If what Master Wang said was true, Mo Ziming would lose all hope.","He stared at Feng Wu in frustration. “Why didn’t you tell me you were so good at inscriptions?!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","What kind of question was that?","She always tried to tell other people the truth, but all they could see was her pretty face, and wouldn’t believe what she said. Why couldn’t a pretty girl also be a clever one?","Mo Ziming threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and ran out of the room.","Feng Wu was speechless."]},{"number":3265,"title":"Chapter 3265 The Second Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["3265 The Second Immortal Spiritual Fruit","Feng Wu looked at Yue Ban, who scratched his head in embarrassment.","Things had turned around so abruptly that he didn’t know how to face Feng Wu.","Master Wang’s attitude toward Feng Wu had changed so fast because he had personally seen Feng Wu create the drawings, which demonstrated her capability.","He was genuinely impressed.","!!","Feng Wu said, “Unfortunately, I don’t know the second half of the fighter jet’s inscriptions yet.”","Master Wang said, “We already have the first half, and that’s fast enough.”","Yue Ban said, “I heard from Ji Ying that they’ve figured out 80% of the inscription propeller. It won’t be long before they complete everything.”","Master Wang smacked his forehead. “Let’s go. We need to speed up.”","He then dragged Feng Wu away.","“Master, we...” Dong Chen, who hadn’t said much until now, suddenly spoke.","Master Wang said, “Come here! Yue Ban, fetch your senior brother and tell him to join us! Quickly!”","Feng Wu only realized how stubborn Master Wang was when they started working together.","He would work on each word in turn until he figured out everything.","Feng Wu rubbed her temples and went back to work with Master Wang.","In less than two days, Feng Wu worked out two drawings on her own. Master Wang examined and verified them.","That meant that they had figured out 60% of the fighter jet.","They were still behind Master Duanmu, but not by very much.","Feng Wu couldn’t delay anymore.","She had more important things to do.","The second fruit would ripen in less than two days.","Feng Wu had spent the last two days on research and gathering information on the Magical Equipment Division. By now, she had figured out what to do.","She told Master Wang her speculation.","Master Wang’s eyes widened. “Is that true?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I have very important things to do now. I can’t stay here. Master Wang, take care of yourself.”","Master Wang didn’t want Feng Wu to leave since she was their only hope of building the fighter jet; he was only the help.","Once she was gone, the research would come to a halt.","Master Wang wanted to persuade Feng Wu to stay, but Feng Wu shook her head.","The second fruit was too important to lose.","Feng Wu made some arrangements before leaving.","Of course, the others didn’t know anything about it, including Master Duanmu.","Coming in and out of the Magical Equipment Division was a difficult thing, but Feng Wu had become quite familiar with Auntie Qing, and the latter would make an exception for her.","When Feng Wu left the Magical Equipment Division, Auntie Qing said earnestly, “I can cover for you for three days at most. After that, you’re on your own. Get back in time.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Don’t worry. I’ll be back in three days.”","Auntie Qing added, “Elder Dongfang must never know.”","Feng Wu nodded again. “She won’t”","After saying goodbye to Auntie Qing, Feng Wu wanted to go back to the fortress to see if Jun Linyuan had come out of seclusion, but she remembered what Auntie Qing told her.","If she went back, it might take her too long. What if the Immortal Spiritual Fruit ripened faster than expected?","She decided not to visit Jun Linyuan. When he finished cultivating, he could come to her."]},{"number":3266,"title":"Chapter 3266 Sacred Imperial Spider","paragraphs":["3266 Sacred Imperial Spider","At that thought, Feng Wu headed for the Dayless Woods right away.","She went through the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods first.","The spider was perched on a branch, looking bored. Bunches of grapes dangled from another branch, and the spider was popping them out of fun.","All it could think of was Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan.","The last thing it expected to see was the adorable Feng Wu hanging out with the terrifying Jun Linyuan. To make it worse, they were even a couple!","The spider had hidden in the dark and watched them for a while. Poor little Feng Wu. Jun Linyuan had total control of her.","The Sacred Imperial Spider couldn’t understand why she wasn’t afraid of him!","“The girl said she would be back. When can I see her again?”","Somehow, the Sacred Imperial Spider felt bored.","It missed having Feng Wu around. She brought so much life to these woods, laughing one moment and asking for help the next. She was so much fun.","The spider was still pondering over that question when a figure popped into sight.","The spider recognized the person.","“Feng Wu?!” The spider was astonished. What a coincidence!","However, the spider only glanced at Feng Wu and snorted. “I thought you’d never come back!”","“I said I would visit you, and here I am.” Feng Wu chuckled.","The spider snorted. “How long has it been since the last time we met? I thought you’d never come! Did that devil lock you up?”","“What devil?” Feng Wu was perplexed.","“He’s not a devil to you! You were so familiar with that teenager. Don’t pretend you don’t know him!”","Feng Wu said, “Are you talking about Jun Linyuan?”","The spider snorted and looked away. “I don’t want to hear that name!”","Feng Wu chuckled. She remembered Jun Linyuan said he used to ransack the Dayless Woods when he was little.","Jun Linyuan could beat up the Sacred Imperial Spider when he was only a little boy, while Feng Wu was still far inferior to the spider now. The comparison made Feng Wu rather frustrated.","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t say anything, the spider stared at her. “What? Has Jun Linyuan made you forget how to speak?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","The spider said proudly, “What, are you afraid of him? Just hit him back!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you bold enough to do that?”","The spider didn’t know what to say.","It glared at Feng Wu before turning away.","It had waited so long to see her again, but she hadn’t brought it any joy.","Feng Wu said, “Hey, don’t be so petty.”","The spider wouldn’t talk to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was on the same side as Jun Linyuan, and the spider was very upset.","Feng Wu said, “If you don’t talk to me, I’m leaving now!”","The spider still wouldn’t talk to her.","It soon realized things had become very quiet, so it turned around.","Where was little Feng Wu? Was she really gone?","The spider complained, “Why did she run away? I’m not done yet! Jun Linyuan beat me up, and he’ll pay for that! Feng Wu, come back!”","There was no sound at all.","The spider became flustered.","“Was I so mean just then?","“Did I scare Xiao Wu off?”","Just then, the spider saw a person hanging upside down from a branch, and her face was right in front of the spider."]},{"number":3267,"title":"Chapter 3267 I Must Find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["3267 I Must Find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit","“Boo!” Feng Wu stuck out her tongue at the spider.","The spider was scared out of its wits.","“You!” It glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu retorted, “Did you say you want to get back at him? Aren’t you afraid Jun Linyuan will cut off your other legs?”","!!","That poked the spider in its sore spot.","It glared at Feng Wu.","What was wrong with Jun Linyuan? He was a capable cultivator who didn’t talk much. Why was he showing off his achievements to a little girl?","Feng Wu said, “Alright, alright. I’m not siding with Jun Linyuan. Don’t worry.”","The spider snorted.","Of course, it wouldn’t believe Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took out a bunch of snacks from her pocket. They were all human food that she had taken from the fortress.","Feng Wu had traded her points for them, and she gave quite a few to the Sacred Imperial Spider before saying, “I really have to leave now.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider was unhappy again.","Feng Wu said, “I’m going to the Dongsang Kingdom’s fortress this time. Don’t worry, I’ll be back in three days. I’ll hang out with you then.”","She turned to leave.","“Are you going there for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?” the Sacred Imperial Spider asked from behind Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stopped involuntarily and turned to look at the spider.","The Sacred Imperial Spider said, “You are.”","Feng Wu didn’t answer.","The spider said, “Did you take the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit, too?”","Feng Wu still said nothing.","The spider said, “I knew it was you! Only a smart human girl like you can swindle such a good thing from Sakiya.”","Feng Wu chuckled and said nothing.","“Sakiya isn’t with the peacock anymore,” the Sacred Imperial Spider told Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","The spider said, “You tricked Sakiya once, so of course, he’s going to learn from it. A few days ago, he moved the entire Immortal Spiritual Tree into his fortress.”","“What?” Feng Wu was genuinely surprised. “It’s been moved to the fortress?”","The difficulty had increased exponentially.","If it were still in the peacock’s forest, Feng Wu could have disguised herself as Bu Jingyu and snuck around Mr. Sakiya to steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","She had planned everything.","She never expected Mr. Sakiya to take such drastic measures!","He had moved the tree into the fortress.","If Feng Wu wanted to steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she would have to get into the fortress first.","However, the fortress was filled with capable experts and was even more heavily guarded. If she wasn’t careful...","Feng Wu felt an unprecedented sense of danger.","She looked at the spider and said solemnly, “I know it’s very dangerous, but I must get that Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","She had to get it even if she had to risk her life.","The spider asked, “Is it that important?”","Feng Wu nodded solemnly. “I owe someone a favor. If I don’t pay them back, I won’t have a clear conscience for the rest of my life. Yes, it’s very important.”","Bao Er was dying...","Feng Wu felt guilty every time she thought of the little girl in the golden palace.","With this guilt, she wouldn’t get too far in her cultivation.","The spider asked, “Where’s your young man?”","He’s not mine. Feng Wu wanted to protest, but didn’t say anything in the end because the mood felt quite solemn right now.","Feng Wu said, “He has his own things to do.”","The spider took a deep breath and finally made up its mind. It spat out a golden bead and handed it to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the Sacred Imperial Spider in confusion."]},{"number":3268,"title":"Chapter 3268 Immortal Spiritual Tree","paragraphs":["3268 Immortal Spiritual Tree","The spider took a deep breath and finally made up its mind. It spat out a golden bead and handed it to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the Sacred Imperial Spider in confusion.","The spider stared at Feng Wu. “Take it.”","It didn’t want Feng Wu to leave, so it feigned a harsh tone.","!!","Feng Wu said, “You said last time this golden bead can help me avoid the other beast kings in the Dayless Woods, right? Thank you, little spider.”","“Avoid other beast kings? Do you think that’s the only use of my golden bead? You’ll be so surprised!”","The Sacred Imperial Spider didn’t say anything else. It only urged Feng Wu, “Go, now. Don’t bother me. I’m going to sleep!”","After that, it lay down on a thick tree trunk and turned its back to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the sky and saw that it was going to rain.","Traveling in the rain wasn’t very convenient, so she said to the spider, “I’m really leaving now, you hear me?”","“Yes...” The spider sounded upset.","Soon, Feng Wu was dashing toward the Dongsang Kingdom’s fortress, which was known as Sun Castle.","The spider only sat up after Feng Wu left.","Seeing that Feng Wu had turned into a black dot in the forest, the spider shook its head.","“Why does she have to get the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? I don’t know if she’ll come back alive. How annoying!”","It turned away from Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu headed north without stopping.","There were three ways to get to Sun Castle: by water, by land, and through the mountains.","Nest, the Junwu Empire’s fortress, was in the south, and Sun Castle was in the north.","A vast grassland sat in the middle, which was also their battlefield.","The ocean was in the east, and the Dayless Woods was in the west.","Therefore, she could take the sea route in the east, travel across the grassland battlefield in the middle, or go through the Dayless Woods in the west.","Feng Wu hadn’t explored the sea route yet, nor was she familiar with it, so she wouldn’t choose it.","The central battlefield was a flat grassland. Anyone from Nest or Sun Castle would immediately notice a moving figure. There probably wouldn’t be anywhere to hide. She couldn’t choose that path.","Hence, Feng Wu chose the Dayless Woods.","The Dayless Woods might be a dangerous place for other people, but Feng Wu had a map of it in her head as well as the Sacred Imperial Spider’s golden bead. As long as she was careful, she would be safe there.","When she reached the peacock’s woods, Feng Wu thought for a moment and decided to check it out.","What if Mr. Sakiya had left some clues there?","However, when Feng Wu got there, things were completely different from what she had seen before.","The row of houses had all been demolished.","Large trees had also been transplanted in the originally flat courtyard.","At a glance, Feng Wu wouldn’t have noticed anything if she hadn’t looked closely.","It was as if it had been a jungle all along.","No one would know Mr. Sakiya or the wooden houses had ever been here.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up!","Wait!","On the spot where the Immortal Spiritual Tree had been, there was still an Immortal Spiritual Tree.","It hadn’t been moved away?","Feng Wu’s eyes flickered.","Had the spider lied to her?","No, Feng Wu rejected that idea right away.","The spider was terrified of Jun Linyuan. It would never lie to her.","Moreover, she could tell the spider treated her as a friend.","So...","Feng Wu was about to take a closer look, when she saw a peacock with its tail spread looking at the Immortal Spiritual Tree as it slowly circled it."]},{"number":3269,"title":"Chapter 3269 Feng Wu the Great Actress (1)","paragraphs":["3269 Feng Wu the Great Actress (1)","Suddenly, the Peacock King turned its head in Feng Wu’s direction.","Feng Wu had been hiding behind a rock, and she flinched at its stare.","If she remembered correctly, the Peacock King was on Mr. Sakiya’s side.","But that wasn’t completely true.","!!","In any case, Feng Wu had bribed the peacock with a Semi-Divine pill last time. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to escape after stealing the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","At that moment, Feng Wu noticed the peacock was mumbling something as it walked.","“Sakiya, why are you so treacherous? You’re already gone, but you still set this trap and want me to guard it for you.”","Feng Wu thought, “What’s that peacock doing?”","The peacock glanced in Feng Wu’s direction and continued, “Who are you guarding against? The second prince’s men? Poor prince. If his men were here, they’d probably be blown up.”","Feng Wu thought, “Who’s the second prince?”","The peacock glanced in her direction again. “What a pity. The thief who stole the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit was so smart. She must know you’ve set a trap here. Do you think your trick will work?”","Feng Wu finally understood.","Before Mr. Sakiya left, he set a trap. She and the second prince’s men were his enemies. He didn’t care which of them walked into the trap.","Feng Wu looked at the Immortal Spiritual Tree.","The fruit was indeed still on it.","If the Peacock King hadn’t said so in advance and she hadn’t carefully studied it, she might not have been able to tell that it was a fake Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","This Peacock King was actually quite lovely.","Feng Wu smiled and threw a Semi-Divine pill at it.","With a swoosh, the pill drew an arc in the air. The Peacock King pretended not to be aware of its surroundings, but its body twisted slightly, and it easily caught the Semi-Divine pill with its claw.","After that, the Peacock King quickly hid it in its sleeve.","Its expression remained stoic. It glanced at the Immortal Spiritual Tree and walked back in satisfaction.","Feng Wu dashed off toward Sun Castle.","Although she was now a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, it was still very difficult to refine Semi-Divine pills. The success rate was quite low. Her success rate was already on the higher side, but up until now, she had only saved up a bottle of pills.","The medicinal herbs were difficult to gather.","Luckily, Feng Wu still had some all-purpose transformation liquid.","The liquid worked on magical beasts and plants the same way it did on human beings. Therefore, Feng Wu had been watering her herbs with the liquid, hoping to get some high-quality herbs.","Fearing that she would disturb her beautiful master, Feng Wu didn’t plant the herbs in her space. Instead, she planted them in the yard of the general’s mansion.","No one would touch the herbs planted there.","As Feng Wu moved through the woods, she mulled over the information the peacock had given her.","The second prince?","Feng Wu had been paying attention only to the talented, showy crown prince, Night Owl, and had forgotten to ask about the other princes.","Feng Wu recalled that the Dongsang Kingdom used a blood tax system.","Once the crown prince ascended the throne, his brothers would all die.","That included the second prince and all his other brothers."]},{"number":3270,"title":"Chapter 3270 Feng Wu the Great Actress (2)","paragraphs":["3270 Feng Wu the Great Actress (2)","The kings of the Dongsang Kingdom never had any uncles because once the new king ascended the throne, he would kill all his brothers!","Right now, Night Owl was the only one who had power. The other princes would definitely join forces to kill Night Owl in order to survive.","At that thought, Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. It seemed that she could make use of some of those people.","She had specially made some clothes for this occasion.","One side of the clothes was in the style of the Junwu Empire, but it was in the Dongsang Kingdom style on the other side. She only needed to turn the clothes inside out, and she would be dressed just like any other Dongsanger.","In addition, Feng Wu was fluent in the language of the Dongsang Kingdom and was an excellent actress. As long as she put her heart into her role, no one would see through her disguise.","Sun Castle was right ahead.","Feng Wu took out an armband from her pocket.","Feng Xun had dug up a lot from the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods, and she had kept a few armbands as props. Now, she could use them.","Feng Wu saw a team in the crowd. She threw something on the ground and hid herself.","There were five people on this team. At the front was a young man with a handsome face, and behind him were his companions.","There were four men and one woman in the team. The girl was a healer, and the other four were combat-type cultivators.","When they walked past Feng Wu’s hiding place and were a short distance away, Feng Wu emerged from the woods and shouted at them from behind, “Did you lose something?”","She spoke the Dongsang Kingdom’s language with perfect pronunciation.","Feng Wu had the Magical Soul Vine on her, and the Magical Soul Vine transmitted the language of the Dongsang Kingdom to her mind. Therefore, Feng Wu could speak the language with no accent at all.","Hence, the five people in front didn’t suspect Feng Wu at all when they turned around.","In their eyes, Feng Wu was a fair-skinned, sweet girl. She looked quite modest, and they liked her very much.","Feng Wu had an affable aura about her. When she smiled, her eyes curved into little crescent moons. Her smile was as warm as sunlight and seemed to have healing power. In the Dongsang Kingdom, being adorable was much more important than being beautiful.","The four teenage boys’ eyes lit up when they saw Feng Wu.","Pointing at a patch of grass behind them, Feng Wu stepped forward and asked, “Did you lose something?”","They followed Feng Wu’s finger and looked down.","There was a money bag on the ground. The money bag had the logo of the Magical Soul Vine that was unique to the Dongsang Kingdom on it, and the stitching was definitely in the style of the Dongsang Kingdom.","“What is it?” The most lively teenager in the group picked up the bag and casually opened it.","Everyone gasped when they saw what was inside!","Essence crystals!","The sunlight shone through the slight gaps in the leaves onto the essence crystals, making them sparkle.","There were hundreds of them!","“Funo, are those essence crystals?”","The others in the team all looked at the teenager named Funo.","Feng Wu made a mental note of the bright and cheerful teenager’s name.","Funo nodded and said to their captain, “Captain...”","The captain looked at Feng Wu. “These essence crystals...”","Feng Wu gave him a perfectly guileless look. “Aren’t those essence crystals yours? I was walking behind you, and I thought they were yours.","“If they aren’t yours, I’d better stay here and wait for the owner. They’re so valuable, the owner will definitely come here to look for them.”"]},{"number":3271,"title":"Chapter 3271 Sun Castle","paragraphs":["3271 Sun Castle","After that, Feng Wu was about to take the essence crystals back from Funo.","“Who says it’s not ours?”","Just then, the only girl on the team rushed up and snatched the bag of essence crystals from Feng Wu’s hands.","The other four members of the team looked at one another.","Funo wanted to speak, but the others gave him warning looks.","He shrugged in resignation and stopped talking.","Feng Wu asked innocently, “Are they really yours?”","The girl’s name was Hanae. She darted a look at Feng Wu and snorted. “If it’s not mine, do you think it’s yours?! I embroidered the pattern on the bag myself! Isn’t that right, Sanji?”","Hanae asked her friends.","Sanji’s sense of morality was obviously lower than Funo’s. He immediately nodded. “Yes, it’s Hanae’s. I can prove it.”","Funo was speechless.","The others in the team didn’t deny it either.","Feng Wu chuckled inwardly, but she still put on a sweet smile. “I told you it was yours. Wasn’t I right?”","She grinned, revealing her white teeth. Her smile was sweet and very adorable.","The captain glanced at Feng Wu. “Which team are you from? Why are you here alone?”","Feng Wu had caught quite a few people in the Dayless Woods and had learned about the distribution of the Dongsang Kingdom’s troops.","Dongsang was different from the Junwu Empire.","The Military Academy and Imperial College had always competed in the survival of the fittest.","The Dongsang Kingdom only had one army, and the great general was Xue Zhibei.","Below Xue Zhibei were two Guardians, followed by 50 Spiritual Overlord generals, who were under Mr. Sakiya’s control.","Each of them was in charge of 100 cultivators.","General Guchi was one of the cultivators.","Feng Wu said, “I’m Kita, a member of Group 8 under General Guchi. My team was broken up by the Junwu Empire in the Dayless Woods. We lost contact, and I couldn’t find anyone else.”","Feng Wu wasn’t making it up. As a matter of fact, she had taken out one of General Guchi’s teams on her way here, and it was Group 8.","She was playing Kita, one of the members of that group.","The team didn’t doubt Feng Wu’s words at all.","That was because she looked, talked and behaved just like any native Dongsanger.","Who would suspect her?","The captain looked at Feng Wu sympathetically. “Since you’re alone, why don’t you come with us?”","The other team members also nodded.","They felt guilty toward this girl.","They had just deceived such an innocent and kind girl...","Hanae frowned, but before she could say no, Feng Wu said with a smile, “Alright, let’s go back together. I’m scared to go alone. What if I run into bad people?”","Hence, with the help of a bag of essence crystals, Feng Wu managed to infiltrate the team.","Feng Wu’s performance along the way was flawless. She didn’t reveal much about herself but managed to learn a lot about them.","It turned out that the Dongsang Kingdom’s fortress wasn’t a wartime construction like the Junwu Empire’s. Instead, the Dongsang Kingdom was confident enough to build the fortress into a city.","In the middle of the city was the general’s residence. Mr. Sakiya and the crown prince both lived in the great general’s residence.","At the front of the city were 40 brigades led by Spiritual Kings. The other ten brigades led by Spiritual Overlords guarded the great general’s residence.","Between the front line and the great general’s residence was a wide street that connected the north and south.","There were shops on both sides of the street, and behind the shops were residential areas with individual courtyards."]},{"number":3272,"title":"Chapter 3272 Armory (1)","paragraphs":["3272 Armory (1)","This was very different from the Junwu Empire.","Nest Fortress was divided into different living quarters in the south and north. The students lived in the south, and the generals lived in the north.","But in Sun Castle, the residents were divided into groups.","There were 50 groups in total.","!!","They took turns guarding the front line. When they weren’t on duty, they stayed in Sun Castle.","There were quite a few shops here, many of which weren’t opened by cultivators. Commoners walked around the city.","In other words, when all of Nest Fortress was under martial law and preparing for war, everyone in Sun Castle was living comfortably, as if they were living in an ordinary city.","Feng Wu saw countless shops along the street.","There were many girls waving their handkerchiefs upstairs in the Spring Breeze Pavilion. The smell of food came out of a gourmet restaurant. There was an armory that sold armor and weapons, a pavilion that specialized in selling crossbows, and even a bookstore with rows of mahogany bookshelves.","Feng Wu had just arrived and wanted to quickly look around Sun Castle, so she turned to the others and said, “I’ll be safe here in Sun Castle. I guess it’s time to say goodbye.”","Feng Wu smiled and spoke in a sweet voice, and the teenagers liked her so much that they couldn’t bear to part with her.","Funo said, “We haven’t reached your group’s living quarters yet.”","Feng Wu smiled and pointed at the bookstore. “I’m going to buy some books and wait for my teammates. They might be back soon. I don’t know how long I’ll have to wait... So, I won’t keep you any longer.”","The teenagers all wanted to speak, but Funo beat them to it. “I’m free anyway. Captain, go and submit the mission. I’ll wait here with Miss Kita.”","He then looked at Feng Wu. “It’s not safe for a girl to wait by the roadside.”","The captain was very reluctant, but he had no choice after hearing what Funo said. In the end, he only nodded at Funo and Feng Wu and left with the team.","After they were some distance away, Hanae said mockingly, “Is Funo an idiot? He’s giving up the essence crystals for a pretty girl!”","Next to her, Sanji rubbed his nose. “But these essence crystals... I feel that I’ve let little Kita down.”","Hanae was furious. “Little Kita? Are you very familiar with her? Since when did she become little Kita?”","Sanji didn’t dare say a word.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Funo waited on the street.","Because Dongsangers preferred sweet and adorable girls, Feng Wu had chosen to dress up in that style.","A thin fringe covered her forehead, and it didn’t look thick or clumsy.","On her head were two cute buns. Her hair pins had bows on them, and a few strands of curly hair framed her face.","The dress wasn’t the bright red color she usually wore, but was in a delicate pink shade.","Her skin was as smooth as jade, so tender that one couldn’t bring themselves to touch it.","She looked soft and adorable. When she smiled, she had two dimples. She was lovely beyond description.","Funo stood beside her and stole glances at her from time to time. He bustled around and tried to be as courteous as he could.","Seeing that people passing by kept looking at her, Funo was a little jealous. He said to Feng Wu, “The sun is too bright here. Why don’t we take a break in the bookstore next door and read while we wait for your teammates?”","Feng Wu glanced at the bookstore.","She was interested in the bookstore, but she was even more interested in the armory.","Feng Wu wondered if there would be fighter jets for sale."]},{"number":3273,"title":"Chapter 3273 Armory (2)","paragraphs":["3273 Armory (2)","Without another word, Feng Wu chose to enter the armory.","All Funo wanted was to stay by Feng Wu’s side. He didn’t care which shop she went to.","After Feng Wu entered the armory, Funo immediately introduced, “This armory is the biggest weapon store in Sun Castle. What do you want to buy? I know the owner. He can give you a discount.”","Funo was trying to please Feng Wu, but Feng Wu only smiled at him and didn’t say much.","!!","The armory was indeed a top-notch weapon store. Other shops couldn’t compare with it.","The weapons were divided into knives, swords, crossbows, bows and so on.","The armor included light armor and heavy armor, in both male and female styles.","There were also inscription bombs.","However, the inscription bombs sold here were at relatively low levels. They weren’t as good as the ones which Mu Yan had given to her before.","Feng Wu couldn’t find a fighter jet.","It made sense. How could a store sell such precious military equipment?","However...","“That...” Feng Wu saw a small model of a fighter jet on the shelf.","Funo introduced enthusiastically, “This is a fighter jet model. Although it’s tiny, it has a small inscription propeller built in. It can fly.”","Feng Wu looked at Funo in surprise.","Seeing that Feng Wu didn’t believe him, Funo said, “Come with me to the backyard. I’ll show you.”","Funo seemed to be really familiar with the shop owner. He took the model to the backyard, and the shop owner only smiled and nodded, and didn’t stop him.","When they reached the backyard, Feng Wu kept an eye on Funo. To her surprise, the small fighter jet model really took off.","Funo looked at Feng Wu smugly, as if he was asking for praise. “Am I right? It really can fly.”","But Funo had no idea what Feng Wu was thinking.","After the model landed, Feng Wu let Funo see that she liked it very much. She couldn’t take her eyes off it, and it was obvious that she wanted it.","“You know that this isn’t for sale.” The shop owner stared at Funo and pulled him to the side. “This is the only one in the shop, and I got it from the military department. It’s used as decoration and to boost this shop’s appearance. You know that.”","“Uncle Wang, I beg you. Just let her play with it for a while. When she gets tired of it, I’ll bring it back. Is that okay?”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was staring at the inscription weapons and armor.","The Dongsang Kingdom was indeed worthy of its reputation. The level of the inscriptions on the armor was really high. No wonder when two teams of similar strength fought head-on, the Junwu Empire always had more casualties.","Their inscription armor and inscription weapons were so advanced.","Moreover, the cultivators could buy them directly from the armory.","The Junwu Empire wasn’t like that at all. Because of the difficulty in forging inscription armaments, only the stronger cultivators had the right to them, while the weaker ones had to wait in line.","Feng Wu picked up a long saber and looked at the price tag on the side.","One thousand essence crystals.","It was quite expensive. Ordinary people couldn’t afford it.","Feng Wu picked up the saber and studied it carefully, memorizing the data.","Meanwhile, the shop owner finally agreed to Funo’s request. He would lend the model of the fighter jet to Funo, but asked that Funo return it in three days.","“Thank you, Uncle Wang!” Funo was extremely grateful to the shop owner."]},{"number":3274,"title":"Chapter 3274 Curiosity","paragraphs":["3274 Curiosity","“Kita, let’s go play with the model jet!” Funo went up to Feng Wu and tried to take her hand.","However, Feng Wu dodged in time.","She frowned at Funo.","Funo was stunned. Hadn’t Kita always been a nice girl? Why did she suddenly become so distant...","!!","“I borrowed the model from the shop owner. Shall we go play together?” Funo quickly put on a bright smile.","Feng Wu’s eyes were much sharper than ordinary people’s, so she could tell Funo was a little annoyed. However, he suppressed his anger and continued to fawn over her.","Feng Wu was speechless.","How could she accept the courtship of a stranger, let alone someone with a bad temper like Funo?","Feng Wu nodded at him. “That won’t be necessary.”","Funo’s face darkened. “Kita, it took me some effort to borrow this.”","It was more like a rental because he had to pay a high fee. He could tell that Kita liked it very much.","Funo had already formed a plan on winning the innocent girl’s heart, but suddenly, the girl’s demeanor seemed to change. She didn’t look like a little lamb anymore.","Feng Wu said, “Enjoy the model yourself!”","After that, Feng Wu left the shop.","Funo immediately put down the model and chased after her, but when he rushed out, Kita was nowhere to be seen.","Funo was furious, and his eyes flashed with a malicious glint.","The shop owner looked at Funo with a smile. “This is the first time I’ve seen you fail. Why? Doesn’t that trick work anymore? Look at how scared the little girl was.”","Funo glared at the shop owner and cursed under his breath. “She can’t run from me forever. I know where she lives.”","Uncle Wang said, “Are you going to wait outside her door or barge into her room at night?”","Funo’s eyes were cold. “That’s none of your business.”","A warning look appeared on the shop owner’s face. “You can sleep with her, but don’t kill her. You know Mr. Sakiya is in town now. If the young lady complains to Mr. Sakiya, you will be finished. Understand?”","Funo sneered, his lowered eyes flashing ruthlessly.","No girl in this world had ever dared refuse him.","After leaving the armory, Feng Wu went into a restaurant.","This restaurant was called “Till You Drop.”","It meant “drink till you drop.”","To stay out of Funo’s sight, Feng Wu found a quiet table and was going to think things through as she tried to figure out how to catch Bu Jingyu.","Feng Wu ordered quite a few dishes and sat there alone, listening carefully to her surroundings.","There were two middle-aged men near her. They looked like they were about to retire from the army.","Indeed, the two of them were talking about this topic.","“Chow, I would never have expected this. Only a few of us survived.”","Chow raised his glass and toasted the person opposite him. “Lou, we joined the army in the same year. In the blink of an eye, we’re about to retire.”","Lou said, “That’s right. Have you thought about what you’ll do after you retire from the army?”","They both fell silent.","The Dongsang Kingdom had a blood tax system. They were all selected children who had been raised by the system. They were taught to read and practice martial arts. When they entered the army, they weren’t allowed to marry or contact their families.","Feng Wu remembered they weren’t allowed to leave the army until they were 40 years old. After that, they could get married and stay in contact with their families. However, they weren’t allowed to have anything to do with the army, and their sons weren’t allowed to join the army, either."]},{"number":3275,"title":"Chapter 3275 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt","paragraphs":["3275 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt","These two men were victims of the blood tax system.","Feng Wu was curious. What did the exploited people of the Dongsang Kingdom think of the blood tax system?","In order to truly become a citizen of Dongsang, Feng Wu had to integrate with them and understand their thoughts and opinions. Therefore, she would try to learn more about them whenever she had the chance.","Feng Wu listened attentively to their conversation.","Lou asked Chow, “Have you thought about what you’ll do after you leave the army?”","Chow was silent for a while and smiled bitterly. “Who knows? Anyway, we’ve saved up some money over the years. We can always buy a few acres of fertile land and live comfortably.”","Lou said, “It’s a pity that we’re only 40 years old. There’s still so much time after we retire. The money we’ve saved up is still not enough.”","Chow smiled. “There will be enough if we don’t spend too much.”","Lou shook his head. “I really hope there’s a windfall, and I can save enough money for the rest of my life.”","Chow said, “Lou, you’re too greedy. This won’t do. You’ve always been like this...”","Chow wanted to go on, but Lou impatiently waved his hand. “Alright, alright. I know that. I’m only alive now because I can restrain myself. Otherwise, how can I work as Mr. Sakiya’s doorman?”","Chow nodded.","Mr. Sakiya?","The doorman?","Feng Wu, keep a mental note of Lou’s face.","“I heard Prime Minister Chu is coming here,” said Lou.","As far as Feng Wu could remember, the Dongsang Kingdom only had a chancellor. Where did this Prime Minister Chu come from?","Who was he?","Feng Wu knew the chancellor and the prime minister could exist at the same time. They had different job descriptions.","The prime minister had a higher status than the chancellor. Moreover, there was only one prime minister of a country, but it could have two chancellors.","Chow said, “That’s right. I heard Prime Minister Chu is coming, but I don’t know when he’ll arrive. We have to be careful so that he won’t notice us. Otherwise, we might get killed if we make any mistakes.”","Back then, one of the doormen had said something to Prime Minister Chu, and got his throat cut for it.","“Prime Minister Chu is Mr. Sakiya’s teacher, and Mr. Sakiya respects him like a god. How can we offend him? Do you think anyone dares to call Prime Minister Chu by his full name, Chu Tianxiao?”","“Shut up!” Chow glared at Lou. “Do you want to die? How dare you call him by his name?!”","Lou was also frightened. He subconsciously looked around. Seeing that no one noticed this, he wiped the cold sweat off his forehead.","Chow glared at him. “Have you forgotten how terrifying Prime Minister Chu is? If you don’t want to live, don’t drag me down with you!”","As he spoke, Chow picked up his hat, turned around, and left the restaurant in a hurry.","Feng Wu was a little surprised.","What did she just hear?","Prime Minister Chu was Chu Tianxiao, her third senior brother?","And her third senior brother was Mr. Sakiya’s teacher?","Feng Wu was speechless.","Then what should Mr. Sakiya call her? Little Martial Aunt?","She imagined how Mr. Sakiya, the scholarly man with a calm temperament, would bow to her as a junior and respectfully address her as Martial Aunt...","Cough —","Feng Wu almost choked on her own saliva.","Lou was as startled as a bird right now. He threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and turned to leave.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was already sitting on the bench next to him.","“You —”"]},{"number":3276,"title":"Chapter 3276 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt (2)","paragraphs":["3276 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt (2)","Before Lou could say anything, Feng Wu threw a small bag into his arms.","She might not have many other things, but she did have a lot of essence crystals.","Lou immediately felt the strong and pure spiritual essence, and he frowned at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Why don’t you open it?”","Lou did.","After opening it, his eyes were almost blinded by the light of the crystals!","There were at least hundreds of essence crystals in that bag!","Oh god!","Lou wasn’t a powerful cultivator. He was just a doorman living on his monthly allowance. Occasionally, he could get some tips, but they weren’t much.","Most of the tips were in Dongsang coins, and essence crystals were extremely rare.","But now, there was an entire bag of essence crystals.","“What do you want? You can’t buy me over!” Lou stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t have time to waste on him.","She only had less than two days before the fruit ripened.","However, she hadn’t even familiarized herself with the most basic information about the great general’s residence, to say nothing of sneaking in and doing her job.","Feng Wu smiled at Lou. “What’s going on with Prime Minister Chu?”","Lou wanted to run.","However, Feng Wu was much stronger than him, and she dragged him back into his seat.","Feng Wu said, “It’s quiet here on the second floor, and we’re in a corner. There’s no one else here. You can run, but those things have to stay.”","Lou looked at the essence crystals in his arms and hugged it tightly!","Just a moment ago, he and Chow had wanted to do something big so that they would have a good life after retirement, but now, there were so many essence crystals in his hands...","Lou stared at Feng Wu with hesitation.","Feng Wu grabbed the bag from him.","“Hey! What are you doing?!” Lou stared at the bag with bloodshot eyes.","He wouldn’t have felt this way if he hadn’t opened the bag or held those essence crystals.","However, once he felt those crystals, he couldn’t bear to part with them.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I’m only curious and want to ask you a question. If you answer me, you can have the crystals.”","Lou asked eagerly, “What do you want to ask?”","Feng Wu asked, “Who’s Prime Minister Chu?”","Lou was surprised by how simple the question was.","He immediately said, “He’s Chu Tianxiao, the master teacher of the Dongsang Kingdom. I’m not surprised you don’t know who he is. He retired a long time ago, and very few people of the younger generation have heard his name. The people of my generation are all familiar with his reputation.”","Feng Wu took out an essence crystal and put it on the table.","One?","However, Lou was happy with having one crystal for answering such an easy question.","However, Feng Wu smiled at Lou when he tried to take it. “One moment. I’m not done yet.”","Lou said, “Ask me, then!”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s Prime Minister Chu’s cultivation level? What’s his status here? Is he nice? Does he have a family?”","Lou frowned. “Prime Minister Chu is more powerful than you can imagine. He’s probably the most capable cultivator in the kingdom. He almost singlehandedly put our current king on the throne.”","Feng Wu frowned a little. She didn’t know Chu Tianxiao had such a long history with the Dongsang Kingdom."]},{"number":3277,"title":"Chapter 3277 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt (3)","paragraphs":["3277 Prime Minister Chu and Martial Aunt (3)","Feng Wu put another essence crystal in the middle of the table. “Go on.”","“Have you heard of the story of ‘you draw your sword first’?” Lou asked casually.","Feng Wu neither confirmed nor denied it. She only looked at him indifferently.","Lou didn’t care whether Feng Wu had heard of it or not. He went on, “Actually, Prime Minister Chu isn’t from Dongsang. After he came here from the south, he started his journey of ‘you draw your sword first’!”","Lou’s eyes lit up when he said this. “When Prime Minister Chu came here, he challenged the top ten experts of the Dongsang Kingdom with a sword! I don’t know what level those ten experts were, but they were the ten most powerful people in our kingdom.","“He always lets his opponent strike first, and he’s never the first to draw his sword. That’s how confident he is!","“Prime Minister Chu won all ten battles and became the strongest person in the Dongsang Kingdom! From then on, he stayed here and helped our king fight his way to the throne. He then became Prime Minister Chu for our king.”","Feng Wu said, “If he won all ten battles, and no one in the Dongsang Kingdom could beat him, why did he stay here?”","Lou scratched his head. How would he know?","However, when he saw the essence crystal in front of him, he tried his best to recall it.","Suddenly, he smacked his forehead. “I remember now. I heard someone mention that Prime Minister Chu is looking for someone.”","Feng Wu was curious. “Who’s that?”","Lou said, “I don’t know. Some people say that he’s looking for a colorful bird, and some say he’s looking for a teenage girl. Some even say he’s looking for an immortal. Anyway, it’s just a rumor. It’s not important.”","Tilting her head, Feng Wu thought for a moment. A colorful bird? Could it be “Master Phoenix”?","She asked, “What about his family?”","“He definitely doesn’t have any!” Lou said with certainty.","Feng Wu gave him a strange look. “Why are you so sure?”","Lou said, “It’s said Prime Minister Chu hates women! If a woman touches him, he’ll cut her in half! So, how can he get married? How can he have a family? Don’t even think about it.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Lou continued. “So many girls have fallen in love with him, but Prime Minister Chu won’t even look at them. By the way, do you have anything else to ask?”","Feng Wu asked, “What else can you tell me about Prime Minister Chu?”","Lou eagerly looked at the essence crystal in Feng Wu’s hands. He tried to recall but couldn’t remember anything else about Prime Minister Chu. In the end, he said helplessly, “Prime Minister Chu is too powerful. Very few people know about him. I can’t remember anything else.”","Suddenly, Lou’s eyes lit up. “I heard that he has a senior brother!”","Feng Wu asked, “Who’s that?”","Lou said, “I don’t know, but there has been a rumor that he has a second senior brother.”","A second senior brother?","Feng Wu remembered her eldest senior brother was the first schoolmaster of Imperial College, and her third senior brother was Chu Tianxiao. Then, who was this second senior brother? Was he also very powerful?","However, Lou’s level was too low, so the information he could obtain was very limited.","Feng Wu asked, “When will Prime Minister Chu come to Sun Castle?”","Lou said, “That’s hard to say. Some say he’ll be here tomorrow, and some say he won’t come. He’s the top expert in the Dongsang Kingdom. How can we know his whereabouts? Right?”","That made sense.","Feng Wu finally asked Lou what she wanted to ask the most. “Have you seen Bu Jingyu?”"]},{"number":3278,"title":"Chapter 3278 Entering the Great General’s Mansion","paragraphs":["3278 Entering the Great General’s Mansion","Lou said, “Mr. Sakiya’s disciple? Yes, I have. He’s a very nice person. When he meets doormen like us, he’ll tip us from time to time. We have a very good impression of him.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Ask him to come here.”","Lou looked at Feng Wu in surprise. “That won’t do.”","Lou wasn’t stupid. This girl was asking all sorts of questions. She must be after something. If he tricked Bu Jingyu to come here, and Bu Jingyu walked into a trap... He would be held accountable.","!!","Feng Wu didn’t say anything else. She just smiled at Lou and put all the essence crystals into her bag.","“Hey, hey, what are you doing? What are you...” Lou was anxious. “I’ve answered many questions already!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “You didn’t answer the last few questions well. I’m sorry, but I’ll take all the essence crystals back.”","Lou felt as if a knife was twisting in his heart!","“Hey, wait! Wait! Let me think about it. Maybe there’s a way.”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “If you ask Bu Jingyu to come here, the entire bag of essence crystals will be yours.”","Lou’s eyes lit up!","“You mean it?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Lou decided to give it his all.","If he succeeded, he would be able to live a better life than the others after retirement.","It was now or never!","“Wait here!”","Lou hurried inside.","He was the doorman. Usually, when visitors came to the residence to see someone, the doorman would go inside to report it. Therefore, it wasn’t difficult to get Bu Jingyu out. The difficult thing was to live with the consequences.","But Lou couldn’t resist the temptation of so many essence crystals.","He returned before long and looked at Feng Wu anxiously. “I heard Bu Jingyu is locked up in his room, memorizing books. Mr. Sakiya won’t let him out.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","What kind of book could Bu Jingyu memorize? He was so dumb. Feng Wu smacked her forehead.","“He should be out soon. I think...” Lou looked greedily at the bag of essence crystals in Feng Wu’s hand.","Feng Wu was speechless.","It would be really difficult for Bu Jingyu to come out on his own, so...","She had to go inside.","“You know the map of the great general’s residence, right?” Feng Wu stared at Lou.","With the temptation of the essence crystals, Lou had no choice but to give Feng Wu the map.","The goods were delivered, and the account was settled.","Feng Wu wasn’t worried Lou would report it to the higher-ups.","In fact, unless the doorman had gone mad, he would never do that.","He was about to retire. Making meritorious contributions was the last thing on his mind. He only wanted to earn more money and retire to live a good life.","However, Feng Wu still warned him, “If you tell anyone about this, even if I die, the second prince won’t let you go!”","Lou was shocked!","The girl worked for the second prince! No wonder she was so rich.","Lou immediately nodded. “I won’t. I won’t...”","Suddenly, Lou felt dizzy. He immediately fell on the table and lost consciousness.","As for Feng Wu...","She took off Lou’s outer clothes and quickly disguised herself as him. She then walked toward the great general’s residence.","It was right ahead.","The residence occupied an extremely large area, at least a hundred acres.","The street in front of it was wide enough for eight carts to travel side by side.","The vermilion doors were at least six meters tall.","There were bronze rings on the door, and two huge ferocious-looking stone lions with wide eyes stood by the entrance.","Two doormen were on duty.","Guards holding spears were lined up on both sides of the gate. They looked majestic and awe-inspiring."]},{"number":3279,"title":"Chapter 3279 Hi, We Meet Again","paragraphs":["3279 Hi, We Meet Again","Feng Wu glanced around and saw someone she saw earlier. It was Chow.","Anyone else would definitely be afraid now.","But Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone.","She didn’t even bat an eye.","Feng Wu walked in without hesitation.","“Lou, what took you so long?” Chow greeted Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked like she was in pain and waved at Chow. “I have to go to the toilet!”","“Gosh! Go ahead! I’ll talk to you later.” Seeing how anxious Feng Wu was, Chow didn’t dare ask any more questions. He let Feng Wu in right away.","The two rows of guards looked straight ahead; the real gatekeeper was Chow.","After Feng Wu snuck in, she dared to wander around because Lou was a doorman.","If anyone asked, she would tell them someone outside wanted to see the master, and she was only on her way to make the report.","She wouldn’t tell them which master she was going to see, and no one would ask.","Feng Wu soon arrived at Bu Jingyu’s yard.","Bu Jingyu lived a good life here. Because he was with his master, he had his own courtyard in the residence. However, the courtyard was right next to Mr. Sakiya’s, so Feng Wu had to be very careful.","The main door of the courtyard was tightly locked.","Feng Wu was about to climb over the wall.","However, Mr. Sakiya used formations and inscriptions to control Bu Jingyu.","He actually set up a formation here just to prevent Bu Jingyu from sneaking out.","Feng Wu shook her head.","The formation could trap Bu Jingyu, but not Feng Wu.","In a remote corner, Feng Wu made a small hole in the formation. She patched it up after crawling in.","No one saw her do that.","The entire courtyard was locked by the formation, so there was no need to close the doors of the courtyard.","Feng Wu could hear the sound of someone reading.","It was Bu Jingyu’s voice.","Feng Wu walked from the courtyard to the main room and took a closer look. Indeed, Bu Jingyu was sitting in the room, memorizing his book.","This time, he wasn’t memorizing an ancient sutra but an inscription book.","He was at Level 5.","Feng Wu sighed. The boy wasn’t a fast learner.","She quietly walked into the room.","Bu Jingyu didn’t hear anything. He sat on the wooden stool, swaying his head back and forth while trying to memorize the text.","Feng Wu poked him in the back.","Bu Jingyu frowned, thinking that it was a fly. He simply ignored the sensation and kept reciting with a bitter expression.","Feng Wu poked him again.","Bu Jingyu lost his patience and turned around angrily!","As he turned around, he shouted, “You annoying fly! Don’t you know that I...”","Then, Bu Jingyu saw a middle-aged man!","He looked as if he had seen a ghost and was astonished.","“How did you get in here?!” Bu Jingyu jumped to his feet, grabbed a sword from the wall, and pointed it at Feng Wu. “Hey, aren’t you the doorman?!”","When Bu Jingyu wasn’t confined to the room by his master, he liked to go out, so he was still a little familiar with the doorman.","Crossing her arms, Feng Wu smiled at Bu Jingyu without saying anything.","The teenager felt his blood run cold under Feng Wu’s gaze.","Those eyes were too sharp and domineering!","They shouldn’t belong to a doorman!","“Who are you?” Bu Jingyu suddenly had a bad feeling. His heart shook!","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Take a guess.”"]},{"number":3280,"title":"Chapter 3280 How Can She Be So Calm?","paragraphs":["3280 How Can She Be So Calm?","This time, she didn’t imitate Lou’s voice.","Hence, Bu Jingyu immediately recognized her voice.","He trembled because of that.","“You...” Bu Jingyu’s voice shook. “You are Feng, Feng...”","Feng Wu wiped the disguise off her face.","A beautiful face appeared in front of Bu Jingyu, shattering all his fantasies.","It really was her.","“Hey, it’s been a while.” Feng Wu stuffed Lou’s robe into her storage space. Who knew if she would ever need it again?","Bu Jingyu stared at Feng Wu in shock. “You came in just like that?! Do you know where we are?!”","Feng Wu said innocently, “It’s not the first time.”","Bu Jingyu didn’t know what to say.","What could he say?","Apart from expressing his astonishment, what else could he say?","Bu Jingyu paced around the room with his hands behind his back. As he walked, he turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you afraid my master will find out?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Did your master notice last time?”","Bu Jingyu almost choked to death.","He couldn’t understand it. His master was so smart. How did he get fooled by this cunning girl last time?","Bu Jingyu ran up to Feng Wu. “Aren’t you afraid I’ll tell on you?!”","Feng Wu casually picked up a peach and nibbled on it. She then crossed her legs and said casually, “Go ahead.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Aren’t you afraid?”","Feng Wu grinned at him. “Believe it or not, when two Bu Jingyus appear in front of your master, I’ll have a way to make him think you’re the imposter, and then...”","Feng Wu made a gesture of cutting off Bu Jingyu’s head.","Bu Jingyu cried out in frustration.","It wasn’t that he didn’t believe it.","It was because he believed every word!","She was even smarter and more cunning than his master. By Jingyu realized his master might actually fall for her tricks and kill him.","At that thought, Bu Jingyu felt a chill run down his spine, and he twitched as he stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Why are you fidgeting? I’m not going to tell on you to your master with an anonymous letter.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Anonymous letter? Turn me in? What can you turn me in for?! I always abide by the law and never do anything against my conscience!”","Feng Wu grinned at him. “How about betraying your country and stealing the Immortal Spiritual Fruit for the Junwu Empire?”","Pffft!","Bu Jingyu almost spat out a mouthful of blood!","“Are you trying to frame me?!” Bu Jingyu gritted his teeth and glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded earnestly. “If you tell your master.”","Bu Jingyu took a deep breath. He wasn’t angry. Even his master couldn’t see through her tricks. It was normal that he would lose the argument.","However, Bu Jingyu suddenly realized something. “So, you really stole the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit?!”","Feng Wu said, “What do you mean ‘I stole it’? Bu Jingyu was the one who stole the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit. Have you forgotten?”","Bu Jingyu was shocked.","He was so angry.","He didn’t want to talk!","While Bu Jingyu was fuming, Feng Wu was sitting on a recliner, casually eating some fruit.","The fruits of the Dongsang Kingdom were tender, juicy and extremely delicious.","Bu Jingyu looked up at the sky.","He had never seen a spy like her before, sneaking into the kingdom like this. How could she be so calm and composed?! How could she...","However, he was the one who was anxious!","Bu Jingyu took a deep breath and suppressed his anger. He stomped over to Feng Wu and stared down at her. “What are you doing here?!”"]},{"number":3281,"title":"Chapter 3281 Please Help Me","paragraphs":["3281 Please Help Me","What did she want?","Taking out a handkerchief, Feng Wu slowly wiped each of her fingers clean and grinned at Bu Jingyu. “What do you think I’m trying to do?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I don’t know!”","Feng Wu smiled. “That’s why it’s better you don’t know.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Why?”","Feng Wu said, “Wouldn’t it be even more awkward if you did? You’ll have to cooperate with me when you find out.”","Bu Jingyu thought about it and agreed.","If he knew what she wanted and still helped her, he would really be betraying his master and the Dongsang Kingdom!","“Alright! I won’t ask, but... you have to promise not to harm the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Feng Wu looked at Bu Jingyu as if he was a retard.","If she took advantage of him, it would harm the interests of the Dongsang Kingdom. If she didn’t want to take advantage of him, why did she come to Sun Castle?","Bu Jingyu also realized he had asked an extremely stupid question. He scratched his head and rephrased, “What I mean is you can’t harm me. I still have to live in the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll do my best.”","In her plan, Bu Jingyu wouldn’t be exposed, but not everything was within her control. Who knew what would happen?","Bu Jingyu said, “If you expose me, I will definitely expose you too!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Sure.”","Why did she agree so easily? Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in confusion. He couldn’t help but wonder if she was up to no good.","“When are you leaving?” Bu Jingyu asked.","Feng Wu said, “I’ll leave as soon as I finish the mission.”","Bu Jingyu wanted to ask her what her mission was, but then he realized that if he found out, he might... So, he glared at Feng Wu and grabbed a book. “You should leave now!”","After that, Bu Jingyu went back to memorizing his text.","Feng Wu smiled. This kid was quite adorable.","While Bu Jingyu worked on the text, Feng Wu paced around the room with her hands behind her back.","First of all, she had to familiarize herself with Bu Jingyu’s room. She had to know the decor in the room, his clothes, accessories, and so on.","While Feng Wu was picking out Bu Jingyu’s clothes, she heard footsteps outside.","Bu Jingyu’s recital suddenly stopped!","He rushed in and pointed at Feng Wu. “Did you recite On Moral for my master last time?”","Feng Wu said, “I did.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “You even recited Level 4 inscriptions for him, didn’t you?”","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu said, “I think your master has even told you to recite the Level 5 ones.”","Bu Jingyu was anxious. “Do you know the texts?”","Feng Wu looked at him as if he were a retard. “What level do you think I am at? How do you think I got through your master’s formation?”","Bu Jingyu realized she had a point.","“Even my eldest senior brother wouldn’t be able to get in if he didn’t know the method!” Bu Jingyu said with certainty.","Bu Jingyu’s eldest senior brother was Zhu Yi, right? Feng Wu remembered him.","“In other words, you can recite Level 5 inscriptions, right?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s a piece of cake.”","“Do it for me!” Bu Jingyu said. “Master is going to test me, but I haven’t memorized them yet. I don’t know what’s going on, but I keep forgetting what I’ve memorized. Anyway, I can’t do it no matter what!”","Feng Wu feigned hesitation. “Well... but...”","Bu Jingyu said, “I’m begging you! You can come and go as you please while staying here. I won’t interfere with you. If necessary, I’ll even help you! As long as you recite the text for me! Is that alright? Xiao Wu, please help me!”"]},{"number":3282,"title":"Chapter 3282 Who’s That?","paragraphs":["3282 Who’s That?","Feng Wu was speechless.","Bu Jingyu would go that far to avoid memorizing texts?","Bu Jingyu said, “Hurry up! Change your clothes! My eldest senior brother will be here soon. He must be here to check on my schoolwork on behalf of my master!”","Feng Wu asked, “How did you know it’s your senior brother?”","Bu Jingyu said, “He comes every ten hours to check on me. I’ll be trapped in this room forever if I can’t memorize everything. I’m suffocating!”","Bu Jingyu pushed Feng Wu to the cabinet. “These are all my clothes. Get changed!”","As Bu Jingyu spoke, he opened the cabinet.","Feng Wu asked, “Why are there ten sets of clothes in the same color and style?”","Bu Jingyu said, “Master says this way, my state of mind won’t change because of the style of my clothes. Master also has ten sets of the same clothes like this.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Bu Jingyu waited anxiously outside.","By then, Feng Wu had finally changed into his clothes. She walked out, and Bu Jingyu had mixed feelings when he saw her.","She looked almost identical to him!","Unless it was himself, no one else would be able to tell the difference...","Just then, the sound of footsteps approached.","Bu Jingyu told Feng Wu everything that had happened recently, then darted into the bedroom.","Feng Wu saw that Bu Jingyu didn’t hide under his blanket.","He slipped under the bed with a swish.","Feng Wu was speechless.","The door opened before Feng Wu could close the bedroom door.","Zhu Yi, the eldest senior brother, was here.","He resembled Mr. Sakiya the most, be it in his attire, speech, or actions. He strictly followed Mr. Sakiya’s standards.","Still, while they seemed alike, that was at a superficial level.","Feng Wu could feel Zhu Yi’s vigorous energy the moment he walked in.","He was a Spiritual Overlord.","However, Feng Wu wasn’t sure what level he was at.","“Jingyu,” Zhu Yi stood at the door and said calmly, “have you memorized it?”","Bu Jingyu, who was under the bed in the inner room, shook with fear.","Although he knew Feng Wu looked exactly like him, she still wasn’t him. His senior brother and master were both extremely wise and intelligent people. Would they find out? Bu Jingyu was so nervous!","Feng Wu looked at Zhu Yi and said obediently, “Senior Brother, I... know a little.”","“What do you mean by a little?” Zhu Yi frowned.","Feng Wu said, “Maybe... I need a little more time...”","Zhu Yi rubbed his temples.","A little more time? It must be a lot more than that!","Zhu Yi looked at Feng Wu, looking disappointed. “Master is going to test you. Come with me.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Zhu Yi looked at Feng Wu and frowned. “Don’t forget where you came from. How can you be so lazy? Someone will be disappointed.”","Someone? Who? Feng Wu wasn’t sure. Bu Jingyu hadn’t told her that.","Zhu Yi continued. “Back then, he was the one who handed you to Master and asked Master to train you. If you’re still so useless, when that person comes back and sees you like this, Master will be punished! Understand?!”","Feng Wu was curious, but she didn’t dare ask.","Who... was that person?","Why didn’t Bu Jingyu tell her the important information? Feng Wu wanted to punch him.","Zhu Yi said as he walked with Feng Wu, “That person will be here soon. Work hard and don’t disappoint him. Got it?”","Feng Wu said timidly, “...Yes.”"]},{"number":3283,"title":"Chapter 3283 Meeting the Crown Prince Again","paragraphs":["3283 Meeting the Crown Prince Again","Zhu Yi seemed strict, but he was a chatterbox along the way. He kept telling his junior brother to work hard.","Feng Wu nodded eagerly.","However, Zhu Yi didn’t seem convinced at all.","He looked at his junior brother with disappointment and resignation.","Feng Wu thought Zhu Yi would take her to Mr. Sakiya’s yard.","According to Bu Jingyu, Mr. Sakiya’s courtyard wasn’t far from Bu Jingyu’s. They were only hundreds of meters apart.","But now —","They had already walked past several lakes, pavilions, and long corridors... It had been over thirty minutes.","Where were they going?","Feng Wu recalled the map Lou had drawn for her.","They were going to the main courtyard.","As expected!","Soon, she saw the plaque of the main courtyard ahead of them.","The path leading to the main courtyard was hundreds of meters long. It was wide enough for eight carts to travel side-by-side and was paved with green jade stone slabs. The ground was smooth and orderly, giving off an indescribable noble aura.","“Master is taking care of the crown prince,” Zhu Yi lowered his voice and told his junior brother. “Master hasn’t recovered yet, and the crown prince’s injuries have been unstable. Master is very busy and doesn’t have the energy to focus on you. Don’t cause more trouble for Master again. Alright?”","Feng Wu nodded obediently. “Yes.”","Zhu Yi frowned. He could tell from his junior brother’s tone that the latter wasn’t serious.","He tried to warn ‘Bu Jingyu,’ “Just because you were sent by our Martial Grandfather doesn’t mean you can be so arrogant! With that connection, you should work harder!”","Martial Grandfather?","Wait...","Feng Wu did some calculations in her head.","Mr. Sakiya’s Master was Chu Tianxiao.","That meant Zhu Yi and Bu Jingyu’s Martial Grandfather was her third senior brother!","Feng Wu said, “I know that.”","Feng Wu’s voice was as soft as a mosquito’s, and Zhu Yi felt sorry for his junior brother. He said, “If you really can’t memorize it, just cry out Martial Grandfather’s name when Master is about to hit you. Understand?”","Feng Wu asked, “Will Martial Grandfather be there?”","Zhu Yi looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Of course he won’t show up, but Master respects him the most. If you cry out Martial Grandfather’s name, Master won’t beat you to death. You know you made a bet with Master: If you can’t memorize the text, you’ll chop off a finger!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","How did Bu Jingyu dare to make such a bet? That was so bold of him.","Feng Wu said, “Thank you, Senior Brother.”","Zhu Yi let out a long sigh. “Master has yet to recover from his injuries, and His Royal Highness is still injured. The second prince is getting restless... If Martial Grandfather shows up now, all the problems will be easily solved.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She had seen her third senior brother before!","She remembered his appearance, his clothes, and his sword...","If she pretended to be her third senior brother and tricked Mr. Sakiya, would she have a better chance of getting the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","Feng Wu decided to plan it out!","“Jingyu? What are you thinking about?” Zhu Yi asked Feng Wu with a frown.","Feng Wu said, “Huh? I... I’m trying to remember the inscriptions.”","Zhu Yi nodded in satisfaction. This child finally knew fear.","By then, the two of them had already entered the main courtyard.","The main courtyard consisted of quadrangle dwellings.","After entering the main entrance, there was a house facing the opposite direction. Beyond that was the patio.","Stepping through the door, Feng Wu saw rows of mahogany chairs, which gave her a sense of formality.","Zhu Yi didn’t stay in the reception area. Instead, he led Feng Wu into the inner room."]},{"number":3284,"title":"Chapter 3284 Jun Linyuan Has Powerful Aid","paragraphs":["3284 Jun Linyuan Has Powerful Aid","Feng Wu saw several people in the room, and she knew most of them.","The one lying on the bed was the crown prince, Night Owl.","There were two people sitting in front of his bed. One was Mr. Sakiya, and the other was someone Feng Wu had never seen before.","This person looked to be about 30 years old. She had fair skin and looked quite charming.","Mu Yan stood behind her respectfully, not daring to make any reckless move.","“Mo Lan, how’s His Royal Highness?” Mr. Sakiya asked the beautiful woman with a pale face.","Mo Lan? Feng Wu thought of something.","Mo Lan was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner of the Dongsang Kingdom and Mu Yan’s master.","Wasn’t she supposed to be in the capital of the Dongsang Kingdom?","Feng Wu didn’t expect Mr. Sakiya to invite this Semi-Divine medicine refiner over.","She wanted to see how good Mo Lan’s medical skills were.","Mo Lan’s expression was cold. She glanced at Mu Yan and instructed her to take care of the crown prince.","Mu Yan immediately said yes.","Mo Lan pushed Mr. Sakiya’s wheelchair out.","Seeing how close they were, Feng Wu was curious. What was the relationship between Mo Lan and Mr. Sakiya?","At that moment, Mr. Sakiya spotted Bu Jingyu, his young disciple.","He glared at the latter.","Feng Wu was baffled by his stare. She hadn’t done anything wrong.","Seeing ‘Bu Jingyu,’ Mo Lan nodded at Feng Wu gently and said with a smile, “JIngyu, you can’t memorize the text again? Zhu Yi, you have to teach him well. Don’t lecture him all the time.”","Zhu Yi nodded.","Feng Wu could tell Mo Lan held a high position in the Dongsang Kingdom. She was almost on par with Mr. Sakiya.","As Mo Lan pushed Mr. Sakiya into the main hall, she said softly, “You have to be more careful with your injuries. Otherwise, there will be repercussions and endless trouble in the future.”","Mr. Sakiya said, “I’m fine.”","Mo Lan chided him. “Who’s the Semi-Divine medicine refiner? You or me? If I say you’re not fine, then you’re not fine!”","Mr. Sakiya smiled bitterly. “Yes, of course.”","Mo Lan sighed. “Actually, the Immortal Spiritual Fruit...”","Before she could finish her sentence, Mr. Sakiya interrupted her sternly. “The Immortal Spiritual Fruit belongs to His Royal Highness. No one can steal it. Even if I were to die from my injuries, I wouldn’t touch it. Mo Lan, do you understand?!”","Mo Lan frowned, not looking too happy.","Mr. Sakiya softened his tone. “His Royal Highness is the Dongsang Kingdom’s only hope! The second prince won’t do it.”","Mo Lan said, “His Majesty is still in his prime. There are still many years left. He might still...”","Mr. Sakiya shook his head. “Do you think geniuses grow in batches in this world? After Jun Linyuan appeared in the south, Night Owl appeared in our kingdom. Heaven has already taken pity on us. He’s the only one.”","Mo Lan let out a long sigh. “But he’s seriously injured. Jun Linyuan has already hurt you so badly. Our crown prince...”","Their crown prince was still lying in bed, his fate unknown. This showed the difference between the two crown princes.","Mr. Sakiya said, “Jun Linyuan has someone powerful with him.”","Mo Lan asked, “Night Owl has you, doesn’t he?”","After that, Mo Lan knew she had said the wrong thing.","Their opponent had snatched the Immortal Spiritual Fruit from Mr. Sakiya, and until now, they still hadn’t found out how their opponent had stolen it. However, Jun Linyuan had already used the fruit and recovered.","Indeed, Mo Lan noticed that Mr. Sakiya’s expression had turned extremely ugly."]},{"number":3285,"title":"Chapter 3285 Reciting Is Easy","paragraphs":["3285 Reciting Is Easy","So what if Mr. Sakiya was angry?","Jun Linyuan was such an outstanding man; Sakiya’s displeasure wouldn’t make him any less outstanding.","Mr. Sakiya waved his hand. “Let’s not talk about that.”","Mo Lan tactfully stopped provoking Mr. Sakiya.","!!","“How is the crown prince’s condition?” Mr. Sakiya asked.","Mo Lan said, “He has stabilized, but he has to take the medicinal liquid refined from the Immortal Spiritual Fruit in two days. Otherwise, there will be an aftereffect.”","Mr. Sakiya asked, “What kind of aftereffect?”","Mo Lan said, “Well...”","Mr. Sakiya said, “Tell me.”","Mo Lan whispered in Mr. Sakiya’s ear.","Even someone as composed as Mr. Sakiya turned pale. He couldn’t help but raise his voice. “Where did you say he was injured?!”","Mo Lan shrugged. “You heard me. Why did he have to blow other people up? Jun Linyuan is alive and kicking enough to even hurt you. Our crown prince’s life is in danger. He might even become impotent.”","Fortunately, she was Mo Lan, a Semi-Divine medicine refiner of Dongsang. That was why she could speak without any scruples. She could even speak openly about the crown prince’s erectile dysfunction.","Mr. Sakiya’s expression remained unchanged as he waved his hand at Mo Lan. “Let’s not talk about that.”","Mo Lan found it funny. “There are so many things we can’t talk about. Sakiya, do you have so little confidence in the crown prince now?”","Mr. Sakiya glared at her. Why did she have to bring it up?","Mo Lan immediately waved her hand. “Alright. I won’t talk about this anymore.”","After that, Mo Lan looked at Feng Wu. “Little Jingyu, what are you doing here?”","Mo Lan tended to address Bu Jingyu in that way.","This wasn’t the first time Feng Wu had played Bu Jingyu, so she knew how he would react normally.","She wanted to look up and smile at Mo Lan. But before she could do that, Mr. Sakiya shot her a sharp look.","“Level 5 inscriptions. Start reciting!”","The simple order had an indescribable authority in it.","Feng Wu mumbled to herself.","Mr. Sakiya stared at her with a dark expression. “What are you mumbling about?”","Feng Wu waved her hand. “It’s nothing...”","Zhu Yi looked at Feng Wu in admiration.","Muttering frustrated their master, and the youngest disciple would be scolded. Zhu Yi was amazed that his junior brother was bold enough to say that.","Mo Lan only felt the kid was extremely adorable. She wanted to pat his head.","As for reciting the text...","“Sakiya, don’t be so strict with him. You know little Jingyu isn’t very good at memorizing things. Using the same standards will put too much pressure on him.” Mo Lan tried to speak up for Bu Jingyu.","However, Mr. Sakiya sneered. “Master personally entrusted him to me, and he will be coming here soon. When he sees this kid, how disappointed do you think he will be?!”","Before Mo Lan could say anything, Mr. Sakiya glared at Feng Wu. “Start reciting!”","Feng Wu’s heart skipped a beat.","Was her third senior brother really coming?","Would he recognize her?","Would he help her?","Would he...","Feng Wu’s imagination was interrupted by Mr. Sakiya’s order.","So be it. Other than Bu Jingyu, who was afraid of memorizing texts?","Feng Wu paced around with her hands behind her back and began to recite.","She swayed her head back and forth, and her speech was clear. Although she was stuttering, she still recited all the theories of Level 5 inscriptions."]},{"number":3286,"title":"Chapter 3286 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (1)","paragraphs":["3286 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (1)","Zhu Yi and the others looked at ‘Bu Jingyu’ in a different way after ‘he’ recited everything.","He did it!","Although he stuttered, he still recited tens of thousands of words from beginning to end!","Zhu Yi, who had always prided himself on being calm, took a deep breath, but he couldn’t hide his excitement. “Master, Jingyu memorized everything correctly!”","How could Mr. Sakiya not know that?","However, he had a strange feeling.","He felt that his disciple was sometimes smart and sometimes stupid. His talent seemed extremely unstable.","Frowning, Mr. Sakiya asked Feng Wu a few questions about Level 5 inscriptions.","Of course, Feng Wu knew how to answer such basic questions. However, in order not to give herself away, Feng Wu stuttered again. She wasn’t completely right, but she wasn’t wrong either.","For a person who had only memorized the theories, she could get 80 out of 100 points.","Normally, Bu Jingyu could only get 50 points.","He had already surpassed himself.","Mr. Sakiya stared at Feng Wu with a frown, still wondering what was wrong with his disciple.","Mo Lan smiled. “Little Jingyu is so smart. He actually got all the answers right. Looks like he did a good job this time!”","Mo Lan said to Mr. Sakiya, “Can you hear yourself? Why are you so serious? You’re forcing the kid. He was so lively in the past, but now, he’s like a withered flower. He’s become so thin.”","Mr. Sakiya said, “Zhu Yi, teach him Level 5 inscriptions. After that, he’ll have Level 5 physical training.”","Zhu Yi quickly nodded.","Mr. Sakiya instructed again, “Prepare the golden leg bone. When the crown prince wakes up, we can use this opportunity to refine it.”","Wait a minute!","Feng Wu suddenly had an idea.","Golden leg bone?!","Was that what she thought it was?","“You may leave.” Mr. Sakiya’s face was a little pale as he gestured for them to leave.","Seeing Zhu Yi leave with Bu Jingyu, Mr. Sakiya rubbed his temples.","Mo Lan only smiled. “What are you doing?”","Mr. Sakiya said, “He’s actually very smart.”","Mo Lan looked at him in confusion.","Mr. Sakiya said, “He actually knows how to memorize texts. He has a good memory. Back in the peacock’s woods, he could memorize everything when I pressed. It’s the same this time.","“He’s just too lazy.” Mr. Sakiya sighed.","Poor Bu Jingyu. His master had labeled him as smart but lazy. He would have so much more schoolwork in the future.","The kid didn’t know that yet. Right now, he was hiding in the room, crossing his legs and eating fruits.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu’s eyes were sparkling.","Golden leg bone?","Feng Xun could use it!","Feng Wu decided to get it. She pretended to ask casually, “...Senior Brother Zhu, the golden leg bone...”","Zhu Yi glanced at her. “Didn’t you find the golden leg bone? Why? Are you reluctant to let the crown prince use it now?”","Feng Wu was surprised. She didn’t know Bu Jingyu had done that.","Feng Wu waved her hand. “Of course not. I didn’t mean that.”","Zhu Yi smiled bitterly. “I know you offered the golden leg to the crown prince to please our master. I have a piece of advice for you: If you find anything good in the future, see if you can use it first. Only give it away when you know you can’t use it. Do you understand?”"]},{"number":3287,"title":"Chapter 3287 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (2)","paragraphs":["3287 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (2)","Feng Wu said in a hurry, “Thank you, Senior Brother Zhu.”","She thought, “Zhu Yi is really nice to Bu Jingyu. He even dares to tell him such things.”","Zhu Yi nodded. “You have connections with Martial Grandfather. No matter what, Master won’t kick you out. However, you have to think about it carefully. If you continue to act so lazy, what will your future be like? Don’t forget who you are.”","Who was Bu Jingyu?","Zhu Yi said, “Although you’ve changed your identity, once this matter is investigated, people may find out. Master wants you to learn some skills as soon as possible and go to the country on the other side of the ocean.”","Feng Wu was so curious!","What was Bu Jingyu’s identity? Why did he have to escape to a country on the other side of the ocean?","However, she could only obediently lower her head and listen to the lecture without asking anything.","“Do you want to see the golden leg bone?” Zhu Yi glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu wanted to, but it was too obvious, so she waved her hand. “No, no. I don’t want to see it.”","Zhu Yi shook his head and said to Feng Wu, “Master asked me to teach you inscriptions, but you’re not the type that should be kept inside all the time. So, I’ll give you three days off. After that, we’ll start on the real course of Level 5 inscriptions. We’ll work on each inscription and learn them all in one go, okay?”","Three days off? That would be great!","After saying goodbye to Zhu Yi, Feng Wu went back to the yard. Bu Jingyu was sitting on a chair in the yard, dozing off while basking in the sun.","Feng Wu was speechless.","How careless!","Wasn’t he afraid someone would walk in and discover two Bu Jingyu here?","“Hey, wake up.”","Feng Wu poked Bu Jingyu.","Bu Jingyu jumped up from his chair and assumed a defensive posture. “Hey, who dares to touch me...”","However, before he could finish speaking, he saw Feng Wu and immediately cowered.","“You’re back!” Bu Jingyu stared at Feng Wu, and his eyes lit up. “Are you done? Did you memorize the Level 5 inscriptions in front of Master? Did you recite all tens of thousands of words?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Why would I be here if there was a problem?”","“Wow, you really did it? You’re a genius!” Bu Jingyu circled around Feng Wu and was so excited that he couldn’t stop mumbling. “How did I get to know such a powerful person like you? Can I call you Boss Xiao Wu from now on? You don’t have to do anything else. Just memorize books for me, okay?”","Feng Wu said, “It’ll be your own knowledge after you memorize it. I think you’d better learn something.”","Bu Jingyu shook her head.","Feng Wu said, “Why are you frowning? By the way, who are you? Why did Zhu Yi say you have to go to the other side of the ocean to survive?”","Bu Jingyu looked up and stared at Feng Wu. “How did you know that?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course, if you don’t tell me, I’ll ask someone else.”","“No, no. Stop asking around. I’ll tell you.” Bu Jingyu was afraid Feng Wu would ask around. If that happened, he would be dead.","Bu Jingyu lowered his voice and whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu said, “Gosh, I didn’t know you were a prince.”","Bu Jingyu stared at Feng Wu. “Shh! Don’t tell anyone!”","Feng Wu thought about the Dongsang system..."]},{"number":3288,"title":"Chapter 3288 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (3)","paragraphs":["3288 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (3)","Seeing how useless Bu Jingyu was, Feng Wu understood right away. “Are you worried Night Owl will take revenge on you guys when he takes the throne?”","Bu Jingyu said, “What do you mean by ‘worried’? That’s for sure, alright? It’s so difficult to be a prince in the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Feng Wu looked at Bu Jingyu sympathetically. “Is it true your king will kill all his brothers after he takes the throne?”","Bu Jingyu was in awe. “Yes!”","Feng Wu said, “How cruel.”","Bu Jingyu said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu asked, “So, you think you’re going to die.”","Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in shock. “Do you think I can beat the crown prince?”","Feng Wu said, “Well... One has to have dreams.”","Bu Jingyu shook her head. “That’s impossible. The crown prince stands above us like the sun. He’s the most talented prince in the Dongsang Kingdom. No prince can compete with him. None.”","Feng Wu hadn’t thought of that at first, but something suddenly occurred to her. “Isn’t the crown prince still unconscious?”","Bu Jingyu said, “If you feed him the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, the crown prince will wake up.”","Feng Wu said, “What if the Immortal Spiritual Fruit doesn’t get fed to him?”","“What?” Bu Jingyu was stumped. He had never thought of this before.","Bu Jingyu said, “But, but Master is here...”","Feng Wu smiled. “Your Master was there last time.”","And he had still been completely fooled.","Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in surprise, and his eyes lit up.","Who would want to die if they could live?!","However, Bu Jingyu smiled bitterly. “But even if you can really steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit and the crown prince doesn’t wake up, it won’t be my turn. There are more than 20 princes fighting for that position.”","Feng Wu said, “Your king is so active.”","Bu Jingyu smiled bitterly. “What’s the use of that if we can’t live long?”","Feng Wu said, “So, according to what you’re saying, aren’t the other 20 princes all working together to fight off Night Owl?”","Because according to the kingdom’s system, if Night Owl really took the throne, he would definitely kill all his brothers. Then, none of these 20-odd princes would be able to escape.","Bu Jingyu said, “I heard they were, but I didn’t participate.”","Feng Wu stared at him.","Bu Jingyu said, “When my mother gave birth to me, the crown prince was already outstanding. My mother knew it was impossible for me to win this position, so she swapped me out.","“I should have been the 18th prince.” Bu Jingyu smiled bitterly. “Only Grandmaster, Master, and Senior Brother Zhu know my identity. No one else knows.","“My father should know as well, but he pretends he doesn’t,” Bu Jingyu said. “That’s because Martial Grandfather was behind this, and Father is actually afraid of Martial Grandfather as well.”","Feng Wu said, “Then I’m curious. Why did your Martial Grandfather, aka Chu Tianxiao, help you?”","“I heard my mother did him a small favor.”","Feng Wu asked, “Your mother could do that?”","Bu Jingyu said, “My mother is a witch. She sacrificed her life and performed a divination for my Martial Grandfather.”","Feng Wu was curious. “What divination?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I think he’s looking for someone.”","Feng Wu asked, “Who?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I’m not sure. I only know he’s looking for someone.”"]},{"number":3289,"title":"Chapter 3289 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (4)","paragraphs":["3289 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (4)","“My mother’s divination contained a portrait. The maid who accompanied me at that time was a master at drawing. She drew the portrait. I’ve seen it before.”","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s the painting?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I remember I brought it with me. According to the maid, if my life really is in danger in the future, I can use it to ask for Martial Grandfather’s help. My brother, the crown prince, might actually spare my life.”","Feng Wu said, “Let me see the painting.”","!!","Bu Jingyu refused. “That won’t do. That’s...”","Feng Wu said, “Then you can memorize your own text tomorrow.”","She headed for the door.","Bu Jingyu immediately stopped her. “Hey, don’t do that! Why are you so grumpy? Why are you always angry? I’ll show you, alright?”","Bu Jingyu rolled his eyes at Feng Wu and nagged, “It’s just a painting. Look at how curious you are. You won’t be able to tell anything even if you look at it.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I haven’t seen anything in it after so many years. What can you possibly see?”","As Bu Jingyu spoke, he rummaged through the cabinets. Finally, he found a well-wrapped package in a drawer.","He opened the waterproof first layer, the fireproof second layer, then the third layer...","After opening all five layers, Feng Wu saw a scroll inside.","Bu Jingyu carefully unrolled the painting.","As he unrolled the painting, he said to Feng Wu, “I’m telling you, this is just a little girl’s painting. Besides, I don’t think there’s such a little girl in this world.”","When Bu Jingyu finished unrolling the scroll, Feng Wu was dumbfounded!","This painting...","The little girl in the painting...","She was only three or four years old. On her head were two small buns decorated with white beads.","She had fair skin and exquisite facial features. Her big eyes in particular were clear and innocent.","Her chubby little hands and cute little fairy dress were simply so soft and cute that they made one want to scream.","No matter whose family’s little girl it was, everyone would want such a daughter.","Why was Feng Wu dumbfounded?","Wasn’t the girl her?!","She had looked like this when she was three years old!","Not all little girls looked alike. It was really rare to see a good-looking little girl like her!","Look at the little white beads on the buns and the little red dress with the white fur on the edges. The beautiful lady had sewn those clothes herself! There was no other dress like it in the world!","Bu Jingyu was confused by Feng Wu’s dazed look. He waved his hand in front of Feng Wu’s face.","“Wake up! Wake up!”","Feng Wu finally snapped out of her daze and stared at Bu Jingyu.","Was her third senior brother looking for her?","Why was he looking for her?","Did he know of her existence?","Would he...","Feng Wu had so many questions in her head, and she wanted to find Chu Tianxiao right now. However, she still didn’t know where this Martial Grandfather was.","Bu Jingyu nudged Feng Wu. “Hey, Boss Feng Wu? Boss Feng Wu? Are you perplexed, too? I thought someone as good-looking as you wouldn’t be shocked by someone else’s looks.”","As Bu Jingyu spoke, he sighed. “I wonder what this little girl looks like now. She must be as beautiful as a god, right? When I grow up, I must marry her!”","“In your dreams!” Feng Wu slapped Bu Jingyu on the head. “Don’t even think about it!”"]},{"number":3290,"title":"Chapter 3290 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (5)","paragraphs":["3290 Who Is Chu Tianxiao Looking For? (5)","“Ouch!”","Rubbing his head, Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu accusingly. “I didn’t say I wanted to marry you. The little girl in the painting looks so cute and obedient. She won’t be as fierce as you! Hmph!”","Feng Wu said, “Cut the crap. What does Chu Tianxiao want with this girl?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I don’t know. The maid didn’t say.”","!!","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s your maid?”","Bu Jingyu said sadly, “She’s dead.”","Feng Wu asked, “How?”","Bu Jingyu shook his head and didn’t say much.","“My mother is already dead, and my maid is also dead. You can’t get any answers.” Bu Jingyu rolled up the painting and wrapped it up layer by layer. He was very careful, afraid that he would leave marks.","“This is my life-saving charm,” Bu Jingyu said solemnly to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple, thinking, “Your real life-saving charm is right in front of you, okay?”","But Feng Wu wouldn’t tell anyone that.","Would he...","She thought that Chu Tianxiao might be looking for her out of good intentions, but what if...","Therefore, Feng Wu decided to hide her identity and wait to see what happened.","She looked up and saw it was getting dark outside.","She wouldn’t be staying in Sun Castle for long, so she had to act as soon as possible.","Hence, Feng Wu asked Bu Jingyu, “Do you know where the golden leg bone is?”","Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in distress. “Don’t tell me you want to take the golden leg bone with you as well.”","Feng Wu said, “Why not?”","Bu Jingyu said, “It’s in the main courtyard, where the crown prince is. It’s heavily guarded and the place is rife with danger. Do you really want to take it? I advise you not to.”","Feng Wu asked, “What about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I think you’re going to die this time.”","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?”","Bu Jingyu said, “You stole the last one, so this time, Master set layers of traps to confuse you people who want to snatch the Immortal Spiritual Fruit. I don’t know where the fruit is, and Master definitely won’t tell me. I know my second eldest brother is determined to get it this time as well.","“That’s because if the crown prince dies, the second prince will be the most outstanding person among the princes, and he’ll most likely take the throne.","“Master even suspects that the loss of the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit was the work of the second prince in cooperation with the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu said, “Your Master sure is imaginative.”","Bu Jingyu said, “But Master will never know it was you.”","Feng Wu said, “And you.”","Bu Jingyu glared at Feng Wu. “I already tried to talk you out of it, but you won’t listen and insist on getting yourself killed. What else can I do?”","Just then, Feng Wu asked, “Where’s the armory?”","Bu Jingyu stared at Feng Wu with wide eyes.","Feng Wu grinned.","Bu Jingyu said, “You... Forget it, I don’t want to talk to you. Go get killed!”","At first, he had thought Feng Wu was here for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, but he had never expected that she was after more than that fruit.","Apart from the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she also wanted the golden leg bone and the flying fighter jet.","He had no choice but to admire her.","Bu Jingyu pretended he didn’t know anything, but by then, Feng Wu had already gone out.","The first place she had to go was the main courtyard.","Feng Wu had made sure to put on some disguise when she left. She was dressed in black, covering herself with a black scarf and a black hat and leaving only her eyes visible."]},{"number":3291,"title":"Chapter 3291 Night Visit","paragraphs":["3291 Night Visit","Her eyes were also disguised.","So, as long as she wasn’t caught red-handed, she could dash off, put away her night clothes, and turn into Bu Jingyu again.","Feng Wu ran through the night like a cat.","Because Zhu Yi had walked the route with her earlier in the day and Feng Wu had a good memory, she soon reached the main courtyard.","!!","Xue Zhibei used to live in the main courtyard, but the crown prince lived there now.","Xue Zhibei moved to Wind Snow Tower in the east.","Mr. Sakiya lived in the left courtyard in the south. Bu Jingyu and Zhu Yi also lived with him. Mo Lan had also moved in.","The rest of the military officers lived in the west.","As for the north side, the stewards, maids and servants all lived there together.","Because of what Bu Jingyu said, Feng Wu went straight to the main courtyard.","She was ready for action.","The crown prince was unconscious, and his brothers all wanted to kill him so that they could survive. Therefore, they would definitely take this opportunity to assassinate the crown prince.","This was a Grand Battle Royale. If only one person could survive, then in order to survive, everyone would become even more ferocious than wild beasts.","That was how Night Owl’s brothers were right now. They couldn’t wait to take out Night Owl, who sat firmly in his position as the crown prince.","At the entrance of the main courtyard, a row of guards stood in a line, guarding the door.","These guards were the Violent Blade Guards that Mr. Sakiya had trained for Night Owl!","There were a total of ten of them, and all of them were extremely ferocious.","Feng Wu hid in the shadows of some rocks nearby, trying to figure out a way to sneak in without anyone noticing.","At that moment, a cold voice rang out.","“Since you’re here, why don’t you come out and meet me?”","Mr. Sakiya’s voice!","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","She hadn’t even thought of a way in, but Mr. Sakiya had already noticed her. Just as she was wondering if she should run away, a figure flew past her and charged forward!","Wherever he passed, a cold light flashed!","The light came from the sword in his hand!","Feng Wu was speechless.","So, the person Mr. Sakiya was referring to wasn’t her.","That made sense. To make Mr. Sakiya wary, a person should be at least a Spiritual Overlord.","The person flying over her head was a Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Wu wasn’t sure about that person’s exact level.","She only saw a flash of light as the man flew past the guards.","Although the ten guards in a row were clad in golden armor and held long sabers in their hands, they were actually unable to resist the enemy’s attack. In an instant, all ten heads were cut off, and blood spewed out from their headless bodies. It was bloody and terrifying!","Feng Wu had two choices.","Should she take the opportunity to enter, or turn around and escape?","Feng Wu chose the first option without hesitation.","An expert had drawn Mr. Sakiya’s attention. If she didn’t sneak in now, she wouldn’t find such a good opportunity again!","At that thought, Feng Wu flipped and entered the main courtyard.","It was a courtyard with all the necessary houses.","Near the door was a house facing the opposite direction. On the left and right sides were the east and west wings. Beyond them was the main room.","Feng Wu remembered what Bu Jingyu had said when she was about to leave.","There was a secret passage under the east wing that was suitable for hiding things.","However, Feng Wu saw that the defense formation in the west wing was more rigorous."]},{"number":3292,"title":"Chapter 3292 Lone Sword","paragraphs":["3292 Lone Sword","“Mr. Sakiya!” Feng Wu thought to herself.","The east wing was facing the west.","In the dark, Feng Wu tiptoed toward the east wing without hesitation.","However, before Feng Wu could rush into the east wing, an invisible shockwave spread out from the courtyard with Mr. Sakiya at the center.","It was such a terrifying power!","In an instant, Feng Wu was almost sent flying away!","Pffft!","Feng Wu spat out a mouthful of blood.","Just then, the golden bead which Feng Wu had received from the Sacred Imperial Spider blocked the attack for her.","That was why Feng Wu was still alive.","Otherwise, she would have long turned into a pile of pulp.","Feng Wu patted her chest with lingering fear and heaved a sigh of relief. She felt like she had just survived a disaster, and her heart gradually calmed down.","In fact, Mr. Sakiya’s shockwave wasn’t directed at her.","It was directed at the swordsman who had tried to assassinate Mr. Sakiya.","Feng Wu tried to move, only to find that the air around her seemed to have frozen. In this space, the gravity was more than twice as heavy.","She felt like she was pinned to the ground and couldn’t move a step.","To make it worse, she felt as if there was a mountain pressing down on her head. Her blood was boiling, and she was on the verge of exploding.","Her breathing involuntarily became heavier.","However, in order not to be discovered, Feng Wu had to restrain herself with her strong willpower as she breathed slowly.","Sweat the size of soybeans rolled down her cheeks, and her back was soaked.","The shockwave came from Mr. Sakiya, but the pressure came from the mysterious swordsman.","Feng Wu couldn’t take the battle between two Spiritual Overlords anymore.","The only good thing was that Feng Wu was hiding in the shadow of a pillar. The moon was blocked by the clouds, so no one would notice her if they didn’t pay attention.","But she still could be discovered at any time.","Anxious, Feng Wu took a step forward with difficulty. Her lungs hurt so much that she almost fell to the ground!","Meanwhile, Mr. Sakiya was confronting the swordsman.","“Lone Sword, do you have a death wish?!” Sitting in his wheelchair, Mr. Sakiya stared at his opponent with cold eyes.","He looked slightly pale, but his eyes were wise, firm and calm.","?","Feng Wu had never heard of this name before, but he was very famous in the Dongsang Kingdom.","He would always strike once only.","His strongest killing move was called “One Strike.”","Once the strike was made, he would leave immediately, regardless of victory or defeat.","Therefore, he was known as the Lone Sword.","Right now, Lone Sword stared at Mr. Sakiya and said, “There’s a price on your head.”","Mr. Sakiya looked at him indifferently. “No one can afford me.”","shook his head. “You have a price.”","Mr. Sakiya said, “I’d like to ask, who’s the bidder? What’s the price?”","was gearing up for his strongest killing move.","Therefore, he didn’t answer Mr. Sakiya’s question.","Just then!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Strong and sonorous footsteps rushed over like thunder!","It was the Violent Blade Guards.","Mr. Sakiya had personally trained them for the crown prince, Night Owl.","“I’m late. Sorry about this, Mr. Sakiya!”","The leader was the head of the Violent Blade Guards. He was over two meters tall, burly, and majestic. A violent power seemed to pour out of him!"]},{"number":3293,"title":"Chapter 3293 Earth-Shattering","paragraphs":["3293 Earth-Shattering","He was wearing heavy armor and a helmet, leaving only his eyes exposed.","It only took one look for Feng Wu to know that the leader of the Violent Blade Guards was a cultivator who specialized in physical strength!","That made sense.","Since he was a Violent Blade Guard, he was naturally of that type.","Seeing that a fight was about to break out, Feng Wu gripped the Phoenix Pen and started drawing.","However, under such gravity, even her hand shook. How could she quickly draw anything?","Writing a word became the most difficult thing.","Feng Wu felt like she was soaking in water. The pain was so intense that she felt numb.","But she couldn’t stop.","Because she knew very well that if she didn’t hide inside the inscription formation in the east wing, she wouldn’t be able to withstand Lone Sword’s attack!","He had yet to make a move, but she couldn’t take it anymore.","Indeed, Mr. Sakiya said to Kuang Feng, the leader of the Violent Blade Guards, “Back off.”","A group of people moved in unison.","The 30 Violent Blade Guards fanned out and surrounded Mr. Sakiya!","“Sir, the Divine Crossbow Squad is late. Please forgive us!”","Feng Wu turned around and saw the archers. They were all dressed in leather armor, and their crossbows looked like bats.","They were made of some steel which Feng Wu didn’t recognize, but she recognized the strings.","They were the tendons from the back of the flood dragon. After being soaked in glue for several years, they finally became incomparably tough enough to be made into crossbow strings!","This kind of string had a special characteristic. It was tough and powerful. It gave each crossbow a long range and a strong penetrative power, and the arrow’s trajectory would be extremely accurate!","There were also 30 members in the Divine Crossbow Squad.","With a look from Mr. Sakiya, they ran behind him and spread out to the two wings. They each put a leg forward and held a divine crossbow in their hands. Once the arrows were set, the soldiers aimed them at Lone Sword!","As soon as the order was given, the divine crossbows would fire at the same time!","The sharp arrowheads were all aimed at Lone Sword.","Feng Wu didn’t know what Lone Sword’s strike felt like; she just knew that even though the sword wasn’t aimed at her, she still felt as if she was in an ice cellar!","The Phoenix Pen moved faster.","The more anxious Feng Wu was, the steadier her grip became.","Lone Sword stared at Mr. Sakiya with cold eyes.","As a swordsman, there was nothing else in his eyes but his goal.","He didn’t have any unnecessary expressions or words. He only cared about the sword in his hand!","Just then, he finally found the best moment!","“One Strike!”","Lone Sword pointed his sword at Mr. Sakiya, and the blade glinted.","His body seemed to turn into a sharp blade, becoming one with the sword!","He charged at Mr. Sakiya at lightning speed!","That awe-inspiring killing intent and the terrifying gravity felt as if a storm had enveloped the sky!","The Divine Crossbow Squad and Violet Blade Guards behind Mr. Sakiya felt their blood churn, and they nearly lost their balance.","However, they were well-trained. Even though they were about to faint, they still firmly held their ground!","The members of the Divine Crossbow Squad held their crossbows steady.","The arrows didn’t shake at all!","How hard had they trained to be able to do this?","Feng Wu was alarmed when she saw that.","The Dongsang Kingdom was indeed a terrifying enemy!","When Lone Sword stabbed at Mr. Sakiya, Mr. Sakiya also launched a counterattack!","Feng Wu finally broke the formation in the east wing and darted inside.","Whoosh!","The moment Feng Wu jumped in, the energy outside exploded!","The entire space shook violently!","The ground trembled!","At that moment, it was as if a Heavenly God had unleashed their might, and the world collapsed!"]},{"number":3294,"title":"Chapter 3294 Golden Leg Bone (1)","paragraphs":["3294 Golden Leg Bone (1)","Luckily, Feng Wu had already jumped into the formation.","Ripples spread out from the inscriptions of the formation, which relieved a lot of the pressure on Feng Wu.","She knew very well that the battle outside would be over soon, and it wouldn’t be so easy for her to do anything then.","Hence, she had to be quick!","It would be best if she could find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit and the golden leg bone here. This way, her mission would be completed, and she could immediately be on her way.","However...","Feng Wu knew she would have to be the goddess of luck for that to happen.","It was pitch-black in the east wing, so dark that she couldn’t even see her fingers.","Feng Wu didn’t dare light a flame.","There was a commotion outside. Mr. Sakiya, Lone Sword, the Violent Blade Guards and the Divine Crossbow Squad were all there. Even the slightest movement from her would attract their attention.","Feng Wu could see in the dark. Although not all that clearly, she was much better than other people.","Soon, she realized that there was something wrong with a candlestick.","She gently turned the third candlestick.","As expected, she heard a soft click, and a staircase slowly appeared.","Without further ado, Feng Wu hurried into the basement.","Just as Bu Jingyu had said, this basement was indeed the armory.","Looking around, Feng Wu saw wooden shelves with inscriptions on them.","She took out a random sword and glanced at it.","A Level 7 inscription weapon!","A Level 8 inscription weapon!","Feng Wu was tempted.","An inscription weapon wasn’t something she could draw casually with the Phoenix Pen since it required a blueprint, engravings, coloring, and so on. The entire process was very time-consuming.","Therefore, every inscription sword was a treasure.","And now...","There were at least a hundred of them here!","All of them were more advanced than the five inscription swords that Feng Xun had won at the cost of his life!","With a hundred inscription weapons, the strength of the Junwu Empire would increase at an unprecedented rate!","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow.","“I’m sorry, I’ll take them all.”","She picked up all the inscription weapons on the shelves and put them in her storage bag.","The storage bag that Jun Linyuan had given her was very useful. It could hold all kinds of inanimate objects.","As for the storage space where her beautiful master was, Feng Wu wouldn’t use it easily, for fear of blaspheming her master.","Feng Wu then saw wooden boxes stacked against the walls around the shelves.","Out of curiosity, Feng Wu went up to take a look.","The wooden boxes were locked.","They weren’t iron locks but inscription locks.","Feng Wu was over the moon.","A complicated black iron lock might stop her, but an inscription lock wouldn’t.","Carefully, Feng Wu opened the boxes.","These wooden boxes were all about the same size, about half a meter tall and over 1.5 meters long.","Feng Wu looked inside.","She was overjoyed!","What was inside? Inscription bombs!","Mu Yan had given Feng Wu a few samples before, so Feng Wu recognized them immediately. They were inscription bombs!","If Mu Yan hadn’t given her any, Feng Wu might not have known.","Feng Wu opened every wooden box.","They were all filled with inscription bombs.","There were 24 inscription bombs in one box.","There was a total of 24 wooden boxes placed against the wall.","Therefore, there was a total of 576 inscription bombs!","This was a huge number!","How could she leave any for her enemies? She took them all.","Feng Wu was a little frustrated.","There wasn’t enough space in the storage bag that Jun Linyuan had given her...","..."]},{"number":3295,"title":"Chapter 3295 Golden Leg Bone (2)","paragraphs":["3295 Golden Leg Bone (2)","After putting away the 24 large wooden boxes, there was less than 10 square meters left.","She had to use it sparingly.","Right, the golden leg bone.","Feng Wu quickly looked around.","She didn’t forget she had taken a huge risk to come down to the basement for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit and the golden leg bone.","She walked around, but there was no scent of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit here, so she could forget about that.","The golden leg bone...","The golden leg bone...","Feng Wu couldn’t find it in the dark. She was about to leave, when she heard a voice in her head.","“Are you really blind?”","It was Little Phoenix’s voice!","“You’re awake?!” Feng Wu said excitedly to Little Phoenix in her head.","When Little Phoenix played the role of the powerful Master Phoenix to deceive the Sacred Imperial Spider, it had used too much energy and had to go back to its space to recuperate. Now, it finally woke up.","Little Phoenix said, “If I hadn’t woken up, you would have left this treasure cave empty-handed! I was so mad that I had to wake up!”","Feng Wu said, “But I can take away a lot of inscription weapons and bombs.”","Little Phoenix rolled its eyes. “Those things are good for you right now, but they’re not treasures.”","Feng Wu said, “I know, but I’ve already emptied out this place. There’s nothing else.”","Little Phoenix rolled its eyes. “Are you really blind?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Little Phoenix asked, “Can’t you see what’s hanging on the wall on your left?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s a painting! No, it’s not!”","As she got closer, Feng Wu realized that it was a piece of bone.","Little Phoenix said, “That’s the golden leg bone you’ve been longing for.”","Feng Wu asked, “It’s so small!”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s not about the quantity, but the quality. Once it’s refined and fused with a human bone, the power will increase by 200%!”","Without another word, Feng Wu stuffed the golden leg bone into her storage space. Then, she dashed out of the formation and into the night.","By the time Feng Wu rushed out, the battle between Lone Sword and Mr. Sakiya had already ended.","Lone Sword could no longer use a sword.","Because!","His sword never touched Mr. Sakiya.","But Mr. Sakiya broke Lone Sword’s defense and punched him in the head.","Lone Sword staggered to the ground and spat out blood, and he couldn’t get up again.","He vomited blood and said, “I can’t kill you today, but others will...”","As soon as he said that, Feng Wu jumped out of the east wing, broke the formation, and charged out of the great general’s residence!","Everyone was shocked!","Mr. Sakiya, the Violent Blade Guards, the Divine Crossbow Squad, and Lone Sword...","They all subconsciously raised their heads and looked at the figure that flew past!","Lone Sword seemed to have a thought.","So did Mr. Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya wanted to capture Lone Sword. By then, Lone Sword had already used his sword energy to pierce his energy channels!","Finally, he collapsed.","He couldn’t be any more dead.","Lone Sword thought the second prince had sent someone to follow him and attack the crown prince, Night Owl.","Mr. Sakiya also believed someone sent by the second prince had taken the opportunity to attack the crown prince, Night Owl.","“Divine Crossbow Squad, fire!","“Violent Blade Guards, hunt that person down!”","As for Mr. Sakiya, he quickly turned around and rushed in to see the crown prince!"]},{"number":3296,"title":"Chapter 3296 Who Did It?","paragraphs":["3296 Who Did It?","As for Mr. Sakiya, he quickly turned around and rushed in to see the crown prince!","The Divine Crossbow Squad indeed shot the arrows.","However, the person was too fast and streaked past like a meteor. Their range was limited, so the arrows missed.","The Violent Blade Guards had already drawn their sabers and rushed out.","Mr. Sakiya was worried about the crown prince, so he was the first to rush in to look at him.","There was naturally someone guarding the crown prince in the room.","After all, they only had one crown prince. They couldn’t afford to lose him.","“The crown prince is fine.”","Only then did Mr. Sakiya slowly calm down.","He was too anxious just now. This wasn’t how he would usually act.","Mr. Sakiya surveyed his surroundings. There was nothing missing from the inner room, but his heart was in his mouth.","Something didn’t feel right.","He stood on the porch and looked around.","In the middle of the courtyard was Lone Sword’s corpse.","On the left and right sides of the courtyard were the east and west wing rooms. There were some things inside, although not much...","Ssss!","Mr. Sakiya immediately felt something was amiss.","“Mr. Sakiya, what’s wrong?” Mu Yan chased after him.","At this moment, Zhu Yi also rushed in from outside.","“Master?”","When Mr. Sakiya saw Zhu Yi, he frowned even more. He pointed at the east wing and said, “Let’s take a look inside.”","“Yes.”","Zhu Yi knew that their backup weapons were hidden here and wouldn’t be activated easily. If they were activated, that meant that they were facing real trouble in battle.","Also, the golden leg bone was inside.","As the formation here was natural and rich in spiritual essence, it was the best way to maintain the spiritual essence of the golden leg bone. Therefore, Mr. Sakiya casually placed the golden leg bone inside.","No one had considered the possibility of it being stolen, since this was the main courtyard where the crown prince, Night Owl, lived, and which Mr. Sakiya guarded.","Moreover, there were layers of protection from a Level 8 formation and inscriptions. How could it be lost?","But now —","“Master!”","Zhu Yi was stunned when he saw the empty basement.","This couldn’t be happening.","How was this possible?","Mr. Sakiya was waiting for Zhu Yi to report, and the latter called out to him with a hint of panic in his voice.","Mr. Sakiya had personally taught Zhu Yi and knew what kind of temperament he had. It was definitely not a small matter to make Zhu Yi panic.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t delay and immediately entered the room.","Mu Yan was instantly curious. What was going on?","No one stopped her, so she quickly followed.","When she saw the rows of empty shelves and corners of the underground treasury, she was stunned.","“No way! I remember when I came down previously, there were inscription weapons on the shelves! And in this corner, there were large boxes of inscription bombs!”","No one answered Mu Yan.","Mu Yan continued, “Why did they suddenly disappear? Mr. Sakiya, were you in the courtyard just now?”","Now that Mu Yan had her master’s support, she became arrogant again.","Still, no one answered her.","However, Mu Yan felt great.","It turned out Mr. Sakiya could wear such an ugly expression.","Mr. Sakiya stared at Zhu Yi.","Zhu Yi’s expression was very ugly. “Master... the golden leg bone...”","Mr. Sakiya’s face darkened. “You didn’t refine it?”","Zhu Yi smiled bitterly. “I already had something going on and was about to come over to refine the golden leg bone. Who knew...”","Mr. Sakiya was at a loss for words.","He could only wave at Zhu Yi. “It seems the golden leg bone isn’t meant for the crown prince.”"]},{"number":3297,"title":"Chapter 3297 Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["3297 Immortal Spiritual Fruit","He accepted it.","However, Zhu Yi found it difficult to calm down. Jingyu had given up the golden leg bone. If Zhu Yi had refined it back then, none of this would have happened.","Mr. Sakiya’s face was as dark as water. No one knew what he was thinking.","“Master, who do you think it was?” Zhu Yi asked.","Mu Yan looked at Zhu Yi as if she was looking at a retard. “Who? Isn’t it obvious? It was someone sent by the second prince! Didn’t Lone Sword accept the second prince’s bounty and try to kill your Master?”","Lone Sword? Zhu Yi didn’t know what had happened yet.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t admit or deny it. His eyebrows knitted tightly together as he stared at the destroyed inscription, his eyes flickering.","Zhu Yi stared at the spot where the inscription was destroyed and asked Mr. Sakiya, “Is it possible that it was done by the Junwu Empire to frame the second prince?”","Mu Yan’s eyes flashed!","The first person she thought of was Feng Wu!","However, Mr. Sakiya said to Zhu Yi, “have a feel of this aura.”","Zhu Yi went up to take a closer look and really found a faint aura.","“That person was from Dongsang.” Zhu Yi was very certain.","Because this was the aura of the people of Dongsang.","“It has the aura of a magical plant,” Zhu Yi confirmed again.","Mr. Sakiya nodded.","Zhu Yi said, “This person is proficient in formations and inscriptions and is also a wood element cultivator. It’s not difficult to track such a person down. I remember the second prince has such a person by his side.”","It was the second prince’s master, Supreme Master Wood.","“Master, could it be Supreme Master Wood?” The more Zhu Yi thought about it, the more he felt it was possible.","“But would Supreme Master Wood take away these inscription weapons and inscription bombs?” Mu Yan was puzzled.","Zhu Yi said, “What if he’s deliberately trying to confuse us so that we wouldn’t think it’s him?”","Mr. Sakiya let out a long sigh and instructed Zhu Yi, “Find out who it was.”","Zhu Yi received the order and left.","Mu Yan wanted to say something, but Mr. Sakiya had already turned around and headed for the left side of the courtyard where he lived.","After running out of the yard, Feng Wu soon started to play hide-and-seek.","As long as she could find a corner to conceal herself, she could turn into another person. So, how could they catch her?","However, at this moment, she had no intention of leaving because she still had very important things to do.","She didn’t know where Mr. Sakiya had placed the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","A small Immortal Spiritual Fruit would be easy to hide. Others wouldn’t be able to find it easily.","Unfortunately for Sakiya, the Immortal Spiritual Fruit was still on the Immortal Spirit Tree and had yet to mature. Therefore, even if Mr. Sakiya transplanted the tree, he would definitely need a place to plant it.","So, where was this place?","Feng Wu didn’t know, but Mr. Sakiya did.","That was why she had rushed out in front of Mr. Sakiya and Lone Sword. It was to make Mr. Sakiya panic.","As for the damaged inscription, Feng Wu had left it there on purpose.","Where was Feng Wu now?","She was hiding in Mr. Sakiya’s left courtyard.","Feng Wu knew very well that a cautious man like Mr. Sakiya wouldn’t choose to build the secret passage in the main courtyard, which was crowded with people. He would most likely choose his own courtyard.","Therefore, Feng Wu hid in the left courtyard as soon as possible and waited for Mr. Sakiya to arrive.","She was right.","Less than five minutes, Mr. Sakiya pushed open the door and entered.","Feng Wu held her breath, not daring to make a sound."]},{"number":3298,"title":"Chapter 3298 Mr. Sakiya’s Secret","paragraphs":["3298 Mr. Sakiya’s Secret","Mr. Sakiya immediately went to the dry well in the backyard and jumped in...","Before long, Mr. Sakiya opened the door from inside the house and walked out.","The dry well was connected to the inner room.","Mr. Sakiya looked back at the yard before leaving.","!!","He came and left in a hurry.","The courtyard door closed, and there was total silence.","At some point, the moonlight that was originally covered by thick clouds poured down, and the entire courtyard could be seen clearly.","Hidden in the dark, Feng Wu didn’t move.","Her gaze was fixed on the dry well.","The first thing Mr. Sakiya did was enter the dry well. Logically speaking, the Immortal Spirit Fruit Tree was very likely related to it.","But Feng Wu had a feeling that something was wrong.","Therefore, she didn’t walk toward the dry well, but hid in the darkness.","15 minutes, 30 minutes, 45 minutes...","Time crawled by.","The feeling of being watched was still there.","It didn’t disappear for a long time.","Therefore, Feng Wu didn’t go out.","Two hours, four hours...","The sky was about to brighten. Right now, it was the darkest moment before dawn.","All of a sudden, Feng Wu felt the prickling sensation disappear.","As expected!","Someone was watching the courtyard.","Someone was still watching now, but the person with the highest cultivation level was gone.","Feng Wu wondered if it was Mr. Sakiya who had given her that feeling.","Now, she was certain Mr. Sakiya had left. The remaining people were all focused on the dry well.","Feng Wu rolled on the ground and snuck into the house.","She then nimbly entered Mr. Sakiya’s inner chamber.","Since the dry well was connected to the inner chamber, she could enter the dry well from there.","After entering Mr. Sakiya’s inner chamber, Feng Wu became more cautious.","Given Mr. Sakiya’s sharp senses, he would know if anything in the room was moved.","As expected!","Feng Wu saw a seal made of hair on the doorknob.","Others might not be able to see it, but in Feng Wu’s eyes, there were markings everywhere in the room.","If there was nothing important in a person’s room, there wouldn’t be any markings.","However, if there was something that was coveted by other people, he would definitely protect it with multiple means.","Feng Wu looked around the room.","A cabinet, a table, a chair, a bed...","After eliminating them one by one, Feng Wu noticed a teapot.","The clay pot and four small teacups looked normal, but —","There was a little bit of drying moisture on the tip of the clay teapot and on the table.","Feng Wu immediately knew Mr. Sakiya had moved the teapot earlier.","After locking onto her target, Feng Wu began to study the teapot.","Indeed, there was a small formation embedded in it.","Mr. Sakiya was indeed a capable man. He hid it so well.","Ordinary people wouldn’t notice anything when pouring tea out of the teapot.","After a thorough search, Feng Wu finally found a small protrusion at the bottom of the teapot.","There were a total of nine words.","Feng Wu soon found the third word in the first line.","She pressed down on it.","There was no sound.","However, a door on the wall opened automatically.","Why did Feng Wu find the third word on the first line? The answer was simple. Mr. Sakiya’s fingerprint was on it.","Seeing the door open, Feng Wu smiled a little.","“Mr. Sakiya, what secrets are you hiding behind this wall?”","..."]},{"number":3299,"title":"Chapter 3299 Secret (1)","paragraphs":["3299 Secret (1)","“Mr. Sakiya, what secrets are you hiding behind this wall?”","While Mr. Sakiya was in the crown prince’s courtyard, Feng Wu hurried into the underground passage.","However, she was very cautious.","Mr. Sakiya was a very cautious person. He would be able to spot any clues Feng Wu left behind.","Hence, Feng Wu closed the door and flew in.","At first, it was a flight of stone steps that wound down. Feng Wu counted them, and after 99 steps, she finally reached the bottom.","When she stood on the ground, what she saw shocked her.","Was that an underground network of roads?","Feng Wu saw paths stretching out, and she seemed to be standing at the center of the hub.","There weren’t many paths; Feng Wu counted eight in total.","It was as if a watermelon had been divided into the same eight portions by four threads, and she was at the center.","Feng Wu had never expected to see such a scene.","She had thought she would see the Immortal Spiritual Tree.","However, she had a vague feeling that Mr. Sakiya must have hidden the Immortal Spiritual Fruit on one of the eight paths.","The cunning Mr. Sakiya must be trying to prevent others from stealing the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu took a step forward...","Soon, she shook her head.","The ground in front of her was a huge formation. If she didn’t know the route in advance, it would be as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","Just then, Feng Wu heard a soft voice.","Someone was here!","Feng Wu didn’t dare reveal her identity, not even as Bu Jingyu.","Hence, she darted into the formation and hid behind a pile of rocks.","At that moment, two people appeared where Feng Wu had been standing.","Feng Wu looked up and saw the two of them had their faces covered. She couldn’t see what they looked like, but they were both quite capable.","Both of them were Level 7 Spiritual Lords.","When they saw these eight paths, a trace of satisfaction immediately appeared in their eyes!","The slightly taller person took out a sheepskin scroll from his pocket. After unfolding it, he took a look and said to the person beside him, “Zhui, look, it’s here!”","Zhui checked the scroll, and his eyes were filled with excitement!","“The information provided by the captain is right. The manufacturing factory is here! Meng, we’re going to make a great contribution this time!”","“Let’s go. We’ll take the lead and find out the exact location. Then, our mission will be complete. After that, the captain will definitely ask the second prince to record our meritorious deeds!”","Zhui and Meng quickly entered the formation and chose one of the paths.","Zhui? Meng? Captain? The second prince? The manufacturing factory?","Feng Wu extracted all the keywords and mumbled under her breath.","She understood everything now.","Although Lone Sword had come to assassinate Mr. Sakiya, he was actually the first wave of cannon fodder sent by the second prince to restrain Mr. Sakiya.","These two people were the ones carrying out the second prince’s real mission.","With the map in their hands, they chose the path that led east and immediately dashed off.","Feng Wu noticed a number on the east side: 3.","Looking left and right, she realized that there was a pattern to these roads.","Like a clock, the path to the north had the number one on it."]},{"number":3300,"title":"Chapter 3300 Secret (2)","paragraphs":["3300 Secret (2)","The path to the north had the number 1 on it. The path to the northeast had the number 2. 3 was on the path due east, and so on.","Meng and Zhui chose path 3.","Was it the right direction?","Would path 3 be safe?","Sitting down, Feng Wu began to work on the formation.","She didn’t trust anything but the Phoenix Pen in her hand and the inscriptions her beautiful master had taught her.","Feng Wu worked very quickly. In less than 15 minutes, she had eliminated the other seven paths.","Because those seven paths were all lethal traps.","In other words, only one of these eight paths was safe.","Night Owl and Mr. Sakiya were so ruthless!","Feng Wu rose to her feet and chased after the two men.","With the second prince’s Meng and Zhui taking the lead, Feng Wu felt less in awe of the unknown.","Feng Wu thought to herself, “Those two men are Level 7 Spiritual Lords, but they’re so fast that even ordinary Spiritual Overlords may not be able to catch up to them.”","This type of cultivator was most suitable for tracking and investigation.","Feng Wu was still thinking about that when a light appeared in front of her.","She realized she was almost at the end of the road, and there was a cluster of buildings at the end.","At the end of the path was a mountain. The people here had hollowed out the middle of the mountain and dug out a building complex.","Feng Wu was on high ground. She looked down from above and saw that the building complex was about 500,000 square meters in size. She could see houses everywhere.","The houses were neither luxurious nor exquisite. Instead, they were built with very rough stones.","However, Feng Wu saw people coming in and out of the room, looking very busy.","Wait...","What was that?","Feng Wu saw ten people struggling to carry something covered in a black cloth out.","Judging from the outline of the black cloth, Feng Wu realized it was a fighter jet!","A fighter jet?","Seriously?","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","A few hours ago, when she moved the inscription weapons and inscription bombs from the underground warehouse in the east wing of the main courtyard into her storage space, she had wished there were some fighter jets there.","However, she was looking at a fighter jet right now.","There were ten people carrying it. It had to be a fighter jet!","Feng Wu was envious!","She remembered very clearly that the Junwu Empire lacked the technology and couldn’t even make a fighter jet. But now —","In front of her —","Could this be a fighter jet manufacturing factory?","Feng Wu was dumbfounded. What kind of luck was that?","She felt like the daughter of the God of Luck.","Just as Feng Wu was getting dizzy from excitement, two people jumped at her and were about to attack her!","Feng Wu realized what was going on!","It was the two people she had seen at the intersection!","Feng Wu knew they were treating her as their enemy.","Although they were indeed enemies...","“Zhui! Meng! What are you doing?!”","Feng Wu moved as fast as she could when they charged at her. She reprimanded them in the Dongsang language in a low voice and kicked them away at the same time!","It was true that Feng Wu was a Level 6 Spiritual Lord, and it was also true that they were Level 7 ones.","But —","After all, Feng Wu wasn’t only invincible among her peers, she could also defeat opponents above her level.","Moreover, she was so fast that she sent them flying before they could react."]}]);
